text: ['({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', "Activated abilities of creatures you control cost {2} less to activate. This effect can't reduce the mana in that cost to less than one mana.", "After the first postcombat main phase this turn, there's an additional combat phase followed by an additional main phase. At the beginning of that combat, untap all creatures that attacked this turn.\\nRebound (If you cast this spell from your hand, exile it as it resolves. At the beginning of your next upkeep, you may cast this card from exile without paying its mana cost.)", 'All creatures get -1/-1 until end of turn.', 'Annihilator 1 (Whenever this creature attacks, defending player sacrifices a permanent.)\\n{4}: Create two 0/1 colorless Eldrazi Spawn creature tokens. They have "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}."\\n{20}: Cast any number of Eldrazi spells from among cards you own outside the game without paying their mana costs.', "Annihilator 2 (Whenever this creature attacks, defending player sacrifices two permanents.)\\nUlamog's Crusher attacks each combat if able.", 'Annihilator 2 (Whenever this creature attacks, defending player sacrifices two permanents.)\\nWhenever an opponent sacrifices a nontoken permanent, put that card onto the battlefield under your control.', "Annihilator 3 (Whenever this creature attacks, defending player sacrifices three permanents.)\\nPathrazer of Ulamog can't be blocked except by three or more creatures.", 'As Curse of Wizardry enters the battlefield, choose a color.\\nWhenever a player casts a spell of the chosen color, that player loses 1 life.', "As an additional cost to cast this spell, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\nCounter target spell.", "As an additional cost to cast this spell, reveal a creature card from your hand.\\nDisaster Radius deals X damage to each creature your opponents control, where X is the revealed card's mana value.", "As an additional cost to cast this spell, reveal a creature card from your hand.\\nTarget creature gets -X/-X until end of turn, where X is the revealed card's mana value.", "As an additional cost to cast this spell, reveal a creature card from your hand.\\nYou gain life equal to the revealed card's mana value.", 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice X lands.\\nCreate two X/X red Elemental creature tokens.', "As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature.\\nYou draw cards equal to the sacrificed creature's power, then you gain life equal to its toughness.", 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, tap four untapped creatures you control.\\nDraw three cards.', 'At the beginning of combat on your turn, you may have target creature get +2/+0 until end of turn.', "At the beginning of your end step, you may reveal the top card of your library. If you do, each opponent loses life equal to that card's mana value.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if you have exactly 1 life, you win the game.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you may create a 0/1 colorless Eldrazi Spawn creature token. It has "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}."', 'Attach target Aura you control to target creature.\\nDraw a card.', 'Auras attached to permanents you control have totem armor. (If an enchanted permanent you control would be destroyed, instead remove all damage from it and destroy an Aura attached to it.)', "Choose any target. Reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal a nonland card. Explosive Revelation deals damage equal to that card's mana value to that permanent or player. Put the nonland card into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.", 'Choose one or both —\\n• Destroy target artifact.\\n• Destroy target nonbasic land.', 'Choose one —\\n• Tap X target permanents.\\n• Untap X target permanents.', "Counter target spell if you control more creatures than that spell's controller.", 'Counter target spell or ability that targets a permanent you control.\\nThis spell costs {7} less to cast if it targets a spell or ability that targets a creature you control with power 7 or greater.', "Counter target spell. Look at its controller's hand.", 'Create X X/X green Ooze creature tokens.', 'Create a 1/1 white Kor Soldier creature token for each creature you control.\\nRebound (If you cast this spell from your hand, exile it as it resolves. At the beginning of your next upkeep, you may cast this card from exile without paying its mana cost.)', 'Create five 0/1 colorless Eldrazi Spawn creature tokens. They have "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}."', 'Creatures with flying get +2/+0.\\nCreatures without flying get -2/-0.', "Creatures with power less than Aura Gnarlid's power can't block it.\\nAura Gnarlid gets +1/+1 for each Aura on the battlefield.", 'Deathtouch (Any amount of damage this deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)', 'Defender', 'Defender, flying', 'Defender, flying\\nPrevent all combat damage that would be dealt to Guard Gomazoa.', 'Defender, flying\\n{1}{R}: Target creature attacks this turn if able.', 'Defender\\nOther creatures you control with defender get +0/+2.', 'Defender\\nWhen Mnemonic Wall enters the battlefield, you may return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Defender\\nWhen Phantasmal Abomination becomes the target of a spell or ability, sacrifice it.', 'Defender\\nWhen Wall of Omens enters the battlefield, draw a card.', 'Defender\\n{1}{R}, {T}: Vent Sentinel deals damage to target player or planeswalker equal to the number of creatures you control with defender.', 'Defender\\n{T}: Add {G} for each creature you control with defender.', 'Defender\\n{T}: Prevent the next 1 damage that would be dealt to you this turn.', 'Defender\\n{T}: Target creature gains haste until end of turn.', "Destroy each creature with mana value 3 or less. They can't be regenerated.", 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', 'Destroy target attacking or blocking creature with power 3 or less.', 'Destroy target blocked creature.', 'Destroy target enchantment.', 'Destroy target nonblack creature. Create two 0/1 colorless Eldrazi Spawn creature tokens. They have "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}."', "Destroy target nonblack creature. It can't be regenerated. You lose life equal to that creature's toughness.", "Draw cards equal to the number of cards in target opponent's hand.\\nRebound (If you cast this spell from your hand, exile it as it resolves. At the beginning of your next upkeep, you may cast this card from exile without paying its mana cost.)", 'Draw two cards, then shuffle a card from your hand into your library.', 'Each creature you control with a level counter on it gets +2/+2.', 'Each player sacrifices all permanents they control that are one or more colors.', "Each player's life total becomes the lowest life total among all players.", 'Eldrazi Spawn creatures you control get +2/+1.', 'Enchant creature you control\\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+3.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice a creature.', 'Enchant creature\\nAt the beginning of each upkeep, if enchanted creature is untapped, tap it.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +0/+4.\\nTotem armor (If enchanted creature would be destroyed, instead remove all damage from it and destroy this Aura.)', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+1 and has "Whenever this creature deals damage to an opponent, you may draw a card."\\nTotem armor (If enchanted creature would be destroyed, instead remove all damage from it and destroy this Aura.)', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+1 and has first strike.\\nTotem armor (If enchanted creature would be destroyed, instead remove all damage from it and destroy this Aura.)', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+1 and has reach. (It can block creatures with flying.)\\nTotem armor (If enchanted creature would be destroyed, instead remove all damage from it and destroy this Aura.)', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +10/+10 and has trample and annihilator 2. (Whenever it attacks, defending player sacrifices two permanents.)', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and has "Whenever this creature attacks, untap all lands you control."\\nTotem armor (If enchanted creature would be destroyed, instead remove all damage from it and destroy this Aura.)', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+3 and has flying.\\nTotem armor (If enchanted creature would be destroyed, instead remove all damage from it and destroy this Aura.)', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+3 and has vigilance.\\nTotem armor (If enchanted creature would be destroyed, instead remove all damage from it and destroy this Aura.)', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+3.\\nTotem armor (If enchanted creature would be destroyed, instead remove all damage from it and destroy this Aura.)', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature has "{T}: Create a token that\'s a copy of this creature, except it has haste. Exile that token at the beginning of the next end step."', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature has defender.', 'Enchant creature\\nWhenever enchanted creature attacks or blocks, you gain 4 life.', "Enchant creature\\nWhenever enchanted creature becomes tapped, Lust for War deals 3 damage to that creature's controller.\\nEnchanted creature attacks each combat if able.", "Enchant creature\\nYou control enchanted creature.\\nAt the beginning of your end step, if enchanted creature's power is 4 or greater, sacrifice Domestication.", 'Enchant creature\\n{2}{U}: Untap enchanted creature.\\nTotem armor (If enchanted creature would be destroyed, instead remove all damage from it and destroy this Aura.)', 'Enchant land\\nEnchanted land is a Swamp.\\nWhenever enchanted land becomes tapped, its controller loses 2 life.', 'Equipped creature gets +1/+1 for each creature you control.\\nEquip {4} ({4}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)', "Equipped creature gets +2/+2.\\nAs long as equipped creature has defender, it can attack as though it didn't have defender.\\nEquip {3} ({3}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)", 'Equipped creature gets +5/+0.\\nEquip {5}', 'Equipped creature gets +X/+X, where X is its mana value.\\nEquip {4}', "Exile X target cards from target player's graveyard. For each card exiled this way, that player loses 1 life and you gain 1 life.", "First strike\\nSoulsurge Elemental's power is equal to the number of creatures you control.", 'Flame Slash deals 4 damage to target creature.', 'Flash (You may cast this spell any time you could cast an instant.)\\nEnchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+1.\\nTotem armor (If enchanted creature would be destroyed, instead remove all damage from it and destroy this Aura.)', 'Flash (You may cast this spell any time you could cast an instant.)\\nWhen Affa Guard Hound enters the battlefield, target creature gets +0/+3 until end of turn.', 'Flash (You may cast this spell any time you could cast an instant.)\\nWhen Haze Frog enters the battlefield, prevent all combat damage that other creatures would deal this turn.', 'Flying', "Flying\\nActivated abilities of creatures your opponents control can't be activated.", "Flying\\nChampion's Drake gets +3/+3 as long as you control a creature with three or more level counters on it.", "Flying\\nDormant Gomazoa enters the battlefield tapped.\\nDormant Gomazoa doesn't untap during your untap step.\\nWhenever you become the target of a spell, you may untap Dormant Gomazoa.", 'Flying\\nWhen Cadaver Imp enters the battlefield, you may return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Flying\\nWhen Conquering Manticore enters the battlefield, gain control of target creature an opponent controls until end of turn. Untap that creature. It gains haste until end of turn.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Hellcarver Demon deals combat damage to a player, sacrifice all other permanents you control and discard your hand. Exile the top six cards of your library. You may cast any number of spells from among cards exiled this way without paying their mana costs.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Merfolk Skyscout attacks or blocks, untap target permanent.', 'Flying\\n{2}{U}: Draw a card, then put a +1/+1 counter on Sphinx of Magosi.', 'Flying\\n{8}: Creatures you control gain flying until end of turn.', 'Flying\\n{8}: Tap all creatures target player controls.', 'Flying\\n{B}: Pestilence Demon deals 1 damage to each creature and each player.', 'Flying\\n{W}{W}: Target creature gains indestructible until end of turn.', 'Flying\\n{X}{B}{B}: Target creature gets -0/-X until end of turn and Drana, Kalastria Bloodchief gets +X/+0 until end of turn.', 'Forked Bolt deals 2 damage divided as you choose among one or two targets.', 'Gain control of target creature until end of turn. Untap that creature. Until end of turn, it gets +2/+0 and gains haste.', 'Haste\\nWhen Tuktuk the Explorer dies, create Tuktuk the Returned, a legendary 5/5 colorless Goblin Golem artifact creature token.', "Haste\\nWhenever you cast a spell, if it's the second creature spell you cast this turn, you may return Vengevine from your graveyard to the battlefield.", 'Heat Ray deals X damage to target creature.', 'If you control an Eldrazi Spawn, create three 0/1 colorless Eldrazi Spawn creature tokens. They have "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}." Otherwise, create one of those tokens.', 'Instant and sorcery spells you control have rebound. (Exile the spell as it resolves if you cast it from your hand. At the beginning of your next upkeep, you may cast that card from exile without paying its mana cost.)', 'Kor Spiritdancer gets +2/+2 for each Aura attached to it.\\nWhenever you cast an Aura spell, you may draw a card.', 'Last Kiss deals 2 damage to target creature and you gain 2 life.', 'Leaf Arrow deals 3 damage to target creature with flying.', 'Level up {1} ({1}: Put a level counter on this. Level up only as a sorcery.)\\nLEVEL 2-3\\n3/3\\nFlying\\nLEVEL 4+\\n4/4\\nFlying\\nOther Merfolk creatures you control get +1/+1.', 'Level up {1} ({1}: Put a level counter on this. Level up only as a sorcery.)\\nLEVEL 6-11\\n6/6\\nLifelink\\nLEVEL 12+\\n9/9\\nLifelink, indestructible', 'Level up {1}{B} ({1}{B}: Put a level counter on this. Level up only as a sorcery.)\\nLEVEL 2-3\\n2/2\\n{B}, {T}: Target creature gets -2/-2 until end of turn.\\nLEVEL 4+\\n4/4\\n{B}, {T}: Target creature gets -4/-4 until end of turn.', 'Level up {1}{G} ({1}{G}: Put a level counter on this. Level up only as a sorcery.)\\nLEVEL 1-4\\n1/2\\n{T}: Add {G}{G}.\\nLEVEL 5+\\n1/4\\nElves you control have "{T}: Add {G}{G}."', 'Level up {1}{G} ({1}{G}: Put a level counter on this. Level up only as a sorcery.)\\nLEVEL 2-5\\n1/1\\n{T}: Create a 3/3 green Elephant creature token.\\nLEVEL 6+\\n1/1\\n{T}: Create two 3/3 green Elephant creature tokens.', 'Level up {1}{R} ({1}{R}: Put a level counter on this. Level up only as a sorcery.)\\nLEVEL 1-5\\n6/6\\nLEVEL 6+\\n6/6\\nWhenever Lord of Shatterskull Pass attacks, it deals 6 damage to each creature defending player controls.', 'Level up {1}{U} ({1}{U}: Put a level counter on this. Level up only as a sorcery.)\\nLEVEL 1-2\\n0/1\\n{T}: Draw a card, then discard a card.\\nLEVEL 3+\\n0/1\\n{T}: Draw a card.', 'Level up {1}{U} ({1}{U}: Put a level counter on this. Level up only as a sorcery.)\\nLEVEL 2-3\\n2/4\\n{U}{U}, {T}: Copy target instant or sorcery spell. You may choose new targets for the copy.\\nLEVEL 4+\\n2/5\\n{U}{U}, {T}: Copy target instant or sorcery spell twice. You may choose new targets for the copies.', "Level up {2} ({2}: Put a level counter on this. Level up only as a sorcery.)\\nLEVEL 1-4\\n0/6\\nLEVEL 5+\\n6/6\\nIslandwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls an Island.)", 'Level up {2} ({2}: Put a level counter on this. Level up only as a sorcery.)\\nLEVEL 1-4\\n2/2\\nLEVEL 5+\\n5/5\\nFirst strike', 'Level up {2}{B} ({2}{B}: Put a level counter on this. Level up only as a sorcery.)\\nLEVEL 1-2\\n4/3\\nDeathtouch\\nLEVEL 3+\\n5/4\\nFirst strike, deathtouch', 'Level up {2}{G} ({2}{G}: Put a level counter on this. Level up only as a sorcery.)\\nLEVEL 1-3\\n4/4\\nLEVEL 4+\\n6/6\\nTrample', "Level up {2}{U} ({2}{U}: Put a level counter on this. Level up only as a sorcery.)\\nLEVEL 1-2\\n2/2\\nHada Spy Patrol can't be blocked.\\nLEVEL 3+\\n3/3\\nShroud (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities.)\\nHada Spy Patrol can't be blocked.", 'Level up {2}{W} ({2}{W}: Put a level counter on this. Level up only as a sorcery.)\\nLEVEL 1-4\\n1/4\\nIf a source would deal damage to you or a creature you control, prevent 1 of that damage.\\nLEVEL 5+\\n2/5\\nIf a source would deal damage to you or a creature you control, prevent 2 of that damage.', 'Level up {2}{W} ({2}{W}: Put a level counter on this. Level up only as a sorcery.)\\nLEVEL 2-4\\n3/6\\nOther creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nLEVEL 5+\\n4/8\\nOther creatures you control get +2/+2.', 'Level up {3} ({3}: Put a level counter on this. Level up only as a sorcery.)\\nLEVEL 1-2\\n2/2\\nFlying\\nLEVEL 3+\\n4/2\\nFlying', 'Level up {3} ({3}: Put a level counter on this. Level up only as a sorcery.)\\nLEVEL 1-3\\n2/3\\nFlying\\nLEVEL 4+\\n4/4\\nFlying, vigilance', 'Level up {3} ({3}: Put a level counter on this. Level up only as a sorcery.)\\nLEVEL 1-3\\n4/2\\nLEVEL 4+\\n7/3\\n{B}: Regenerate Null Champion.', 'Level up {3}{R} ({3}{R}: Put a level counter on this. Level up only as a sorcery.)\\nLEVEL 1-2\\n2/3\\n{T}: Brimstone Mage deals 1 damage to any target.\\nLEVEL 3+\\n2/4\\n{T}: Brimstone Mage deals 3 damage to any target.', "Level up {4} ({4}: Put a level counter on this. Level up only as a sorcery.)\\nLEVEL 1-2\\n3/3\\nLEVEL 3+\\n5/5\\nZulaport Enforcer can't be blocked except by black creatures.", 'Level up {4} ({4}: Put a level counter on this. Level up only as a sorcery.)\\nLEVEL 1-3\\n2/6\\nVigilance\\nLEVEL 4+\\n3/10\\nVigilance', 'Level up {R} ({R}: Put a level counter on this. Level up only as a sorcery.)\\nLEVEL 4-7\\n4/4\\nFlying\\nLEVEL 8+\\n8/8\\nFlying, trample\\n{R}: Kargan Dragonlord gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', "Level up {U} ({U}: Put a level counter on this. Level up only as a sorcery.)\\nLEVEL 4-6\\n2/4\\nLEVEL 7+\\n3/5\\nAt the beginning of each end step, if it's not your turn, take an extra turn after this one.", 'Level up {W} ({W}: Put a level counter on this. Level up only as a sorcery.)\\nLEVEL 2-6\\n3/3\\nFirst strike\\nLEVEL 7+\\n4/4\\nDouble strike', 'Lifelink\\nWhenever Escaped Null blocks or becomes blocked, it gets +5/+0 until end of turn.', 'Look at the top five cards of your library. You may reveal a colorless card from among them and put it into your hand. Then put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', 'Play with the top card of your library revealed.\\nAs long as the top card of your library is a creature card, Mul Daya Channelers gets +3/+3.\\nAs long as the top card of your library is a land card, Mul Daya Channelers has "{T}: Add two mana of any one color."', 'Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn by attacking creatures.', "Put target creature into its owner's library second from the top. Its controller gains 3 life.", 'Reach', 'Return an instant card at random from your graveyard to your hand.\\nRebound (If you cast this spell from your hand, exile it as it resolves. At the beginning of your next upkeep, you may cast this card from exile without paying its mana cost.)', "Return target permanent to its owner's hand.", 'Sacrifice Death Cultist: Target player loses 1 life and you gain 1 life.', 'Sacrifice a creature: Bloodthrone Vampire gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Sacrifice all creatures you control, then create that many 4/4 red Hellion creature tokens.', 'Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle. Create a 0/1 colorless Eldrazi Spawn creature token. It has "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}."', 'Search your library for up to four land cards with different names and reveal them. An opponent chooses two of those cards. Put the chosen cards into your graveyard and the rest into your hand. Then shuffle.', 'Spawning Breath deals 1 damage to any target. Create a 0/1 colorless Eldrazi Spawn creature token. It has "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}."', "Spells and abilities your opponents control can't cause you to sacrifice permanents.", 'Staggershock deals 2 damage to any target.\\nRebound (If you cast this spell from your hand, exile it as it resolves. At the beginning of your next upkeep, you may cast this card from exile without paying its mana cost.)', 'Tap up to two target creatures.\\nDraw a card.', "Target creature gains swampwalk until end of turn. (It can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Swamp.)\\nDraw a card.", "Target creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn and can't be blocked this turn.\\nRebound (If you cast this spell from your hand, exile it as it resolves. At the beginning of your next upkeep, you may cast this card from exile without paying its mana cost.)", 'Target creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn for each creature you control.', 'Target creature gets +2/+0 and gains deathtouch until end of turn.\\nRebound (If you cast this spell from your hand, exile it as it resolves. At the beginning of your next upkeep, you may cast this card from exile without paying its mana cost.)', 'Target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.\\nRebound (If you cast this spell from your hand, exile it as it resolves. At the beginning of your next upkeep, you may cast this card from exile without paying its mana cost.)', 'Target creature gets -1/-0 until end of turn.\\nDraw a card.', 'Target creature must be blocked this turn if able.\\nDraw a card.', 'Target creature you control gains protection from the color of your choice until end of turn.\\nRebound (If you cast this spell from your hand, exile it as it resolves. At the beginning of your next upkeep, you may cast this card from exile without paying its mana cost.)', 'Target opponent reveals their hand. You choose a card from it. That player shuffles that card into their library.', 'Target player loses 3 life. You gain 3 life and create three 0/1 colorless Eldrazi Spawn creature tokens. They have "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}."', 'Target player reveals their hand. You choose a nonland card from it with mana value 3 or less. That player discards that card.', "Target player sacrifices a creature. You gain life equal to that creature's toughness.\\nRebound (If you cast this spell from your hand, exile it as it resolves. At the beginning of your next upkeep, you may cast this card from exile without paying its mana cost.)", "This spell can't be countered.\\nWhen you cast this spell, take an extra turn after this one.\\nFlying, protection from spells that are one or more colors, annihilator 6\\nWhen Emrakul, the Aeons Torn is put into a graveyard from anywhere, its owner shuffles their graveyard into their library.", 'This spell costs {G} less to cast for each green creature you control.\\nTrample', 'Trample', 'Trample\\nTap an untapped creature you control: Bramblesnap gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Trample\\nWhen Pelakka Wurm enters the battlefield, you gain 7 life.\\nWhen Pelakka Wurm dies, draw a card.', 'Trample\\nWhen Thought Gorger enters the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on it for each card in your hand. If you do, discard your hand.\\nWhen Thought Gorger leaves the battlefield, draw a card for each +1/+1 counter on it.', 'Trample\\nWhenever Rapacious One deals combat damage to a player, create that many 0/1 colorless Eldrazi Spawn creature tokens. They have "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}."', 'When Akoum Boulderfoot enters the battlefield, it deals 1 damage to any target.', 'When Bala Ged Scorpion enters the battlefield, you may destroy target creature with power 1 or less.', 'When Dread Drone enters the battlefield, create two 0/1 colorless Eldrazi Spawn creature tokens. They have "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}."', 'When Emrakul\'s Hatcher enters the battlefield, create three 0/1 colorless Eldrazi Spawn creature tokens. They have "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}."', 'When Enatu Golem dies, you gain 4 life.', 'When Goblin Arsonist dies, you may have it deal 1 damage to any target.', 'When Jaddi Lifestrider enters the battlefield, you may tap any number of untapped creatures you control. You gain 2 life for each creature tapped this way.', 'When Kozilek\'s Predator enters the battlefield, create two 0/1 colorless Eldrazi Spawn creature tokens. They have "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}."', 'When Lone Missionary enters the battlefield, you gain 4 life.', "When Merfolk Observer enters the battlefield, look at the top card of target player's library.", 'When Nest Invader enters the battlefield, create a 0/1 colorless Eldrazi Spawn creature token. It has "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}."', 'When Ondu Giant enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'When Prophetic Prism enters the battlefield, draw a card.\\n{1}, {T}: Add one mana of any color.', 'When Runed Servitor dies, each player draws a card.', 'When Sea Gate Oracle enters the battlefield, look at the top two cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand and the other on the bottom of your library.', 'When Totem-Guide Hartebeest enters the battlefield, you may search your library for an Aura card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', 'When Venerated Teacher enters the battlefield, put two level counters on each creature you control with level up.', 'When you cast this spell, destroy target permanent.\\nIndestructible\\nAnnihilator 4 (Whenever this creature attacks, defending player sacrifices four permanents.)\\nWhen Ulamog, the Infinite Gyre is put into a graveyard from anywhere, its owner shuffles their graveyard into their library.', 'When you cast this spell, draw four cards.\\nAnnihilator 4 (Whenever this creature attacks, defending player sacrifices four permanents.)\\nWhen Kozilek, Butcher of Truth is put into a graveyard from anywhere, its owner shuffles their graveyard into their library.', 'When you cast this spell, you may return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield.\\nAnnihilator 2 (Whenever this creature attacks, defending player sacrifices two permanents.)', 'Whenever Arrogant Bloodlord blocks or becomes blocked by a creature with power 1 or less, destroy Arrogant Bloodlord at end of combat.', 'Whenever Pawn of Ulamog or another nontoken creature you control dies, you may create a 0/1 colorless Eldrazi Spawn creature token. It has "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}."', 'Whenever Valakut Fireboar attacks, switch its power and toughness until end of turn.', 'Whenever a creature with flying attacks, it loses flying until end of turn.', 'Whenever a creature you control with power 2 or less attacks, Raid Bombardment deals 1 damage to the player or planeswalker that creature is attacking.', 'Whenever a player sacrifices a creature, you may put a +1/+1 counter on Mortician Beetle.', 'Whenever another creature enters the battlefield under your control, you may have Renegade Doppelganger become a copy of that creature until end of turn. (If it does, it loses this ability for the rest of the turn.)', 'Whenever another creature enters the battlefield, you may gain 1 life.', 'Whenever one or more creatures attack, Lightmine Field deals damage to each of those creatures equal to the number of attacking creatures.', 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, Kiln Fiend gets +3/+0 until end of turn.', 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, you may put a charge counter on Sphinx-Bone Wand. If you do, Sphinx-Bone Wand deals damage equal to the number of charge counters on it to any target.', 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, you may put a charge counter on Surrakar Spellblade.\\nWhenever Surrakar Spellblade deals combat damage to a player, you may draw X cards, where X is the number of charge counters on it.', 'Whenever you tap a Swamp for mana, add an additional {B}.\\n{B}: Nirkana Revenant gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', "Whenever you're dealt damage, you may put that many charge counters on Angelheart Vial.\\n{2}, {T}, Remove four charge counters from Angelheart Vial: You gain 2 life and draw a card.", "Wrap in Flames deals 1 damage to each of up to three target creatures. Those creatures can't block this turn.", 'You gain 2 life. Then if you have more life than an opponent, draw a card.\\nRebound (If you cast this spell from your hand, exile it as it resolves. At the beginning of your next upkeep, you may cast this card from exile without paying its mana cost.)', "You may sacrifice four Eldrazi Spawn rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\\nAnnihilator 1 (Whenever this creature attacks, defending player sacrifices a permanent.)", "[+2]: During target opponent's next turn, creatures that player controls attack Gideon Jura if able.\\n[−2]: Destroy target tapped creature.\\n[0]: Until end of turn, Gideon Jura becomes a 6/6 Human Soldier creature that's still a planeswalker. Prevent all damage that would be dealt to him this turn.", "[0]: Reveal the top card of your library and put it into your hand. Sarkhan the Mad deals damage to himself equal to that card's mana value.\\n[−2]: Target creature's controller sacrifices it, then that player creates a 5/5 red Dragon creature token with flying.\\n[−4]: Each Dragon creature you control deals damage equal to its power to target player or planeswalker.", '{1}, Sacrifice a nonland permanent: Magmaw deals 1 damage to any target.', '{1}: Target creature you control has base power and toughness 7/7 until end of turn.', '{2}{B}: Zof Shade gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', "{5}, {T}: Target player mills X cards, where X is the number of cards in that player's graveyard.", '{8}: Creatures you control get +3/+0 until end of turn.', '{8}: Target creature gets +5/+5 and gains trample until end of turn.', '{8}: Target player loses 3 life and you gain 3 life.', '{B}: Regenerate Skeletal Wurm.', "{R}, Sacrifice Grotag Siege-Runner: Destroy target creature with defender. Grotag Siege-Runner deals 2 damage to that creature's controller.", '{T}, Sacrifice Evolving Wilds: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {C}{C}. Spend this mana only to cast colorless Eldrazi spells or activate abilities of colorless Eldrazi.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}{C}.\\n{3}, {T}, Sacrifice Dreamstone Hedron: Draw three cards.', '{T}: Tap target creature with power 3 or less.', "{T}: Target creature with power 2 or less can't be blocked this turn."]
flavor: ['"\'Fraid of heights? Ride a horse. \'Fraid of missing out? Rein up a drake."\\n—Trinda, Hada spy patrol', '"\'Invincible\' is just a word."\\n—Gideon Jura', '"A riddle is nothing more than a trap for small minds, baited with the promise of understanding."', '"Ah, again it does not bode well for you."', '"All life is driven by an indomitable will to survive. I simply turn that into something more . . . tangible."', '"Although armor and auras can be similar, the brains required to use them are worlds apart."\\n—Zilan, Makindi auramancer', '"Consider my debt to your kin paid in full."\\n—Idrol, Guul Draz assassin', '"Emeria is a pleasant lie, a figment to hide Emrakul\'s hideous face. I can only hope to uncover a truth that lies deeper still."', '"From in here, everything looks like dinner."', '"Have you ever killed insects nibbling at your crops? I think that\'s what the Eldrazi believe they\'re doing to us."\\n—Sheyda, Ondu gamekeeper', '"Hold fast the line! Either we stop them here or we wake up in their guts!"\\n—Tala Vertan, Makindi shieldmate', '"I believed in a beautiful god. But this is the true face of the divine."\\n—Ayli, Kamsa cleric', '"I don\'t think he\'s bringing in the mail . . . ."\\n—Nundari, Sea Gate militia captain', '"I have found the courage to face death—twice, if I must."', '"I have schemed too long to be supplanted by dead gods. If I cannot have this world, no one can."', '"I know just the person for that job."', '"I search for a vision of Zendikar that does not include the Eldrazi."\\n—Expedition journal entry', '"I should have died that day, but I suffered not a scratch. I awoke in a lake of blood, none of it apparently my own."\\n—*The War Diaries*', '"I tried to tell her to stay behind, that this fight was too dangerous. I spent the next hour tied to the rafters."\\n—Zahr Gada, Halimar expedition leader', '"I was told these were standard issue. Do I look standard to you?"', '"I will build no sanctuaries. The safety you seek can be won only by the sword."\\n—Yannash, outpost builder', '"I would rather take my own head than be thwarted by a presumptuous wretch with a shield and a dream."', '"I\'d build an entire fortress of them if I could."\\n—Mzali, Lighthouse archmage', '"If destiny\'s champions have arisen to fight the Ancient Ones, then let me, too, do my part."\\n—Ravuel of Graypelt', '"If our former masters would have us kneel again, they shall feel our defiance slashed across their membranes."', '"If you\'re in Akoum and you glimpse a shadow overhead, the worst thing you can do is duck."\\n—Chadir the Navigator', '"In ages past, bargains were struck and promises were made. Now we must collect on our debt. Begin the hymns."\\n—Moruul, Khalni druid', '"It\'s good to learn from your failures, but I prefer to learn from the failures of others."\\n—Jace Beleren', '"It\'s so cute when it\'s sleeping, isn\'t it? Actually, it\'s still as abhorrent as ever, but at least it\'s not trying to kill us."\\n—Noyan Dar, Tazeem lullmage', '"Just move very slowly, and for the love of Ula, do not get it mad."\\n—Chadir the Navigator', '"Life as we know it dangles on the brink of extinction. We must show the strength they would steal from us."\\n—*The Invokers\' Tales*', '"Morality is just shorthand for the constraints of being powerless."\\n—Ob Nixilis', '"Never look too deep, where the waters turn dark. What the sea has hidden there may not stay down forever."\\n—Jaby, Silundi Sea nomad', '"No more blood shall be spilled to satisfy another\'s deluded lust for power."', '"Our enemy is nothing less than the end of all life. We shall not want for allies."\\n—*The War Diaries*', '"Our pyromancer\'s flames may not have killed them, but they bought us the time we needed."\\n—*The War Diaries*', '"Petrifying gaze, deadly fangs, knifelike dorsal spines, venomous saliva . . . Am I missing anything? . . . Toxic bones? Seriously?"\\n—Samila, Murasa Expeditionary House', '"Play no favorites. Everybody dies."\\n—Sparkmage saying', '"Romanticize it, glamorize it, call it what you will. To me, it will always be carnal, bloody murder."\\n—Ayli, Kamsa cleric', '"Something down there has an appetite for what we\'re standing on. Let\'s hope it doesn\'t want seconds."\\n—Samila, Murasa Expeditionary House', '"That our enemies are great only brings us greater hope."', '"That would have brought shame to you as a mage. Tell you what—I\'ll keep your secret."\\n—Noyan Dar, Tazeem lullmage', '"The Na Plateau is lost. Do not ask what happened, and never return there."\\n—Nirthu, lone missionary', '"The brood lineages unfolded across the world, each patterned after one of three progenitors, each a study in mindless consumption."\\n—*The Invokers\' Tales*', '"The brood spread far faster than we could kill it. I fear the worst is yet to come."\\n—*The War Diaries*', '"The emergence of the Eldrazi isn\'t necessarily a bad thing, as long as you\'ve already lived a fulfilling and complete life without regrets."\\n—Javad Nasrin, Ondu relic hunter', '"The explorer who found it got a bad deal when he sold it. He merely got rich."', '"The least of gods shall tower over the mightiest of mortals, and death shall reign over all."\\n—Crypt of Agadeem inscription', '"The mighty rely solely on their strength. They are shocked when we do the same."\\n—Tars Olan, kor world-gift', '"The purpose of existence is simple: everything is fuel for the magmaw."\\n—Jaji, magmaw worshipper', '"The scholars wept when we destroyed the hedron. I had no such pity. What would this world be like had we done so sooner?"\\n—*The War Diaries*', '"The secret entrance should be near."', '"The structure gets bigger every hour, with hedrons coalescing even deep under the surface. If I could only get inside . . . ."', '"The unfathomable is upon us, students. I have no doubt you will rise to the occasion."', '"The vampires knew what was coming. I know it. And they did nothing. They deserve to feel the same agony they\'ve caused all of us."\\n—Anitan, Ondu cleric', '"Then the ancient masters themselves, towers of rapacity, rose and began their calamitous feast."\\n—*The Invokers\' Tales*', '"There was clearly a scream. I\'m not sure if there was a mouth."\\n—Sachir, Akoum Expeditionary House', '"There\'s no contract to sign, no oath to swear. The enlistment procedure is to unsheathe your sword and point it at the enemy."', '"They don\'t move much, but then again, if you get caught in its web, it has all the time in the world to get to you."\\n—Saidah, Joraga hunter', '"This one is only a yearling, but it would be wise to move away before we provide it with excellent hunting practice."\\n—Samila, Murasa Expeditionary House', '"Those who think the trees shall remain bystanders throughout this conflict shall be sorely mistaken."\\n—Sutina, Speaker of the Tajuru', '"To distract an archmage would take incredible power. But for a simpleton, something sparkly will do."\\n—Noyan Dar, Tazeem lullmage', '"To evade the brood lineages, one must be made dark to all the senses."\\n—Traga, Zulaport runner', '"We must all push through the pain to heal our world."\\n—Ayli, Kamsa cleric', '"We thought Zendikar\'s rage was kindled by its explorers and plunderers. But the world had sensed the stirrings of the Eldrazi."\\n—*The Invokers\' Tales*', '"We\'re glad to be of service—to be an audience to your failure."\\n—Maizah Shere, Tazeem lullmage', '"What we knew as Emeria, Ula, and Cosi were not divine beings at all, but a cruel trick, and a grave error."\\n—*The Invokers\' Tales*', '"Whatever the Eldrazi\'s purpose is, it has nothing to do with something so insignificant as us."\\n—Nirthu, lone missionary', '"Why does it destroy? It does, and to talk of reasons wastes time and breath."\\n—Nirthu, lone missionary', '"Yeah, they\'ve got a lot of meat. The only downside to eating \'em is that you often find human bones and body parts inside."\\n—Jaby, Silundi Sea nomad', '"You have to appreciate the genius of it. Why bother building defenses when you can just fill the pass with angry ogres?"\\n—Javad Nasrin, Ondu relic hunter', '"You never know what\'s going to be in goblin tunnels. Even in the best case, there will still be goblins."\\n—Sachir, Akoum Expeditionary House', '"Zendikar fortifies itself against the Great Threat, making sentries of sky, sea, and stone."\\n—*The War Diaries*', 'A boon to those who cannot see in the dark. A bane to those who live in it.', 'A bramblesnap is formed by grafting together thirteen different plants that already hunger for meat.', 'After encasing it in a paralyzing beam of light, the angel studied the Eldrazi as a child would study a bug, curiously and without fear.', "After millennia asleep, the Eldrazi had forgotten about Zendikar's fiery temper and dislike of strangers.", 'All the angel saw was her doom.', 'Ancient lore locked in a mind driven mad is just as safe as when it was locked deep underground.', 'As it spins, dead voices shriek in an ever-increasing cacophony, rending the mind asunder.', 'As the hedrons began to coalesce into colossal Eldrazi superstructures, the griffins were forced to seek new territory lest their aeries be crushed between the massive stone monoliths.', "As they awakened, the Eldrazi reasserted their mastery over all of Zendikar's natural forces.", 'Built of wood and iron. Held together by hope and prayer.', "Create an illusion so strong that it becomes another's reality, and you can become the master of all.", "Death by death, Kozilek's lineage spread.", 'Death inevitably seduces all who study it.', 'Draped with the pennon of a fallen outpost, the sword came to symbolize the peoples of Zendikar becoming one.', 'Each Eldrazi ancient spawned a lineage of horrors in unfathomable shapes.', 'Each temple is a door to a horrible future.', 'Eldrazi grow wherever something else dies.', 'Even as the world was left cracked and gory by the marauding Eldrazi, new life began to drip from its wounds.', 'Every world is an organism, able to grow new lands. Some just do it faster than others.', 'Fast and lethal, with a penchant for the weak and infirm.', 'From the moment the first Eldrazi spawn squirmed free, everything on Zendikar took on an adjusted meaning, a new slant toward or away from the waking giants.', 'Goblins in the first wave of a fire raid always bemoan the aim of everyone else.', 'Golems conjured from the debris of Enatu Temple provided a sturdy but expendable first line of defense against the Eldrazi.', 'Hate is an everlasting wellspring from which it is eternally sustained.', 'His mission has become a grim pilgrimage, a tour of the Eldrazi-stricken outposts across Zendikar. But he marches on alone, stubborn as the daily dawn.', 'If you want to kill a lot of goblins, just make sure your defenses look like fun.', 'In one gargantuan bite, it will swallow not only you but also the riverbank you were standing on.', "In truth, her own faith was gone, trodden in Ulamog's wake. She pantomimed the blessing in the hope that it would inspire others to continue to struggle.", 'It draws its strength from those around it, but the pleasure of destruction is all its own.', 'It eats what it wants to eat—which is anything that moves.', 'It haunts the remnants of the Helix of Zof, leeching strength from the vast Eldrazi ruin.', 'It holds a whisper from Iona: "Persevere."', 'It lingers near the outposts of the Makindi Trenches, inadvertently granting another layer of defense.', "It nurtures its masters' glorious future.", 'It removed only one idea from her mind: defiance.', 'It speaks no commands but is always obeyed.', 'It traps an explosion within its stony skin.', "It wasn't long until the elves had developed a use for every part of the Eldrazi.", "It's difficult to outwit something that doesn't speak, strategize, or even think.", 'Its breath leaves its prey too drowsy to struggle.', "Its host's final curse lies captured within.", "Just when you thought you'd be safe, in the middle of an open field with no Eldrazi around for miles.", "Kill a gnarlid with your first blow, or it'll cheerfully show you how it's done.", 'Lands ravaged, cities in ruins, so many lives sacrificed, and yet there was no other word for it but victory.', 'Leave but a shred of root and it will return, bursting with vigor.', 'Left masterless by Kozilek, it wandered the wilds, raving in its ceaseless hunger.', "Nature's arms encircle all who are willing to draw close.", "Necromancers are judged by the most powerful undead they've ever created. There are those who have animated just a single being, yet are considered the pinnacle of their dark craft.", 'No one spoke. There was no need. The threat of the Eldrazi presented a simple choice: lay down your weapons and die for nothing, or hold them fast and die for something.', 'No thought but hunger. No strategy but destruction.', 'Once a welcoming hub for explorers, Affa became a place of guarded tongues and quick defenses.', 'Only the Eldrazi mind thinks in the warped paths required to open the hedrons and tap the power within.', 'Remade by Eldrazi magic, Tuktuk inspired an entire clan of misguided goblins.', 'Riches must be divided, but real wealth can be shared.', 'Scavengers both mundane and magical follow in its wake, feeding on the scraps of flesh and spirit it leaves behind.', 'Scholars had puzzled for centuries over the ruins at Tal Terig. Its secrets had always lived within one rune-carved head.', 'She adopted the weapon of the slave-lord Kazuul, and with it, all his cruelty.', 'She reaches beyond the physical realm, touching the ideals from which all creatures draw their power.', 'Some druids nurture gardens. Others nurture continents.', 'Some humans willingly offered up their blood, hoping it would grant the vampire families the strength to stave off the Eldrazi.', 'Sorin has gathered grudges for centuries, patiently awaiting the day he can exact the perfect vengeance.', 'Storms spread throughout Oran-Rief, ripping the skies with wind and rain. Airborne creatures sought shelter where they could.', "The Joraga elves never need ask a troll to leave their territory. They merely grant it their combined strength, and it can't resist embarking on a merry rampage.", 'The Singing City was silent, the pathway stones were still, and the winds of the Howling Spire ceased.', "The baloth's instincts boiled, its muscles pulled taut, and its razor-spines bristled, as it turned to face—a runt meepling.", 'The barest taste of Eldrazi power shatters both realms and identities.', 'The best defense is a good offense.', "The ground erupted in time with the hedron's thrum, a dirge of the last days.", 'The hedrons awoke along with the Eldrazi, forming superstructures that radiated overwhelming magic.', "The horror lurched about like a puppet from a madman's nightmare, squeezing the life from its own kind.", 'The kor track hartebeests in hopes of finding magic to help fight the Eldrazi.', "The kor's most righteous dead are given the greatest reward: an eternity tied to the land they so cherish.", 'The mouth must be pried open before rigor mortis sets in. Otherwise the returning soul can find no ingress.', 'The settlement knew there was something strange about the cloud when the old priest Mandli suddenly grabbed an axe and ran screaming into the hills.', 'The shaman rattles not to inspire a battle fury but to drown out the shrieks of those fleeing the Eldrazi.', 'Things born in magma are always angry.', 'Those who seek to disturb the harmony of life will see their instruments taken from them.', 'To the soldier, war is famine; to the scavenger, a feast.', 'To truly know a creature, slither a mile in its tentacles.', "Tracing their ancestry back to Zendikar's earliest forms of life, lagac lizards have seen the comings and goings of planeswalkers and the Eldrazi, and the rise of the vampire clans, none of which has changed them one bit.", "Ulamog's tentacles, their touch like burning ice, rummaged through his soul and stung his memories one by one.", "Under the master's eye, skills are honed sharper and spells cut deeper.", 'With great power comes great risk of getting yourself killed.', 'Wordlessly it leads its abhorrent brood.', 'You will scream out your innermost secrets just to make it stop.', 'Your pleas for death shall go unheard.']
artist: ['Adi Granov', 'Aleksi Briclot', 'Alex Horley-Orlandelli', 'Andrew Robinson', 'Anthony Francisco', 'Austin Hsu', 'Chippy', 'Chris Rahn', 'Christopher Moeller', 'Cyril Van Der Haegen', 'Daarken', 'Dan Murayama Scott', 'Daniel Ljunggren', 'Dave Kendall', 'Eric Deschamps', 'Erica Yang', 'Franz Vohwinkel', 'Goran Josic', 'Greg Staples', 'Howard Lyon', 'Igor Kieryluk', 'Izzy', 'Jaime Jones', 'James Paick', 'James Ryman', 'Jason A. Engle', 'Jason Chan', 'Jason Felix', 'Jesper Ejsing', 'Johann Bodin', 'John Avon', 'Jung Park', 'Justin Sweet', 'Karl Kopinski', 'Kekai Kotaki', 'Kieran Yanner', 'Lars Grant-West', 'Mark Tedin', 'Matt Cavotta', 'Matt Stewart', 'Michael Komarck', 'Mike Bierek', 'Philip Straub', 'Raymond Swanland', 'Rob Alexander', 'Ryan Pancoast', 'Scott Chou', 'Steve Argyle', 'Steve Prescott', 'Steven Belledin', 'Svetlin Velinov', 'Todd Lockwood', 'Tomasz Jedruszek', 'Trevor Claxton', 'Vance Kovacs', 'Vincent Proce', 'Volkan Baǵa', 'Véronique Meignaud', 'Warren Mahy', 'Wayne Reynolds', 'Zoltan Boros & Gabor Szikszai', 'rk post']
