rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "A creature\'s level is based on how many level counters it has on it, not how many times its level up ability has been activated or has resolved. If a leveler gets level counters due to some other effect (such as Clockspinning) or loses level counters for some reason (such as Vampire Hexmage), its level is changed accordingly."}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "Effects that modify a leveler\'s power or toughness, such as the effects of Giant Growth or Glorious Anthem, will apply to it no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for counters that change the creature\'s power or toughness (such as +1/+1 counters) and effects that switch its power and toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "Effects that set a leveler\'s power or toughness to a specific value, including the effects from a level symbol\'s ability, apply in timestamp order. The timestamp of each level symbol\'s ability is the same as the timestamp of the leveler itself, regardless of when the most recent level counter was put on it."}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "If another creature becomes a copy of a leveler, all of the leveler\'s printed abilities — including those represented by level symbols — are copied. The current characteristics of the leveler, and the number of level counters on it, are not. The abilities, power, and toughness of the copy will be determined based on how many level counters are on the copy."}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "The abilities a leveler grants to itself don\'t overwrite any other abilities it may have. In particular, they don\'t overwrite the creature\'s level up ability; it always has that."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "Annihilator abilities trigger and resolve during the declare attackers step. The defending player chooses and sacrifices the required number of permanents before they declare blockers. Any creatures sacrificed this way won\'t be able to block."}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "If a creature with annihilator is attacking a planeswalker, and the defending player chooses to sacrifice that planeswalker, the attacking creature continues to attack. It may be blocked. If it isn\'t blocked, it simply won\'t deal combat damage to anything."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "As long as you control Pennon Blade, its ability constantly counts the number of creatures you control. It doesn\'t matter who controls the creature it\'s equipping (in case an opponent somehow manages to take control of that creature). If you control the creature it\'s equipping, the bonus will include that creature too."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "At the beginning of your upkeep, all delayed triggered abilities created by rebound effects trigger. You may handle them in any order. If you want to cast a card this way, you do so as part of the resolution of its delayed triggered ability. Timing restrictions based on the card\'s type (if it\'s a sorcery) are ignored. Other restrictions are not (such as the one from Rule of Law)."}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': \'If a replacement effect would cause a spell with rebound that you cast from your hand to be put somewhere else instead of your graveyard (such as Leyline of the Void might), you choose whether to apply the rebound effect or the other effect as the spell resolves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "If a spell with rebound that you cast from your hand doesn\'t resolve for any reason (due being countered by a spell like Cancel, or because all of its targets are illegal), rebound has no effect. The spell is simply put into your graveyard. You won\'t get to cast it again next turn."}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "If the targeted player doesn\'t sacrifice a creature (because the player didn\'t control any creatures or due to Tajuru Preserver, perhaps), you gain no life."}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "If you are unable to cast a card from exile this way, or you choose not to, nothing happens when the delayed triggered ability resolves. The card remains exiled for the rest of the game, and you won\'t get another chance to cast the card. The same is true if the ability is countered (due to Stifle, perhaps)."}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "If you cast a card from exile this way, it will go to your graveyard when it resolves, fails to resolve, or is countered. It won\'t go back to exile."}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "If you cast a spell with rebound from anywhere other than your hand (such as from your graveyard due to Sins of the Past, from your library due to cascade, or from your opponent\'s hand due to Sen Triplets), rebound won\'t have any effect. If you do cast it from your hand, rebound will work regardless of whether you paid its mana cost (for example, if you cast it from your hand due to Maelstrom Archangel)."}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "If you cast a spell with rebound from your hand and it resolves, it isn\'t put into your graveyard. Rather, it\'s exiled directly from the stack. Effects that care about cards being put into your graveyard won\'t do anything."}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "Rebound will have no effect on copies of spells because you don\'t cast them from your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "The sacrificed creature\'s last known existence on the battlefield is checked to determine its toughness."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "Aura Gnarlid\'s second ability counts each Aura regardless of who controls it."}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "The power of each potential blocking creature is checked against Aura Gnarlid\'s power only as blockers are declared. Once a creature blocks Aura Gnarlid, increasing the Gnarlid\'s power or decreasing the blocking creature\'s power won\'t undo that block."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "If you cast an Aura spell, Kor Spiritdancer\'s second ability triggers and goes on the stack on top of it. The ability will resolve before the spell does."}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': \'The second ability triggers when you cast any Aura spell, not just one that targets Kor Spiritdancer.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "Snake Umbra grants the triggered ability to the creature. It triggers whenever the enchanted creature deals damage to an opponent of its controller (who is not necessarily an opponent of the Aura\'s controller). In other words, if your Snake Umbra winds up enchanting your opponent\'s creature, that opponent will draw a card whenever that creature damages you."}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': \'The ability triggers when the enchanted creature deals any damage, not just combat damage.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor has indestructible, lethal damage and effects that try to destroy it simply have no effect. Totem armor won\'t do anything because it won\'t have to."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor would be destroyed by multiple state-based actions at the same time (most likely because a creature with deathtouch has dealt damage to that creature greater than or equal to its toughness) totem armor\'s effect will replace all of them and save the creature."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If a permanent you control is enchanted with multiple Auras that have totem armor, and the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, one of those Auras is destroyed instead — but only one of them. You choose which one because you control the enchanted permanent.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability (such as Akroma\'s Vengeance) would destroy both an Aura with totem armor and the permanent it\'s enchanting at the same time, totem armor\'s effect will save the enchanted permanent from being destroyed. Instead, the spell or ability will destroy the Aura in two different ways at the same time, but the result is the same as destroying it once."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If a spell or ability says that it would "destroy" a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, that spell or ability is what causes the Aura to be destroyed instead. Totem armor doesn\\\'t destroy the Aura; rather, it changes the effects of the spell or ability. On the other hand, if a spell or ability deals lethal damage to a creature enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, the game rules regarding lethal damage cause the Aura to be destroyed, not that spell or ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'Totem armor has no effect if the enchanted permanent is put into a graveyard for any other reason, such as if it\\\'s sacrificed, if the "legend rule" applies to it, or if its toughness is 0 or less.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'Totem armor\\\'s effect is applied no matter why the enchanted permanent would be destroyed: because it\\\'s been dealt lethal damage, or because it\\\'s being affected by an effect that says to "destroy" it (such as Putrefy). In either case, all damage is removed from the permanent and the Aura is destroyed instead.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Totem armor\'s effect is mandatory. If the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, you must remove all damage from it (if it has any) and destroy the Aura that has totem armor instead."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Totem armor\'s effect is not regeneration. Specifically, if totem armor\'s effect is applied, the enchanted permanent does not become tapped and is not removed from combat as a result. Effects that say the enchanted permanent can\'t be regenerated (as Putrefy does) won\'t prevent totem armor\'s effect from being applied."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "The value of X is determined as the ability starts to resolve. If the targeted player has five cards in their graveyard at that time, for example, this ability will put five more cards into that graveyard from the top of that player\'s library."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "Training Grounds won\'t affect a cost that isn\'t the cost to activate a creature\'s activated ability. For example, it won\'t affect Flameblast Dragon\'s {X}{R} cost, since that\'s a cost paid when a triggered ability resolves, and it won\'t affect a kicker cost, since that\'s an additional cost to cast a spell. Activated ability costs appear before a colon (:) in a card\'s rules text, or, in the case of some keywords, before a colon in reminder text."}, {\'date\': \'2023-05-12\', \'text\': \'If an activated ability of a creature you control costs no generic mana to activate (for example, if it costs {R}{R}, it costs {0}, or it costs only nonmana actions such as {T} or "Sacrifice a creature"), Training Grounds simply won\\\'t affect it. In particular, it won\\\'t increase the cost to include a mana payment of {1}.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-05-12\', \'text\': "Training Grounds affects only creatures you control on the battlefield. The costs of activated abilities that work in other zones (such as cycling or unearth) won\'t be reduced."}, {\'date\': \'2023-05-12\', \'text\': "Training Grounds can reduce the amount you pay for a creature\'s activated ability cost that includes {X}. For example, Drana, Kalastria Bloodchief has an activated ability that costs {X}{B}{B}. If you control Training Grounds and you activate the ability with X equal to 5, you\'ll have to pay only {3}{B}{B}. This is true even if the ability states that {X} must be paid with a certain color of mana, as Crimson Hellkite\'s ability does."}, {\'date\': \'2023-05-12\', \'text\': "Training Grounds can reduce the part of an activation cost represented by generic mana symbols down to nothing, as long as it still costs at least one mana. For example, if an activation cost is {2}{G}, you\'d have to pay only {G}. If an activation cost is {2}, though, you\'d still have to pay {1}."}, {\'date\': \'2023-05-12\', \'text\': \'Training Grounds takes the total cost to activate a creature\\\'s activated ability into account, not just the cost printed on it. For example, Urabrask has an activated ability that costs {R}, and Suppression Field says "Activated abilities cost {2} more to activate unless they\\\'re mana abilities." Since activating Urabrask\\\'s activated ability would now cost {2}{R}, Training Grounds reduces that cost back to {R}.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-05-12\', \'text\': "Training Grounds won\'t affect the part of an activation cost represented by colored mana symbols or snow mana symbols. It also won\'t affect nonmana parts of an activation cost, if there are any."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "When the enchanted creature attacks, all lands controlled by that creature\'s controller (who is not necessarily the Aura\'s controller) untap."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor has indestructible, lethal damage and effects that try to destroy it simply have no effect. Totem armor won\'t do anything because it won\'t have to."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor would be destroyed by multiple state-based actions at the same time (most likely because a creature with deathtouch has dealt damage to that creature greater than or equal to its toughness) totem armor\'s effect will replace all of them and save the creature."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If a permanent you control is enchanted with multiple Auras that have totem armor, and the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, one of those Auras is destroyed instead — but only one of them. You choose which one because you control the enchanted permanent.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability (such as Akroma\'s Vengeance) would destroy both an Aura with totem armor and the permanent it\'s enchanting at the same time, totem armor\'s effect will save the enchanted permanent from being destroyed. Instead, the spell or ability will destroy the Aura in two different ways at the same time, but the result is the same as destroying it once."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If a spell or ability says that it would "destroy" a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, that spell or ability is what causes the Aura to be destroyed instead. Totem armor doesn\\\'t destroy the Aura; rather, it changes the effects of the spell or ability. On the other hand, if a spell or ability deals lethal damage to a creature enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, the game rules regarding lethal damage cause the Aura to be destroyed, not that spell or ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'Totem armor has no effect if the enchanted permanent is put into a graveyard for any other reason, such as if it\\\'s sacrificed, if the "legend rule" applies to it, or if its toughness is 0 or less.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'Totem armor\\\'s effect is applied no matter why the enchanted permanent would be destroyed: because it\\\'s been dealt lethal damage, or because it\\\'s being affected by an effect that says to "destroy" it (such as Putrefy). In either case, all damage is removed from the permanent and the Aura is destroyed instead.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Totem armor\'s effect is mandatory. If the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, you must remove all damage from it (if it has any) and destroy the Aura that has totem armor instead."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Totem armor\'s effect is not regeneration. Specifically, if totem armor\'s effect is applied, the enchanted permanent does not become tapped and is not removed from combat as a result. Effects that say the enchanted permanent can\'t be regenerated (as Putrefy does) won\'t prevent totem armor\'s effect from being applied."}]', "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'A colored permanent is a permanent with at least one colored mana symbol in its mana cost. Note that effects may cause a colored permanent to become colorless (as Moonlace could), or a colorless permanent to become colored (as Crimson Wisps could).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'All the colored permanents are sacrificed at the same time.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Lands have no mana cost, so they are colorless unless an effect states otherwise.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Tokens may also be colored permanents. The effect that creates a token states what color it is or whether it’s colorless.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'All Is Dust doesn’t destroy permanents. Rather, it causes them to be sacrificed. Regeneration, totem armor, and indestructible can’t save permanents from All Is Dust.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'A land card that produces colored mana, even a land with a basic land type, normally has no color.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'A creature’s level is based on how many level counters it has on it, not how many times its level up ability has been activated or has resolved. If a leveler gets level counters due to some other effect (such as Clockspinning) or loses level counters for some reason (such as Vampire Hexmage), its level is changed accordingly.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Each copy will have the same targets as the spell it’s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can’t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Echo Mage’s last two activated abilities can target (and copy) any instant or sorcery spell, not just one with targets. It doesn’t matter who controls it.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Effects that modify a leveler’s power or toughness, such as the effects of Giant Growth or Glorious Anthem, will apply to it no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for counters that change the creature’s power or toughness (such as +1/+1 counters) and effects that switch its power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Effects that set a leveler’s power or toughness to a specific value, including the effects from a level symbol’s ability, apply in timestamp order. The timestamp of each level symbol’s ability is the same as the timestamp of the leveler itself, regardless of when the most recent level counter was put on it.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a copy says that it affects “you,” it affects the controller of that copy, not the controller of the original spell. Similarly, if a copy says that it affects an “opponent,” it affects an opponent of that copy’s controller, not an opponent of the original spell’s controller.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If another creature becomes a copy of a leveler, all of the leveler’s printed abilities — including those represented by level symbols — are copied. The current characteristics of the leveler, and the number of level counters on it, are not. The abilities, power, and toughness of the copy will be determined based on how many level counters are on the copy.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If the spell the ability copies has an X whose value was determined as it was cast (like Earthquake does), each copy has the same value of X as the original spell.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If the spell the ability copies is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), each copy will have the same mode as the original spell. You can’t choose a different one.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you activate Echo Mage’s last ability to copy a spell twice, you may choose new targets for each copy independently. They don’t have to have the same targets as one another. Be sure to specify which of the copies will resolve first.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The abilities a leveler grants to itself don’t overwrite any other abilities it may have. In particular, they don’t overwrite the creature’s level up ability; it always has that.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'When either ability resolves, it creates a copy (or two) of a spell. The copies are created on the stack, so they’re not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won’t trigger. Each copy will then resolve like a normal spell, after players get a chance to cast spells and activate abilities. Each copy resolves before the original spell does.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'You can’t choose to pay any additional costs for a copy. However, effects based on any additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for each copy too.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'A creature’s level is based on how many level counters it has on it, not how many times its level up ability has been activated or has resolved. If a leveler gets level counters due to some other effect (such as Clockspinning) or loses level counters for some reason (such as Vampire Hexmage), its level is changed accordingly.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Effects that modify a leveler’s power or toughness, such as the effects of Giant Growth or Glorious Anthem, will apply to it no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for counters that change the creature’s power or toughness (such as +1/+1 counters) and effects that switch its power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Effects that set a leveler’s power or toughness to a specific value, including the effects from a level symbol’s ability, apply in timestamp order. The timestamp of each level symbol’s ability is the same as the timestamp of the leveler itself, regardless of when the most recent level counter was put on it.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If Joraga Treespeaker is level 5 or greater, it grants the mana ability to each Elf you control, including itself.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If another creature becomes a copy of a leveler, all of the leveler’s printed abilities — including those represented by level symbols — are copied. The current characteristics of the leveler, and the number of level counters on it, are not. The abilities, power, and toughness of the copy will be determined based on how many level counters are on the copy.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The abilities a leveler grants to itself don’t overwrite any other abilities it may have. In particular, they don’t overwrite the creature’s level up ability; it always has that.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'A creature’s level is based on how many level counters it has on it, not how many times its level up ability has been activated or has resolved. If a leveler gets level counters due to some other effect (such as Clockspinning) or loses level counters for some reason (such as Vampire Hexmage), its level is changed accordingly.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Effects that modify a leveler’s power or toughness, such as the effects of Giant Growth or Glorious Anthem, will apply to it no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for counters that change the creature’s power or toughness (such as +1/+1 counters) and effects that switch its power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Effects that set a leveler’s power or toughness to a specific value, including the effects from a level symbol’s ability, apply in timestamp order. The timestamp of each level symbol’s ability is the same as the timestamp of the leveler itself, regardless of when the most recent level counter was put on it.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a source would deal damage to multiple applicable recipients, the prevention effects apply to each of those recipients separately. For example, if Hedron-Field Purists is level 1 and you cast Earthquake (“Earthquake deals X damage to each creature without flying and each player”) with X equal to 3, that Earthquake will deal 2 damage to you, 2 damage to each creature without flying you control, 3 damage to each other player, and 3 damage to each creature without flying other players control.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If another creature becomes a copy of a leveler, all of the leveler’s printed abilities — including those represented by level symbols — are copied. The current characteristics of the leveler, and the number of level counters on it, are not. The abilities, power, and toughness of the copy will be determined based on how many level counters are on the copy.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Remember that Hedron-Field Purists never has both of these prevention effects at the same time.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The abilities a leveler grants to itself don’t overwrite any other abilities it may have. In particular, they don’t overwrite the creature’s level up ability; it always has that.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The effects from multiple Hedron-Field Purists are cumulative.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The prevention effects don’t affect damage dealt directly to a planeswalker you control.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The prevention effects prevent 1 or 2 damage, as applicable, from each source (regardless of who controls it) each time that source would deal damage to you or a creature you control. They prevent damage of any kind, not just combat damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'A creature’s level is based on how many level counters it has on it, not how many times its level up ability has been activated or has resolved. If a leveler gets level counters due to some other effect (such as Clockspinning) or loses level counters for some reason (such as Vampire Hexmage), its level is changed accordingly.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Effects that modify a leveler’s power or toughness, such as the effects of Giant Growth or Glorious Anthem, will apply to it no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for counters that change the creature’s power or toughness (such as +1/+1 counters) and effects that switch its power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Effects that set a leveler’s power or toughness to a specific value, including the effects from a level symbol’s ability, apply in timestamp order. The timestamp of each level symbol’s ability is the same as the timestamp of the leveler itself, regardless of when the most recent level counter was put on it.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If another creature becomes a copy of a leveler, all of the leveler’s printed abilities — including those represented by level symbols — are copied. The current characteristics of the leveler, and the number of level counters on it, are not. The abilities, power, and toughness of the copy will be determined based on how many level counters are on the copy.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'In a four-player game, if you have a level 7 Lighthouse Chronologist and there are no other extra-turn effects, the game will proceed like this (with extra turns in brackets): your turn, opponent A’s turn, [your turn], opponent B’s turn, [your turn], opponent C’s turn, [your turn], your turn, opponent A’s turn, and so on. The same principle applies to a multiplayer game with a different number of players.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if multiple players each control a level 7 Lighthouse Chronologist, extra turns may sometimes be created faster than they can be taken. Keep track of them carefully. If multiple Chronologist’s abilities trigger during the same turn, the player whose turn would show up sooner in the natural turn order will get the first extra turn. For example, say Players B and C each control a level 7 Lighthouse Chronologist. Player A takes a turn. The game will proceed like this (with extra turns in brackets): Player A’s current turn, [Player B’s turn], [Player C’s turn], [Player B’s turn], [Player C’s turn], and so on. Because Players B and C will each add another extra turn after the other player’s extra turn, Player A will not take another turn as long as both level 7 Lighthouse Chronologists remain on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'In a two-player game, if you and your opponent each control a level 7 Lighthouse Chronologist, they’ll essentially cancel each other out and you’ll alternate turns. Since all the turns you’d be taking are extra turns created by these abilities, make sure you know whose normal turn is supposed to be next in case one or both of the Lighthouse Chronologists leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'In a two-player game, if you have a level 7 Lighthouse Chronologist and there are no other extra-turn effects, the game will proceed like this (with extra turns in brackets): your turn, your opponent’s turn, [your turn], your turn, your opponent’s turn, [your turn], your turn, your opponent’s turn, and so on.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The abilities a leveler grants to itself don’t overwrite any other abilities it may have. In particular, they don’t overwrite the creature’s level up ability; it always has that.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The effects of multiple level 7 Lighthouse Chronologists are cumulative. If you control two of them in a two-player game, you’ll take three turns for each turn your opponent takes.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'A creature’s level is based on how many level counters it has on it, not how many times its level up ability has been activated or has resolved. If a leveler gets level counters due to some other effect (such as Clockspinning) or loses level counters for some reason (such as Vampire Hexmage), its level is changed accordingly.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Effects that modify a leveler’s power or toughness, such as the effects of Giant Growth or Glorious Anthem, will apply to it no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for counters that change the creature’s power or toughness (such as +1/+1 counters) and effects that switch its power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Effects that set a leveler’s power or toughness to a specific value, including the effects from a level symbol’s ability, apply in timestamp order. The timestamp of each level symbol’s ability is the same as the timestamp of the leveler itself, regardless of when the most recent level counter was put on it.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If another creature becomes a copy of a leveler, all of the leveler’s printed abilities — including those represented by level symbols — are copied. The current characteristics of the leveler, and the number of level counters on it, are not. The abilities, power, and toughness of the copy will be determined based on how many level counters are on the copy.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, the only player affected by the last ability is the one Lord of Shatterskull Pass is attacking (or the one who controls the planeswalker Lord of Shatterskull Pass is attacking).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The abilities a leveler grants to itself don’t overwrite any other abilities it may have. In particular, they don’t overwrite the creature’s level up ability; it always has that.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The last ability triggers and resolves during the declare attackers step, before blockers are declared.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'A creature’s level is based on how many level counters it has on it, not how many times its level up ability has been activated or has resolved. If a leveler gets level counters due to some other effect (such as Clockspinning) or loses level counters for some reason (such as Vampire Hexmage), its level is changed accordingly.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Effects that modify a leveler’s power or toughness, such as the effects of Giant Growth or Glorious Anthem, will apply to it no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for counters that change the creature’s power or toughness (such as +1/+1 counters) and effects that switch its power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Effects that set a leveler’s power or toughness to a specific value, including the effects from a level symbol’s ability, apply in timestamp order. The timestamp of each level symbol’s ability is the same as the timestamp of the leveler itself, regardless of when the most recent level counter was put on it.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If another creature becomes a copy of a leveler, all of the leveler’s printed abilities — including those represented by level symbols — are copied. The current characteristics of the leveler, and the number of level counters on it, are not. The abilities, power, and toughness of the copy will be determined based on how many level counters are on the copy.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The abilities a leveler grants to itself don’t overwrite any other abilities it may have. In particular, they don’t overwrite the creature’s level up ability; it always has that.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Lethal damage and effects that say “destroy” won’t cause a creature with indestructible to be put into the graveyard. However, a creature with indestructible can be put into the graveyard for a number of reasons. The most likely reasons are if it’s sacrificed, if it’s legendary and another legendary creature with the same name is controlled by the same player, or if its toughness is 0 or less.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'A creature’s level is based on how many level counters it has on it, not how many times its level up ability has been activated or has resolved. If a leveler gets level counters due to some other effect (such as Clockspinning) or loses level counters for some reason (such as Vampire Hexmage), its level is changed accordingly.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Effects that modify a leveler’s power or toughness, such as the effects of Giant Growth or Glorious Anthem, will apply to it no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for counters that change the creature’s power or toughness (such as +1/+1 counters) and effects that switch its power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Effects that set a leveler’s power or toughness to a specific value, including the effects from a level symbol’s ability, apply in timestamp order. The timestamp of each level symbol’s ability is the same as the timestamp of the leveler itself, regardless of when the most recent level counter was put on it.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If another creature becomes a copy of a leveler, all of the leveler’s printed abilities — including those represented by level symbols — are copied. The current characteristics of the leveler, and the number of level counters on it, are not. The abilities, power, and toughness of the copy will be determined based on how many level counters are on the copy.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The abilities a leveler grants to itself don’t overwrite any other abilities it may have. In particular, they don’t overwrite the creature’s level up ability; it always has that.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'A spell can target you only if it specifically says the word “target.” One that says “You draw two cards,” for example, doesn’t target you.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Dormant Gomazoa’s last ability triggers when you become the target of any spell, including one you control. It doesn’t matter who else or what else the spell targets.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Dormant Gomazoa’s last ability won’t trigger when you become the target of an ability.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you become the target of a spell, Dormant Gomazoa’s last ability triggers and is put on the stack on top of that spell. Dormant Gomazoa’s last ability will resolve (allowing you to untap it) first.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'You become the target of a spell when a spell is cast targeting you, when a spell has one of its targets changed to you due to a spell or ability like Deflection, when a spell that’s targeting you is copied and that target isn’t changed, or when a spell is copied and one of its targets is changed to you.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'A “blocked creature” is an attacking creature that has been blocked by a creature this combat, or has become blocked as the result of a spell or ability this combat. Unless the attacking creature leaves combat, it continues to be a blocked creature through the end of combat step, even if the creature or creatures that blocked it are no longer on the battlefield or have otherwise left combat by then.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'A “blocking creature” is one that has been declared as a blocker this combat, or one that was put onto the battlefield blocking this combat. Unless that creature leaves combat, it continues to be a blocking creature through the end of combat step, even if the creature or creatures that it was blocking are no longer on the battlefield or have otherwise left combat by then.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'An “attacking creature” is one that has been declared as an attacker this combat, or one that was put onto the battlefield attacking this combat. Unless that creature leaves combat, it continues to be an attacking creature through the end of combat step.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The power of the targeted creature is checked both as you target it and as Puncturing Light resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'After attackers are declared and any Gravity Well abilities have resolved, a spell or ability that grants flying to a creature will work normally. This includes other abilities that trigger “whenever [a creature] attacks” (such as the one Order of the Golden Cricket has).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'This ability triggers and resolves during the declare attackers step. The creature will no longer have flying by the time blockers are declared.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': \'All _Rise of the Eldrazi_ cards printed with totem armor are Auras with "enchant creature." But Umbra Mystic grants totem armor to Auras attached to any permanent you control, not just creatures. The ability works the same way even if the Aura is enchanting a land, an artifact, or any other permanent.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "If a permanent you control would be destroyed, and it\'s enchanted by an Aura with totem armor, it doesn\'t matter who controls that Aura. The totem armor effect is mandatory. If that permanent is enchanted by multiple Auras, you choose which one is destroyed, regardless of who controls them."}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': \'Multiple instances of totem armor on the same Aura are redundant.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "Say you control a permanent that\'s enchanted by an Aura you control, and that Aura is itself enchanted by an Aura. If the permanent would be destroyed, instead the first Aura is destroyed... but since that Aura would be destroyed, instead the second Aura is destroyed."}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "Umbra Mystic grants totem armor to Auras attached to permanents you control, regardless of who controls those Auras. Conversely, it doesn\'t grant totem armor to Auras you control that are attached to permanents controlled by other players."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor has indestructible, lethal damage and effects that try to destroy it simply have no effect. Totem armor won\'t do anything because it won\'t have to."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor would be destroyed by multiple state-based actions at the same time (most likely because a creature with deathtouch has dealt damage to that creature greater than or equal to its toughness) totem armor\'s effect will replace all of them and save the creature."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If a permanent you control is enchanted with multiple Auras that have totem armor, and the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, one of those Auras is destroyed instead — but only one of them. You choose which one because you control the enchanted permanent.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability (such as Akroma\'s Vengeance) would destroy both an Aura with totem armor and the permanent it\'s enchanting at the same time, totem armor\'s effect will save the enchanted permanent from being destroyed. Instead, the spell or ability will destroy the Aura in two different ways at the same time, but the result is the same as destroying it once."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If a spell or ability says that it would "destroy" a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, that spell or ability is what causes the Aura to be destroyed instead. Totem armor doesn\\\'t destroy the Aura; rather, it changes the effects of the spell or ability. On the other hand, if a spell or ability deals lethal damage to a creature enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, the game rules regarding lethal damage cause the Aura to be destroyed, not that spell or ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'Totem armor has no effect if the enchanted permanent is put into a graveyard for any other reason, such as if it\\\'s sacrificed, if the "legend rule" applies to it, or if its toughness is 0 or less.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'Totem armor\\\'s effect is applied no matter why the enchanted permanent would be destroyed: because it\\\'s been dealt lethal damage, or because it\\\'s being affected by an effect that says to "destroy" it (such as Putrefy). In either case, all damage is removed from the permanent and the Aura is destroyed instead.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Totem armor\'s effect is mandatory. If the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, you must remove all damage from it (if it has any) and destroy the Aura that has totem armor instead."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Totem armor\'s effect is not regeneration. Specifically, if totem armor\'s effect is applied, the enchanted permanent does not become tapped and is not removed from combat as a result. Effects that say the enchanted permanent can\'t be regenerated (as Putrefy does) won\'t prevent totem armor\'s effect from being applied."}]', "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'All players get to see which card you chose at random.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'At the beginning of your upkeep, all delayed triggered abilities created by rebound effects trigger. You may handle them in any order. If you want to cast a card this way, you do so as part of the resolution of its delayed triggered ability. Timing restrictions based on the card’s type (if it’s a sorcery) are ignored. Other restrictions are not (such as the one from Rule of Law).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a replacement effect would cause a spell with rebound that you cast from your hand to be put somewhere else instead of your graveyard (such as Leyline of the Void might), you choose whether to apply the rebound effect or the other effect as the spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a spell with rebound that you cast from your hand doesn’t resolve for any reason (due being countered by a spell like Cancel, or because all of its targets are illegal), rebound has no effect. The spell is simply put into your graveyard. You won’t get to cast it again next turn.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you are unable to cast a card from exile this way, or you choose not to, nothing happens when the delayed triggered ability resolves. The card remains exiled for the rest of the game, and you won’t get another chance to cast the card. The same is true if the ability is countered (due to Stifle, perhaps).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a card from exile this way, it will go to your graveyard when it resolves, fails to resolve, or is countered. It won’t go back to exile.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with rebound from anywhere other than your hand (such as from your graveyard due to Sins of the Past, from your library due to cascade, or from your opponent’s hand due to Sen Triplets), rebound won’t have any effect. If you do cast it from your hand, rebound will work regardless of whether you paid its mana cost (for example, if you cast it from your hand due to Maelstrom Archangel).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with rebound from your hand and it resolves, it isn’t put into your graveyard. Rather, it’s exiled directly from the stack. Effects that care about cards being put into your graveyard won’t do anything.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you have multiple instant cards in your graveyard with the same name, and one of them is being targeted by another spell on the stack or is enchanted (with Spellweaver Volute, for example), you must differentiate them so you know which one (if any) is chosen at random. In that case, it may be better to use dice or another method that allows you to differentiate between the instant cards to choose one at random.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you have only one instant card in your graveyard as Surreal Memoir resolves, that’s the one you’ll return to your hand.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you’re playing a format involving cards printed earlier than the _Urza’s Saga_ set, you may not reorder your graveyard. In this case, you need to be more careful when selecting an instant card at random, perhaps by using dice, writing the names of the instant cards on slips of paper and choosing one of them randomly, or carefully noting the existing graveyard order so you can reestablish it after performing the method suggested above, for example.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you’re playing a format involving only cards from the _Urza’s Saga_(TM) set and later, you may change the order of your graveyard at any time. That means the easiest way to choose an instant card at random from your graveyard is to take all the instant cards in your graveyard, turn them face down, shuffle them, and pick a card. Then you just put the rest back.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Rebound will have no effect on copies of spells because you don’t cast them from your hand.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Surreal Memoir isn’t targeted. You don’t choose an instant card at random from your graveyard until it resolves. Once you randomly select a card, it’s too late for players to respond.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Annihilator abilities trigger and resolve during the declare attackers step. The defending player chooses and sacrifices the required number of permanents before they declare blockers. Any creatures sacrificed this way won’t be able to block.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Casting Hand of Emrakul by paying its alternative cost doesn’t change its mana cost or converted mana cost.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Casting Hand of Emrakul by paying its alternative cost doesn’t change when you can cast it. You can cast it only at the normal time you could cast a creature spell.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Effects that increase or reduce the cost to cast Hand of Emrakul will apply to it even if you choose to pay its alternative cost.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a creature with annihilator is attacking a planeswalker, and the defending player chooses to sacrifice that planeswalker, the attacking creature continues to attack. It may be blocked. If it isn’t blocked, it simply won’t deal combat damage to anything.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Annihilator abilities trigger and resolve during the declare attackers step. The defending player chooses and sacrifices the required number of permanents before they declare blockers. Any creatures sacrificed this way won’t be able to block.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Eldrazi Conscription is an Eldrazi. However, it doesn’t turn the enchanted creature into an Eldrazi.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a creature with annihilator is attacking a planeswalker, and the defending player chooses to sacrifice that planeswalker, the attacking creature continues to attack. It may be blocked. If it isn’t blocked, it simply won’t deal combat damage to anything.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If a creature has multiple instances of annihilator, each triggers separately when that creature attacks.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Annihilator abilities trigger and resolve during the declare attackers step. The defending player chooses and sacrifices the required number of permanents before they declare blockers. Any creatures sacrificed this way won’t be able to block.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a creature with annihilator is attacking a planeswalker, and the defending player chooses to sacrifice that planeswalker, the attacking creature continues to attack. It may be blocked. If it isn’t blocked, it simply won’t deal combat damage to anything.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If an opponent sacrifices a nontoken permanent as part of paying the cost of a spell or ability, the second ability triggers and goes on the stack on top of it. This ability will resolve, causing you to return the card to the battlefield before the other spell or ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If an opponent sacrifices an Aura, you’ll choose what it enchants as you return it to the battlefield. No player can respond to the choice. Since an Aura doesn’t target anything if it isn’t cast as a spell, you can enchant a permanent with shroud this way.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If the sacrificed permanent that caused the second ability to trigger somehow leaves the graveyard before the ability resolves (possibly because it was returned to the battlefield by the ability of another It That Betrays), the ability simply won’t do anything when it resolves.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'It doesn’t matter whose graveyard the permanent is put into, only that it was last controlled by, and sacrificed by, an opponent.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The second ability triggers whenever an opponent sacrifices a nontoken permanent for any reason, not just due to the annihilator ability.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'When the second ability resolves, you must return the card to the battlefield, even if you don’t want to.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Annihilator abilities trigger and resolve during the declare attackers step. The defending player chooses and sacrifices the required number of permanents before they declare blockers. Any creatures sacrificed this way won’t be able to block.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a creature with annihilator is attacking a planeswalker, and the defending player chooses to sacrifice that planeswalker, the attacking creature continues to attack. It may be blocked. If it isn’t blocked, it simply won’t deal combat damage to anything.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t pay any alternative costs. On the other hand, if the card has additional costs, you may pay those.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'In a casual game, the cards you cast from outside the game come from your personal collection. In a sanctioned event, those cards must come from your sideboard. Note that you can’t cast cards from exile this way; exile is a zone in the game.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'You cast Eldrazi cards from outside the game as part of the resolution of Spawnsire of Ulamog’s last ability. You may cast those cards in any order. Timing restrictions based on the card’s type (such as creature or sorcery) are ignored. Other restrictions are not (such as the one from Rule of Law). You cast all of the cards you like, putting them onto the stack, then the ability finishes resolving. The spells you cast this way will then resolve as normal, one at a time, in the opposite order that they were put on the stack. They’ll remain in the game for the remainder of that game.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Annihilator abilities trigger and resolve during the declare attackers step. The defending player chooses and sacrifices the required number of permanents before they declare blockers. Any creatures sacrificed this way won’t be able to block.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a creature with annihilator is attacking a planeswalker, and the defending player chooses to sacrifice that planeswalker, the attacking creature continues to attack. It may be blocked. If it isn’t blocked, it simply won’t deal combat damage to anything.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Lethal damage and effects that say “destroy” won’t cause a creature with indestructible to be put into the graveyard. However, a creature with indestructible can be put into the graveyard for a number of reasons. The most likely reasons are if it’s sacrificed, if it’s legendary and another legendary creature with the same name is controlled by the same player, or if its toughness is 0 or less.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Ulamog’s ability triggers as you cast it, and that ability resolves before the spell itself. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Annihilator abilities trigger and resolve during the declare attackers step. The defending player chooses and sacrifices the required number of permanents before they declare blockers. Any creatures sacrificed this way won’t be able to block.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a creature with annihilator is attacking a planeswalker, and the defending player chooses to sacrifice that planeswalker, the attacking creature continues to attack. It may be blocked. If it isn’t blocked, it simply won’t deal combat damage to anything.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Emrakul can be targeted by spells that try to counter it (such as Countersquall). Those spells will resolve, but the part of their effect that would counter Emrakul won’t do anything. Any other effects those spells have will work as normal.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Emrakul can’t be the target of colored Aura spells, but colored Auras can be put onto the battlefield enchanting it.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Emrakul’s second ability triggers as you cast it, and that ability resolves before the spell itself. It resolves even if that spell is somehow removed from the stack.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': '“Colored spells” is not synonymous with “colored cards.” For example, even though creatures are spells when they’re cast, they’re not spells when they’re on the battlefield and can block Emrakul; and triggered abilities of permanents entering the battlefield (such as that of Banishing Light) can target it.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Annihilator abilities trigger and resolve during the declare attackers step. The defending player chooses and sacrifices the required number of permanents before they declare blockers. Any creatures sacrificed this way won’t be able to block.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a creature with annihilator is attacking a planeswalker, and the defending player chooses to sacrifice that planeswalker, the attacking creature continues to attack. It may be blocked. If it isn’t blocked, it simply won’t deal combat damage to anything.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If Ulamog’s Crusher can’t attack for any reason (such as becoming tapped or having just entered the battlefield), then it doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having it attack, its controller isn’t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t have to attack in that case either.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Annihilator abilities trigger and resolve during the declare attackers step. The defending player chooses and sacrifices the required number of permanents before they declare blockers. Any creatures sacrificed this way won’t be able to block.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a creature with annihilator is attacking a planeswalker, and the defending player chooses to sacrifice that planeswalker, the attacking creature continues to attack. It may be blocked. If it isn’t blocked, it simply won’t deal combat damage to anything.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Kozilek’s first ability triggers as you cast it, and that ability resolves before the spell itself. It resolves even if the spell is countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Annihilator abilities trigger and resolve during the declare attackers step. The defending player chooses and sacrifices the required number of permanents before they declare blockers. Any creatures sacrificed this way won’t be able to block.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a creature with annihilator is attacking a planeswalker, and the defending player chooses to sacrifice that planeswalker, the attacking creature continues to attack. It may be blocked. If it isn’t blocked, it simply won’t deal combat damage to anything.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Any cards you can’t cast (because they’re lands or they have no legal targets, perhaps) or choose not to cast simply remain exiled.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t pay any alternative costs. On the other hand, if the card has optional additional costs (such as kicker or multikicker), you may pay those when you cast the card. If the card has mandatory additional costs (such as Momentous Fall does), you must pay those when you cast the card.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you control two Hellcarver Demons that deal combat damage to a player at the same time, each Demon’s ability triggers. When the first one resolves, you’ll sacrifice all permanents except that Hellcarver Demon (meaning you’ll sacrifice the other one). Then you’ll exile six cards from your library and may cast nonland cards exiled that way. After those spells resolve, the other Demon’s ability resolves. You’ll sacrifice all permanents you now control (including the first Demon and any permanents put on the battlefield as a result of the spells you just cast), exile six more cards from your library, and cast any number of them.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The cards from your library are exiled face up.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The triggered ability is mandatory. All the permanents you control, including all lands, will be sacrificed.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'You cast nonland cards from exile as part of the resolution of Hellcarver Demon’s ability. You may cast those cards in any order. Timing restrictions based on the card’s type (such as creature or sorcery) are ignored. Other restrictions are not (such as “Cast [this card] only before the combat damage step”). You cast all of the cards you like, putting them onto the stack, then Hellcarver Demon’s ability finishes resolving. The spells you cast this way will then resolve as normal, one at a time, in the opposite order that they were put on the stack.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the enchanted creature will trigger when the token is put onto the battlefield. Any “as [this creature] enters the battlefield” or “[this creature] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the enchanted creature will also work.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If the ability is activated during a turn’s end step, the token will be exiled at the beginning of the following turn’s end step.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If the enchanted creature has {X} in its mana cost (such as Protean Hydra), X is considered to be zero.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If the enchanted creature is a token, the new token copies the characteristics of the original token as stated by the effect that put it onto the battlefield, plus it has haste.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If the enchanted creature is copying something else when the ability resolves (for example, if it’s a Renegade Doppelganger), then the token enters the battlefield as a copy of whatever the enchanted creature is copying, plus it has haste.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If the token isn’t exiled when the delayed triggered ability resolves (due to Stifle, perhaps), it remains on the battlefield indefinitely. It continues to have haste.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you activate the ability and the enchanted creature leaves the battlefield before the ability resolves, you still get a token. The enchanted creature’s last existence on the battlefield is checked to see what it was (specifically, if it was itself or if it was copying something else).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Splinter Twin grants an activated ability to the enchanted creature. That creature’s controller (who is not necessarily the Aura’s controller) can activate it. The creature’s controller is the player who gets the token.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The token is exiled at the beginning of the next end step regardless of who controls it at that time, or whether Splinter Twin or the enchanted creature is still on the battlefield at that time.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The token that’s put onto the battlefield copies exactly what’s printed on the enchanted creature (unless that creature is copying something else or it’s a token; see below), plus it has haste. It doesn’t copy whether the enchanted creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras attached to it, or whether it’s been affected by any noncopy effects that changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on. In particular, it doesn’t copy the ability granted to the enchanted creature by Splinter Twin.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The token will not be kicked, even if the creature it’s copying was.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If the enchanted creature is legendary, you will have to put either the original creature or the token into the graveyard as a state-based action.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'As Aura Finesse resolves, if either target is illegal, the spell resolves but the Aura doesn’t move. You still draw a card. If both targets are illegal, Aura Finesse doesn’t resolve and you don’t draw a card.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'As Aura Finesse resolves, if the targeted Aura can’t legally enchant the targeted creature (for example, because the Aura is red and the creature has protection from red, or because the Aura has “enchant creature you control” and an opponent controls the creature), the spell resolves but the Aura doesn’t move. You still draw a card.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you target an Aura that’s attached to a creature, you may also target the creature it’s attached to. Aura Finesse won’t cause the Aura to move, but you’ll still draw a card when it resolves.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'You may target any Aura you control, and you may target any creature (including one you don’t control). Whether the Aura could legally enchant the creature is irrelevant as you’re choosing the targets.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'You still control the Aura, even if you attach it to a creature you don’t control.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'As Thought Gorger’s first ability resolves, putting a +1/+1 counter on it for each card in your hand is mandatory. The effect says “if you do” because performing that action might be impossible. If Thought Gorger has left the battlefield by the time the ability resolves, you can’t put any +1/+1 counters on it, so you won’t discard your hand.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Once an ability starts to resolve, it’s too late to respond to it. For example, you can’t count a card in your hand while determining how many +1/+1 counters Thought Gorger gets and then cast it in response. If a card is counted, it’ll be discarded.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'When Thought Gorger’s second ability resolves, its last existence on the battlefield is checked to see how many +1/+1 counters it had on it. All of them are counted, not just the ones put on it by its enters-the-battlefield ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'As a spell or ability an opponent controls resolves, if it would force you to sacrifice a permanent (as the annihilator ability does), you just don’t. That part of the effect does nothing. If that spell or ability gives you the option to sacrifice a permanent (as Prowling Pangolin’s ability does), you can’t take that option.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a spell or ability an opponent controls instructs you to perform an action unless you sacrifice a permanent (as Ogre Marauder does), you can’t choose to sacrifice a permanent. You must perform the action. On the other hand, if a spell or ability an opponent controls instructs you to sacrifice a permanent unless you perform an action (as Rishadan Brigand does), you can choose whether or not to perform the action. If you don’t perform the action, nothing happens, since you can’t sacrifice any permanents.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'This ability affects only sacrifices. It won’t stop a creature from being put into the graveyard due to lethal damage or having 0 toughness, and it won’t stop a permanent from being put into the graveyard due to the “legend rule.” None of these are sacrifices; they’re the result of game rules.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'You may sacrifice a permanent as a special action, even if the effect that allows you to do so comes from an opponent’s permanent (such as Damping Engine or Volrath’s Curse). No one controls special actions.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'You may sacrifice a permanent to pay the activation cost of an ability, even if that ability comes from a permanent an opponent controls (such as Excavation).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'You may still sacrifice permanents to pay the costs of spells you cast and abilities you activate, or because a resolving spell or ability you control instructs or allows you to do so. Notably, you may still sacrifice Eldrazi Spawn creature tokens for mana.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'As long as World at War resolves before the first postcombat main phase of a turn ends, it will have its full effect. That will happen in most cases, since it’s a sorcery (meaning it’s probably cast during the first or second main phase of a turn), and it has rebound (meaning it’ll be cast during your upkeep). If, however, it’s cast later than that, it won’t create any new phases. For example, if one World at War creates a second combat phase and a third main phase in a turn, then a second World at War is cast during that third main phase, no additional phases are created. The rebound effect still works, though.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'At the beginning of your upkeep, all delayed triggered abilities created by rebound effects trigger. You may handle them in any order. If you want to cast a card this way, you do so as part of the resolution of its delayed triggered ability. Timing restrictions based on the card’s type (if it’s a sorcery) are ignored. Other restrictions are not (such as the one from Rule of Law).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a replacement effect would cause a spell with rebound that you cast from your hand to be put somewhere else instead of your graveyard (such as Leyline of the Void might), you choose whether to apply the rebound effect or the other effect as the spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a spell with rebound that you cast from your hand doesn’t resolve for any reason (due being countered by a spell like Cancel, or because all of its targets are illegal), rebound has no effect. The spell is simply put into your graveyard. You won’t get to cast it again next turn.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you are unable to cast a card from exile this way, or you choose not to, nothing happens when the delayed triggered ability resolves. The card remains exiled for the rest of the game, and you won’t get another chance to cast the card. The same is true if the ability is countered (due to Stifle, perhaps).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a card from exile this way, it will go to your graveyard when it resolves, fails to resolve, or is countered. It won’t go back to exile.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with rebound from anywhere other than your hand (such as from your graveyard due to Sins of the Past, from your library due to cascade, or from your opponent’s hand due to Sen Triplets), rebound won’t have any effect. If you do cast it from your hand, rebound will work regardless of whether you paid its mana cost (for example, if you cast it from your hand due to Maelstrom Archangel).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with rebound from your hand and it resolves, it isn’t put into your graveyard. Rather, it’s exiled directly from the stack. Effects that care about cards being put into your graveyard won’t do anything.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Multiple World at War effects are cumulative, as long as they’re cast early enough. The first one modifies the turn structure to this: beginning phase, precombat main phase, combat phase, postcombat main phase, [new combat phase], [new postcombat main phase], ending phase. Each subsequent one inserts another combat phase and main phase into the turn after the original postcombat main phase and before the newest combat phase.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Rebound will have no effect on copies of spells because you don’t cast them from your hand.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Unlike other similar cards (such as Relentless Assault), World at War doesn’t untap the creatures that have attacked this turn when it resolves. Rather, those creatures untap when the new combat phase created by the spell begins. All creatures that attacked this turn untap, regardless of which combat phase they attacked in (if there have been more than one) or who controls them (if you’re playing a Two-Headed Giant game, for example).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'You don’t have to attack with any creatures during the new combat phase.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'At the beginning of your upkeep, all delayed triggered abilities created by rebound effects trigger. You may handle them in any order. If you want to cast a card this way, you do so as part of the resolution of its delayed triggered ability. Timing restrictions based on the card’s type (if it’s a sorcery) are ignored. Other restrictions are not (such as the one from Rule of Law).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Distortion Strike doesn’t grant an ability to the targeted creature. Rather, it affects the game rules and states something that’s now true about that creature. The creature can’t be blocked even if it loses all abilities.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a replacement effect would cause a spell with rebound that you cast from your hand to be put somewhere else instead of your graveyard (such as Leyline of the Void might), you choose whether to apply the rebound effect or the other effect as the spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a spell with rebound that you cast from your hand doesn’t resolve for any reason (due being countered by a spell like Cancel, or because all of its targets are illegal), rebound has no effect. The spell is simply put into your graveyard. You won’t get to cast it again next turn.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you are unable to cast a card from exile this way, or you choose not to, nothing happens when the delayed triggered ability resolves. The card remains exiled for the rest of the game, and you won’t get another chance to cast the card. The same is true if the ability is countered (due to Stifle, perhaps).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a card from exile this way, it will go to your graveyard when it resolves, fails to resolve, or is countered. It won’t go back to exile.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with rebound from anywhere other than your hand (such as from your graveyard due to Sins of the Past, from your library due to cascade, or from your opponent’s hand due to Sen Triplets), rebound won’t have any effect. If you do cast it from your hand, rebound will work regardless of whether you paid its mana cost (for example, if you cast it from your hand due to Maelstrom Archangel).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with rebound from your hand and it resolves, it isn’t put into your graveyard. Rather, it’s exiled directly from the stack. Effects that care about cards being put into your graveyard won’t do anything.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Rebound will have no effect on copies of spells because you don’t cast them from your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'At the beginning of your upkeep, all delayed triggered abilities created by rebound effects trigger. You may handle them in any order. If you want to cast a card this way, you do so as part of the resolution of its delayed triggered ability. Timing restrictions based on the card’s type (if it’s a sorcery) are ignored. Other restrictions are not (such as the one from Rule of Law).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'For the rebound effect to happen, Cast Through Time needs to be on the battlefield as the spell _finishes_ resolving. For example, if you cast Warp World from your hand, and as part of its resolution it puts Cast Through Time onto the battlefield, Warp World will rebound. Conversely, if Warp World shuffles your Cast Through Time into your library as part of its resolution, and doesn’t put another one onto the battlefield, it will not rebound.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a replacement effect would cause a spell with rebound that you cast from your hand to be put somewhere else instead of your graveyard (such as Leyline of the Void might), you choose whether to apply the rebound effect or the other effect as the spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a spell has restrictions on when it can be cast (for example, “Cast [this spell] only during the declare blockers step”), those restrictions may prevent you from casting it from exile during your upkeep.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a spell moves itself into another zone as part of its resolution (as Arc Blade, All Suns’ Dawn, and Beacon of Unrest do), rebound won’t get a chance to apply.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a spell with rebound that you cast from your hand doesn’t resolve for any reason (due being countered by a spell like Cancel, or because all of its targets are illegal), rebound has no effect. The spell is simply put into your graveyard. You won’t get to cast it again next turn.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a spell you cast from your hand has both rebound and buyback (and the buyback cost was paid), you choose which effect to apply as it resolves.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you are unable to cast a card from exile this way, or you choose not to, nothing happens when the delayed triggered ability resolves. The card remains exiled for the rest of the game, and you won’t get another chance to cast the card. The same is true if the ability is countered (due to Stifle, perhaps).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a card from exile this way, it will go to your graveyard when it resolves, fails to resolve, or is countered. It won’t go back to exile.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a card from exile “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t pay any alternative costs. Any X in the mana cost will be 0. On the other hand, if the card has optional additional costs (such as kicker or multikicker), you may pay those when you cast the card. If the card has mandatory additional costs (such as Momentous Fall does), you must pay those if you choose to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a spell using the madness or suspend abilities, you’re casting it from exile, not from your hand. Although those spells will have rebound, the ability won’t have any effect.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with rebound from anywhere other than your hand (such as from your graveyard due to Sins of the Past, from your library due to cascade, or from your opponent’s hand due to Sen Triplets), rebound won’t have any effect. If you do cast it from your hand, rebound will work regardless of whether you paid its mana cost (for example, if you cast it from your hand due to Maelstrom Archangel).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with rebound from your hand and it resolves, it isn’t put into your graveyard. Rather, it’s exiled directly from the stack. Effects that care about cards being put into your graveyard won’t do anything.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast an instant or sorcery spell from your hand and it’s exiled due to rebound, the delayed triggered ability will allow you to cast it during your next upkeep even if Cast Through Time has left the battlefield by then.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Multiple instances of rebound on the same spell are redundant.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Rebound will have no effect on copies of spells because you don’t cast them from your hand.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Similarly, if you gain control of an instant or sorcery spell with Commandeer, it will have rebound, but the ability won’t do anything because that spell wasn’t cast from your hand.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The rebound effect is not optional. Each instant and sorcery spell you cast from your hand is exiled instead of being put into your graveyard as it resolves, whether you want it to be or not. Casting the spell during your next upkeep is optional, however.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'You’ll be able to cast a spell with flashback three times this way. First you can cast it from your hand. It will be exiled due to rebound as it resolves. Then you can cast it from exile due to rebound’s delayed triggered ability. It will be put into your graveyard as it resolves. Then you can cast it from your graveyard due to flashback. It will be exiled due to flashback as it resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'At the beginning of your upkeep, all delayed triggered abilities created by rebound effects trigger. You may handle them in any order. If you want to cast a card this way, you do so as part of the resolution of its delayed triggered ability. Timing restrictions based on the card’s type (if it’s a sorcery) are ignored. Other restrictions are not (such as the one from Rule of Law).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a replacement effect would cause a spell with rebound that you cast from your hand to be put somewhere else instead of your graveyard (such as Leyline of the Void might), you choose whether to apply the rebound effect or the other effect as the spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a spell with rebound that you cast from your hand doesn’t resolve for any reason (due being countered by a spell like Cancel, or because all of its targets are illegal), rebound has no effect. The spell is simply put into your graveyard. You won’t get to cast it again next turn.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you are unable to cast a card from exile this way, or you choose not to, nothing happens when the delayed triggered ability resolves. The card remains exiled for the rest of the game, and you won’t get another chance to cast the card. The same is true if the ability is countered (due to Stifle, perhaps).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a card from exile this way, it will go to your graveyard when it resolves, fails to resolve, or is countered. It won’t go back to exile.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with rebound from anywhere other than your hand (such as from your graveyard due to Sins of the Past, from your library due to cascade, or from your opponent’s hand due to Sen Triplets), rebound won’t have any effect. If you do cast it from your hand, rebound will work regardless of whether you paid its mana cost (for example, if you cast it from your hand due to Maelstrom Archangel).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with rebound from your hand and it resolves, it isn’t put into your graveyard. Rather, it’s exiled directly from the stack. Effects that care about cards being put into your graveyard won’t do anything.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, anything that cares about your life total checks the life total of your team. For example, say that your team has 10 life and your opponent’s team has 11 life when you cast Survival Cache. You’ll gain 2 life, so your team’s life total becomes 12. Since your life total (12) is greater than an opponent’s life total (11), you’ll draw a card.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Rebound will have no effect on copies of spells because you don’t cast them from your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'At the beginning of your upkeep, all delayed triggered abilities created by rebound effects trigger. You may handle them in any order. If you want to cast a card this way, you do so as part of the resolution of its delayed triggered ability. Timing restrictions based on the card’s type (if it’s a sorcery) are ignored. Other restrictions are not (such as the one from Rule of Law).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a replacement effect would cause a spell with rebound that you cast from your hand to be put somewhere else instead of your graveyard (such as Leyline of the Void might), you choose whether to apply the rebound effect or the other effect as the spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a spell with rebound that you cast from your hand doesn’t resolve for any reason (due being countered by a spell like Cancel, or because all of its targets are illegal), rebound has no effect. The spell is simply put into your graveyard. You won’t get to cast it again next turn.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you are unable to cast a card from exile this way, or you choose not to, nothing happens when the delayed triggered ability resolves. The card remains exiled for the rest of the game, and you won’t get another chance to cast the card. The same is true if the ability is countered (due to Stifle, perhaps).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a card from exile this way, it will go to your graveyard when it resolves, fails to resolve, or is countered. It won’t go back to exile.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with rebound from anywhere other than your hand (such as from your graveyard due to Sins of the Past, from your library due to cascade, or from your opponent’s hand due to Sen Triplets), rebound won’t have any effect. If you do cast it from your hand, rebound will work regardless of whether you paid its mana cost (for example, if you cast it from your hand due to Maelstrom Archangel).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with rebound from your hand and it resolves, it isn’t put into your graveyard. Rather, it’s exiled directly from the stack. Effects that care about cards being put into your graveyard won’t do anything.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Rebound will have no effect on copies of spells because you don’t cast them from your hand.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'You choose the color as Emerge Unscathed resolves. Once you choose a color, it’s too late for players to respond.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'At the beginning of your upkeep, all delayed triggered abilities created by rebound effects trigger. You may handle them in any order. If you want to cast a card this way, you do so as part of the resolution of its delayed triggered ability. Timing restrictions based on the card’s type (if it’s a sorcery) are ignored. Other restrictions are not (such as the one from Rule of Law).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a replacement effect would cause a spell with rebound that you cast from your hand to be put somewhere else instead of your graveyard (such as Leyline of the Void might), you choose whether to apply the rebound effect or the other effect as the spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a spell with rebound that you cast from your hand doesn’t resolve for any reason (due being countered by a spell like Cancel, or because all of its targets are illegal), rebound has no effect. The spell is simply put into your graveyard. You won’t get to cast it again next turn.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you are unable to cast a card from exile this way, or you choose not to, nothing happens when the delayed triggered ability resolves. The card remains exiled for the rest of the game, and you won’t get another chance to cast the card. The same is true if the ability is countered (due to Stifle, perhaps).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a card from exile this way, it will go to your graveyard when it resolves, fails to resolve, or is countered. It won’t go back to exile.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with rebound from anywhere other than your hand (such as from your graveyard due to Sins of the Past, from your library due to cascade, or from your opponent’s hand due to Sen Triplets), rebound won’t have any effect. If you do cast it from your hand, rebound will work regardless of whether you paid its mana cost (for example, if you cast it from your hand due to Maelstrom Archangel).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with rebound from your hand and it resolves, it isn’t put into your graveyard. Rather, it’s exiled directly from the stack. Effects that care about cards being put into your graveyard won’t do anything.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Rebound will have no effect on copies of spells because you don’t cast them from your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Both Tuktuk the Explorer and Tuktuk the Returned are legendary creatures. However, since they have different names, one of each may coexist without being affected by the “legend rule.”'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Combat damage dealt by Haze Frog itself during the turn it enters the battlefield isn’t prevented. Combat damage that would be dealt by all other creatures is prevented, including creatures that weren’t on the battlefield at the time the ability resolved.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If two Haze Frogs enter the battlefield during the same turn, each one’s ability will prevent the other one’s combat damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Combat damage dealt by blocking creatures isn’t prevented.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Contaminated Ground’s last ability triggers whenever the enchanted land becomes tapped for any reason, not just when it’s tapped for mana.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If, while casting a spell or activating an ability, the enchanted land’s controller taps the land for mana to pay for it, Contaminated Ground’s ability triggers and goes on the stack on top of that spell or ability. Contaminated Ground’s ability will resolve first.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'On the other hand, the enchanted land’s controller may tap the land for mana, let Contaminated Ground’s ability trigger and go on the stack, then spend that mana to cast an instant or activate an ability in response. In that case, that instant or ability will resolve first.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The enchanted land loses its existing land types and any abilities printed on it. It now has the land type Swamp and has the ability to tap to add {B} to its controller’s mana pool. Contaminated Ground doesn’t change the enchanted land’s name or whether it’s legendary, basic, or snow.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Curse of Wizardry affects all players, including you.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a player casts a spell of the chosen color, Curse of Wizardry’s second ability triggers and goes on the stack on top of it. The ability will resolve before the spell does.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Domestication can target, and can enchant, a creature with power 4 or greater. The enchanted creature’s power is checked only when the triggered ability triggers and resolves.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Domestication’s triggered ability has an “intervening ‘if’ clause.” That means (1) the ability triggers only if the enchanted creature’s power is 4 or greater as your end step begins, and (2) the ability does nothing if the enchanted creature’s power is 3 or less by the time it resolves.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If an effect changes the enchanted creature’s power until end of turn, it will still have the modified power during your end step.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'During the cleanup step, Renegade Doppelganger’s copy effect wears off. It will go back to being a 0/1 blue creature named Renegade Doppelganger, and will have its original ability again. Note that this happens at the same time that damage marked on the Renegade Doppelganger is removed. If it was dealt damage earlier in the turn, this damage will not cause Renegade Doppelganger to be destroyed when its copy effect wears off.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If Renegade Doppelganger and another creature enter the battlefield under your control at the same time, Renegade Doppelganger’s ability will trigger. When the ability resolves, Renegade Doppelganger can become a copy of that creature.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If Renegade Doppelganger becomes a copy of a creature that is itself copying something else (for example, if the creature that entered the battlefield is a Clone), then Renegade Doppelganger becomes a copy of whatever that creature is copying.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If Renegade Doppelganger becomes a copy of a creature with an ability that causes you to make a choice (such as naming a card or choosing a color) as it enters the battlefield, and another ability that refers to that choice, those abilities of the Doppelganger won’t do anything. You won’t have the chance to make a choice since the Doppelganger is already on the battlefield, so the value of that choice is undefined.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If Renegade Doppelganger becomes a copy of a token, Renegade Doppelganger copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that put it onto the battlefield. Renegade Doppelganger doesn’t become a token.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If Renegade Doppelganger becomes a copy of another creature, it copies exactly what was printed on that card and nothing more (unless that card is copying something else or it’s a token; see below). It doesn’t copy whether the original creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras attached to it, or whether it’s been affected by any noncopy effects that changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If Renegade Doppelganger becomes a copy of another creature, that doesn’t count as having a creature enter the battlefield. Renegade Doppelganger was already on the battlefield; it only changed its characteristics. If Renegade Doppelganger gains any enters-the-battlefield triggered abilities, they won’t do anything. The same is true of any “as [this creature] enters the battlefield” or “[this creature] enters the battlefield with” abilities.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a creature enters the battlefield under your control and Renegade Doppelganger’s ability triggers, it can become a copy of that creature when the ability resolves even if that creature has left the battlefield by then. If it has, its last existence on the battlefield is checked to see what it was (specifically, if it was itself or if it was copying something else).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If multiple creatures enter the battlefield under your control at the same time, Renegade Doppelganger’s ability will trigger once for each of them. You choose the order that those abilities will resolve. It’s possible to have Renegade Doppelganger become a copy of something, activate an activated ability of that creature, then have it become a copy of something else under this scenario. The last ability that resolves that you choose to use determines what it ends up a copy of.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If the creature Renegade Doppelganger copies has an ability that triggers at the beginning of the end step, that ability will trigger and resolve before Renegade Doppelganger’s copy effect wears off.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Noncopy effects that have already applied to Renegade Doppelganger will continue to apply to it after it becomes a copy of something else. For example, if Giant Growth had given it +3/+3 earlier in the turn, then it becomes a copy of Runeclaw Bear (a 2/2 creature), it will be a 5/5 Runeclaw Bear.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Renegade Doppelganger’s ability isn’t targeted. It can copy a creature with shroud or protection.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'When a creature enters the battlefield under your control, you can choose not to copy it. In that case, Renegade Doppelganger remains 0/1 and still has its triggered ability.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If Renegade Doppelganger becomes a copy of a legendary creature, you will have to put one of them into the graveyard as a state-based action.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Each creature you control with a level counter on it gets just +2/+2, regardless of how many level counters it has. It doesn’t get the bonus for each counter.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Time of Heroes affects any creature you control with a level counter on it, not just levelers. (Of course, it’s pretty hard to get level counters onto a creature that’s not a leveler, but it can be done with copy effects, Fate Transfer, or Quicksilver Elemental, among other possibilities.)'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Effects that modify the targeted creature’s power or toughness, such as the effects of Giant Growth or Glorious Anthem, will apply to it no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for counters that change the creature’s power or toughness (such as +1/+1 counters) and effects that switch its power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a leveler is affected by Gigantomancer’s ability, then enough level counters are put on it to reach a level indicated by a new level symbol, it will still be 7/7, not the power and toughness indicated by that level symbol.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'This ability overwrites all previous effects that set the targeted creature’s power and toughness to specific values. Other effects that set its power or toughness to specific values that start to apply after this ability resolves will overwrite this effect.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'For a player’s life total to become a certain number that’s lower than their current life total, what actually happens is that the player loses the appropriate amount of life. For example, if the lowest life total in the game is 5 and another player has 12 life, Repay in Kind will cause that player to lose 7 life. Abilities that interact with life loss will interact with this effect accordingly.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, anything that cares about a player’s life total checks the life total of that player’s team. In addition, if an effect would cause the life total of each member of a team to become a certain number, that team chooses one of its members. On that team, only that player is affected, then the life total change is applied to the entire team. For example, if one team has 13 life and another team has 21 life, the team with the higher life total chooses one of its members and Repay in Kind causes that player to lose 8 life, thus causing that team’s life total to also be 13.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'For example: If a creature attacks but is removed from combat before Lightmine Field’s ability resolves (because it would be destroyed and regenerates, perhaps), that creature is dealt damage by Lightmine Field but isn’t counted when determining the amount of damage. On the other hand, if a creature is put onto the battlefield attacking (due to Preeminent Captain’s ability, perhaps), it isn’t dealt damage by Lightmine Field, but it is counted when determining the amount of damage.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'How much damage each of those creatures is dealt is based how many creatures are attacking at the time the ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Lightmine Field’s ability triggers when any creatures attack, including your own.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Which creatures are dealt damage is based on which creatures were declared as attackers during the declare attackers step.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'For the purpose of determining the cost reduction, the number of green creatures you control is checked as you cast Khalni Hydra, before your last chance to activate mana abilities to pay for it. For example, if you control Wild Cantor (a red and green creature with the ability “Sacrifice Wild Cantor: Add one mana of any color.”) as you cast Khalni Hydra, first the cost to cast Khalni Hydra is reduced by {G}, then you could sacrifice Wild Cantor for mana to help pay for it.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If an effect (such as the one from Lodestone Golem) imposes an additional generic mana cost to casting Khalni Hydra, the Hydra’s ability will reduce it too. It’ll reduce the amount of green mana you need to spend first, though.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Khalni Hydra’s cost reduction effect doesn’t change its mana cost or converted mana cost.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Gideon Jura’s first ability applies during each combat phase of the affected player’s next turn (as opposed to applying during the affected player’s next combat phase). The distinction is relevant if there are no combat phases during that turn (due to Fatespinner’s effect, for example) or there are multiples (due to World at War, for example).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Gideon Jura’s first ability causes creatures to attack him if able. If, during the affected player’s declare attackers step, a creature they control is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t attack, or is affected by “summoning sickness,” then that creature doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having a creature attack, the player isn’t forced to pay that cost, so the creature doesn’t have to attack in that case either.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Gideon Jura’s first ability doesn’t lock in what it applies to. That’s because the effect states a true thing about a set of creatures, but doesn’t actually change the characteristics of those creatures. As a result, whatever creatures the targeted opponent controls during the declare attackers step of their next turn must attack Gideon Jura if able. This includes creatures that come under that player’s control after the ability has resolved and creatures that have lost all abilities.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Gideon Jura’s third ability causes him to become a creature with the creature types Human Soldier. He remains a planeswalker with the planeswalker type Gideon. (He also retains any other card types or subtypes he may have had.) Each subtype is correlated to the proper card type: Gideon is just a planeswalker type (not a creature type), and Human and Soldier are just creature types (not planeswalker types).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If Gideon Jura becomes a creature due to his third ability, that doesn’t count as having a creature enter the battlefield. Gideon Jura was already on the battlefield; he only changed his types. Abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If Gideon Jura becomes a creature, he may be affected by “summoning sickness.” You can’t attack with him or use any of his {T} abilities (if he gains any) unless he began your most recent turn on the battlefield under your control. Note that summoning sickness cares about when Gideon Jura came under your control, not when he became a creature.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a creature controlled by the affected player can’t attack Gideon Jura (because he’s no longer on the battlefield, for example), that player may have it attack you, another one of your planeswalkers, or nothing at all.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you activate Gideon Jura’s third ability and then unpreventable damage is dealt to him (due to Unstable Footing, for example), that damage has all applicable results: specifically, the damage is marked on Gideon Jura (since he’s a creature) and that damage causes that many loyalty counters to be removed from him (since he’s a planeswalker). If the total amount of damage marked on Gideon Jura is lethal damage, he’s destroyed as a state-based action. If Gideon Jura has no loyalty counters on him, he’s put into his owner’s graveyard as a state-based action.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Say you activate Gideon Jura’s third ability, then an opponent gains control of him before combat. You may have any of your creatures attack Gideon Jura (since he’s still a planeswalker). Then Gideon Jura may block (since he’s a creature). He may block any eligible attacking creature, including one that’s attacking him! During combat, he behaves as an attacked planeswalker and/or a blocking creature, as appropriate. For example, he deals combat damage to any creatures he’s blocking, but he doesn’t deal combat damage to any unblocked creatures that are attacking him.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'The first ability only affects the declaration of attackers. If a creature is put onto the battlefield attacking (thanks to Hero of Bladehold, Preeminent Captain, or the Ninjutsu ability, for example), that creature’s controller may choose the defending player or planeswalker that it will be attacking in the normal way.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If Arrogant Bloodlord becomes blocked by multiple creatures with power 1 or less, its ability triggers that many times. Each of those abilities will cause it to be destroyed separately (in case Arrogant Bloodlord isn’t destroyed the first time due to an Aura with totem armor, for example). The same is true if it somehow blocks multiple creatures with power 1 or less.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If Arrogant Bloodlord blocks or becomes blocked by a creature whose power is 2 or greater, Arrogant Bloodlord’s ability won’t trigger. It still won’t trigger if the other creature’s power changes to 1 or less later in combat.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The power of the other creature is checked only when it blocks or becomes blocked by Arrogant Bloodlord. Once the Bloodlord’s ability triggers, it will be destroyed at end of combat (after combat damage has been dealt) even if the other creature’s power changes before then.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If Phantasmal Abomination becomes the target of a spell or ability, Phantasmal Abomination’s ability triggers and goes on the stack on top of that spell or ability. Phantasmal Abomination’s ability will resolve (causing it to be sacrificed) first. Unless the spell or ability has another target, it will then be countered when it tries to resolve for having no legal targets.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If Soul’s Attendant and another creature enter the battlefield at the same time, Soul’s Attendant’s ability will trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If Sphinx-Bone Wand leaves the battlefield before its ability resolves, you won’t be able to put a charge counter on it. As a result, it won’t deal damage.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If the targeted permanent or player is an illegal target by the time the ability resolves, the ability doesn’t resolve. You won’t put a charge counter on Sphinx-Bone Wand and it won’t deal damage.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast an instant or sorcery spell, Sphinx-Bone Wand’s ability triggers and goes on the stack on top of it. The ability will resolve before the spell does.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If Surrakar Spellblade leaves the battlefield after its second ability triggers but before it resolves, its last existence on the battlefield is checked to determine how many charge counters were on it.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast an instant or sorcery spell, Surrakar Spellblade’s first ability triggers and goes on the stack on top of it. The ability will resolve before the spell does.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'When Surrakar Spellblade’s second ability resolves, you either draw a card for each charge counter on it or you draw no cards at all.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a creature enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor would be destroyed by multiple state-based actions at the same time the totem armor’s effect will replace all of them and save the creature.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a permanent you control is enchanted with multiple Auras that have totem armor, and the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, one of those Auras is destroyed instead — but only one of them. You choose which one because you control the enchanted permanent.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a spell or ability (such as Planar Cleansing) would destroy both an Aura with totem armor and the permanent it’s enchanting at the same time, totem armor’s effect will save the enchanted permanent from being destroyed. Instead, the spell or ability will destroy the Aura in two different ways at the same time, but the result is the same as destroying it once.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a spell or ability says that it would “destroy” a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, that spell or ability causes the Aura to be destroyed instead. (This matters for cards such as Karmic Justice.) Totem armor doesn’t destroy the Aura; rather, it changes the effects of the spell or ability. On the other hand, if a spell or ability deals lethal damage to a creature enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, the game rules regarding lethal damage cause the Aura to be destroyed, not that spell or ability.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Only Crab Umbra’s controller (who is not necessarily the enchanted creature’s controller) can activate its activated ability.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Say you control a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, and the enchanted permanent has gained a regeneration shield. The next time it would be destroyed, you choose whether to apply the regeneration effect or the totem armor effect. The other effect is unused and remains, in case the permanent would be destroyed again.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Totem armor’s effect is applied no matter why the enchanted permanent would be destroyed: because it’s been dealt lethal damage, or because it’s being affected by an effect that says to “destroy” it (such as Doom Blade). In either case, all damage is removed from the permanent and the Aura is destroyed instead.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Totem armor’s effect is mandatory. If the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, you must remove all damage from it and destroy the Aura that has totem armor instead.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Totem armor’s effect is not regeneration. Specifically, if totem armor’s effect is applied, the enchanted permanent does not become tapped and is not removed from combat as a result. Effects that say the enchanted permanent can’t be regenerated (as Vendetta does) won’t prevent totem armor’s effect from being applied.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'When Crab Umbra’s activated ability resolves, it will untap the creature Crab Umbra is enchanting at that time (regardless of what creature Crab Umbra was enchanting when the ability was activated). If Crab Umbra has left the battlefield by then, the ability will untap the creature it was enchanting at the time it left the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If a creature enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor has indestructible, lethal damage and effects that try to destroy it simply have no effect. Totem armor won’t do anything because it won’t have to.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Say you control a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, and that Aura has gained a regeneration shield. The next time the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, the Aura would be destroyed instead — but it regenerates, so nothing is destroyed at all. Alternately, if that Aura somehow gains indestructible, the enchanted permanent is effectively indestructible as well.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Totem armor has no effect if the enchanted permanent is put into a graveyard for any other reason, such as if it’s sacrificed, if it’s legendary and another legendary permanent with the same name is controlled by the same player, or if its toughness is 0 or less.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a creature enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor would be destroyed by multiple state-based actions at the same time the totem armor’s effect will replace all of them and save the creature.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a permanent you control is enchanted with multiple Auras that have totem armor, and the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, one of those Auras is destroyed instead — but only one of them. You choose which one because you control the enchanted permanent.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a spell or ability (such as Planar Cleansing) would destroy both an Aura with totem armor and the permanent it’s enchanting at the same time, totem armor’s effect will save the enchanted permanent from being destroyed. Instead, the spell or ability will destroy the Aura in two different ways at the same time, but the result is the same as destroying it once.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a spell or ability says that it would “destroy” a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, that spell or ability causes the Aura to be destroyed instead. (This matters for cards such as Karmic Justice.) Totem armor doesn’t destroy the Aura; rather, it changes the effects of the spell or ability. On the other hand, if a spell or ability deals lethal damage to a creature enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, the game rules regarding lethal damage cause the Aura to be destroyed, not that spell or ability.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Say you control a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, and the enchanted permanent has gained a regeneration shield. The next time it would be destroyed, you choose whether to apply the regeneration effect or the totem armor effect. The other effect is unused and remains, in case the permanent would be destroyed again.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Totem armor’s effect is applied no matter why the enchanted permanent would be destroyed: because it’s been dealt lethal damage, or because it’s being affected by an effect that says to “destroy” it (such as Doom Blade). In either case, all damage is removed from the permanent and the Aura is destroyed instead.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Totem armor’s effect is mandatory. If the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, you must remove all damage from it and destroy the Aura that has totem armor instead.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Totem armor’s effect is not regeneration. Specifically, if totem armor’s effect is applied, the enchanted permanent does not become tapped and is not removed from combat as a result. Effects that say the enchanted permanent can’t be regenerated (as Vendetta does) won’t prevent totem armor’s effect from being applied.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If a creature enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor has indestructible, lethal damage and effects that try to destroy it simply have no effect. Totem armor won’t do anything because it won’t have to.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Say you control a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, and that Aura has gained a regeneration shield. The next time the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, the Aura would be destroyed instead — but it regenerates, so nothing is destroyed at all. Alternately, if that Aura somehow gains indestructible, the enchanted permanent is effectively indestructible as well.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Totem armor has no effect if the enchanted permanent is put into a graveyard for any other reason, such as if it’s sacrificed, if it’s legendary and another legendary permanent with the same name is controlled by the same player, or if its toughness is 0 or less.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a spell or ability targets you, but not a permanent you control, you can’t cast Not of This World targeting it.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Not of This World doesn’t check whether the targets of the spell or ability it’s targeting are currently legal for that spell or ability, only who controls them and what their power is. For example, say a player casts Forked Bolt targeting you and a creature you control. If, in response, another spell or ability causes that creature to gain shroud, then you can still cast Not of This World targeting Forked Bolt.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Not of This World’s first ability checks the current state of the targets of the spell or ability it’s targeting to determine whether one of them is a permanent you control. For example, say a player casts Forked Bolt targeting you and a creature you control. If, in response, another spell or ability causes that creature to no longer be under your control, then you can’t cast Not of This World targeting Forked Bolt. Alternately, if you cast Not of This World targeting Forked Bolt and, in response, another spell or ability causes that creature to no longer be under your control, Not of This World won’t resolve when it tries to resolve for having an illegal target.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Not of This World’s second ability checks the current state of the targets of the spell or ability it’s targeting to determine whether one of them is a creature you control with power 7 or greater. This check is made as you cast Not of This World, before you activate mana abilities. It doesn’t matter what the power of the creature was at the time the targeted spell or ability was cast.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The spell or ability you target with Not of This World may have any number of targets, as long as one of them is a permanent you control.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If all the cards in your library are land cards, you’ll reveal all of them, then arrange them in your library in whatever order you like. No damage is dealt.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If the targeted permanent or player is an illegal target by the time Explosive Revelation resolves, the spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t reveal any cards from your library.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Once you start revealing cards from your library, it’s too late for players to respond. If you target a creature, for example, its controller can’t wait to see how much damage will be dealt to it before casting a damage prevention spell, activating a regeneration ability, sacrificing it for some benefit, or anything else. Any such actions must be done before Explosive Revelation starts to resolve.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If another player gains control of either Demonic Appetite or the enchanted creature (but not both), Demonic Appetite will be enchanting an illegal permanent. The Aura will be put into its owner’s graveyard as a state-based action.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'When Demonic Appetite’s triggered ability resolves, you may sacrifice the creature enchanted by Demonic Appetite. If you control no other creatures, you’ll have to sacrifice that one.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If multiple nontoken creatures you control (possibly including Pawn of Ulamog itself) are put into their owners’ graveyards at the same time, Pawn of Ulamog’s triggered ability will trigger that many times.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you control more than one Pawn of Ulamog and a nontoken creature you control is put into a graveyard, each of those Pawns’ abilities will trigger. You may put up to that many Eldrazi Spawn tokens onto the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If the affected creature attacks, the defending player must assign at least one blocker to it during the declare blockers step, unless that player controls no creatures that could block it.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If the targeted creature is an illegal target by the time Irresistible Prey resolves, the spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t draw a card.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The creature affected by Irresistible Prey doesn’t have to attack that turn.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'You can target a creature you don’t control or that otherwise couldn’t attack that turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If the equipped creature doesn’t have defender, the second ability simply doesn’t affect it.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The second ability doesn’t cause the equipped creature to lose defender. It just lets it attack.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If the targeted creature is a legal target by the time the second ability resolves but its controller can’t sacrifice it (due to Tajuru Preserver, perhaps), the ability continues to resolve. That player gets a Dragon token.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If the targeted creature is an illegal target by the time the second ability resolves, the ability doesn’t resolve. The player won’t get a Dragon token.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you target an opponent with the third ability, you choose separately for each Dragon creature you control whether or not to redirect the damage dealt by that Dragon to a planeswalker that player controls.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Once the first ability starts to resolve and you reveal the top card of your library (and see how much damage Sarkhan the Mad deals to himself), it’s too late to respond.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The first ability causes Sarkhan to deal damage directly to himself, resulting in that many loyalty counters being removed from him. The damage would never have been dealt to you, so prevention effects that would prevent damage from being dealt to you won’t affect it.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Unlike previous planeswalkers, Sarkhan the Mad has no way to raise his loyalty.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'You choose a single target as you activate the third ability. All your Dragons deal damage to that player.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If the targeted creature is a token, it will cease to exist after it’s put into its owner’s library.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If the targeted creature is an illegal target by the time Oust resolves, the spell doesn’t resolve. No one gains life.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If the targeted creature’s owner has no cards left in their library, that creature is put into that library as the only card there.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If the targeted creature’s owner has one or more cards in their library, that creature is put into that library directly under the top card.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Note that the creature’s controller, not its owner, is the one who gains life.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If the targeted creature is an illegal target by the time Fleeting Distraction resolves, the spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t draw a card.'}, {'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'If the targeted creature is an illegal target when Fleeting Distraction tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won’t draw a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If the targeted creature is an illegal target by the time Last Kiss resolves, the spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t gain life.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'You gain 2 life even if the damage is prevented.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If the targeted creature is an illegal target by the time Vendetta resolves, the spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t lose life.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If the targeted creature isn’t destroyed due to totem armor’s effect, Vendetta continues to resolve. You lose life equal to the creature’s current toughness (after the Aura with totem armor has been destroyed).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The destroyed creature’s last existence on the battlefield is checked to determine its toughness.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If the targeted creature is an illegal target by the time the ability resolves, the ability doesn’t resolve. Drana won’t get the bonus.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The value of X may exceed the targeted creature’s toughness. Drana’s bonus is based on the value of X, regardless of what the targeted creature’s toughness was.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'You may target Drana itself with its ability. For example, if you do and X is 3, Drana will become 7/1 until end of turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If the targeted creature is an illegal target by the time the ability resolves, the ability doesn’t resolve. Its controller won’t be dealt damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If the targeted creature is an illegal target by the time the ability resolves, the ability doesn’t resolve. You won’t draw a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If the targeted player becomes an illegal target by the time Suffer the Past resolves but the targeted cards don’t, you still exile the cards and gain life. The player won’t be lose any life, though.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Suffer the Past’s effect causes a single life-gain event, not a number of separate ones. This matters for cards such as Cradle of Vitality.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The life that’s lost and the life that’s gained are based on the number of cards that are actually exiled, not on the value of X (in case any of the targeted cards somehow leave the graveyard in response and thus can’t be exiled this way).'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If the targeted player’s hand is empty, you can’t choose a card for that player to shuffle into their library. No shuffle occurs.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If the targeted spell is an illegal target by the time Lay Bare resolves, Lay Bare doesn’t resolve. You won’t look at its controller’s hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If the top card of your library is both a creature card and a land card (as Dryad Arbor is), Mul Daya Channelers gets both bonuses.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If the top card of your library changes while you’re casting a spell or activating an ability, the new top card won’t be revealed until you finish casting that spell or activating that ability.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The top card of your library isn’t in your hand, so you can’t suspend it, cycle it, discard it, or activate any of its activated abilities.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'When playing with the top card of your library revealed, if an effect tells you to draw several cards, reveal each one before you draw it.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast an instant or sorcery spell, Kiln Fiend’s ability triggers and goes on the stack on top of it. The ability will resolve before the spell does.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you put a single token onto the battlefield this way, it’s exactly like the ones specified earlier: it’s a 0/1 colorless Eldrazi Spawn creature token that has “Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}.”'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Whether you control an Eldrazi Spawn is checked as Brood Birthing resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you sacrifice an attacking or blocking creature during the declare blockers step, it won’t deal combat damage. If you wait until the combat damage step, but the creature you wish to sacrifice is dealt lethal damage, it’ll be destroyed before you get a chance to sacrifice it.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'You can sacrifice Bloodthrone Vampire to activate its own ability, but it won’t be on the battlefield to get the bonus.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you’re dealt enough damage to reduce your life total to 0 or less, you’ll lose the game before you can put charge counters on Angelheart Vial.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If, during its controller’s declare attackers step, a creature affected by Rage Nimbus’s activated ability is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t attack, or is affected by “summoning sickness,” then that creature doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having that creature attack, its controller isn’t forced to pay that cost, so the creature doesn’t have to attack in that case either.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If, during its controller’s declare attackers step, the enchanted creature is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t attack, or is affected by “summoning sickness,” then that creature doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having that creature attack, its controller isn’t forced to pay that cost, so the creature doesn’t have to attack in that case either.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Lust for War’s triggered ability triggers when the enchanted creature becomes tapped for any reason, not just when it attacks.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, anything that cares about your life total checks your team’s life total. You’ll win the game if your team has exactly 1 life.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'This ability has an “intervening ‘if’ clause.” That means (1) the ability triggers only if you have exactly 1 life as your upkeep begins, and (2) the ability does nothing if your life total is anything other than 1 by the time it resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Narcolepsy doesn’t keep the enchanted creature continually tapped. The creature untaps during its controller’s untap step as normal, then is tapped when Narcolepsy’s ability resolves during that upkeep. The creature may be tapped in response (for example, if it has an activated ability with {T} in its cost).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Narcolepsy’s triggered ability has an “intervening ‘if’ clause.” That means (1) the ability triggers only if the enchanted creature is untapped as any player’s upkeep begins, and (2) the ability does nothing if the enchanted creature is already tapped by the time it resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Only creatures on the battlefield as Shrivel resolves are affected.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Only creatures you control as the activated ability resolves are affected.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Pestilence Demon deals 1 damage to itself, as well as to each other creature and each player.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Since Bramblesnap’s activated ability doesn’t have a tap symbol in its cost, you can tap a creature (including Bramblesnap itself) that hasn’t been under your control since your most recent turn began to pay the cost.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Soulsurge Elemental’s power is continuously calculated, regardless of where it is. If it’s on the battlefield, it counts itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Stalwart Shield-Bearers continually checks which creatures you control have defender and gives the bonus only to them. If an effect causes a creature with defender to lose defender (as Shoal Serpent does), Stalwart Shield-Bearers stops giving it the bonus for as long as it doesn’t have defender. On the other hand, if a spell or ability causes a creature to be able to attack as though it didn’t have defender (as Warmonger’s Chariot does), Stalwart Shield-Bearers continues to give it the bonus because it never actually loses the defender ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The ability doesn’t grant an ability to the targeted creature. Rather, it affects the game rules and states something that’s now true about that creature. After the ability resolves, the creature can’t be blocked that turn even if it loses all abilities.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The power of the targeted creature is checked both as you target it and as the ability resolves. After the ability resolves, the creature can’t be blocked that turn even if its power becomes greater than 2.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The card you shuffle into your library may be any card from your hand. It doesn’t have to be one of the cards you drew with the spell.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'You have to shuffle a card from your hand into your library even if you don’t draw any cards (due to replacement effects or Maralen of the Mornsong’s ability, for example). If your hand is empty, you don’t shuffle your library.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The controller of Luminous Wake (who is not necessarily the controller of the enchanted creature) controls the triggered ability and gains life when it resolves. In other words, if you enchant your opponent’s creature with Luminous Wake, you — not your opponent — gain life whenever that creature attacks or blocks.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'When the enchanted creature blocks, Luminous Wake’s ability triggers just once, even if that creature somehow blocked multiple attacking creatures.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The power of the targeted creature is checked both as you target it and as the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The sacrificed creature’s last known existence on the battlefield is checked to determine its power and its toughness.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Players can only respond once this spell has been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try to destroy the creature you sacrificed to prevent you from casting this spell.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'You must sacrifice exactly one creature to cast this spell; you cannot cast it without sacrificing a creature, and you cannot sacrifice additional creatures.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'When Escaped Null blocks or becomes blocked, its last ability triggers just once, no matter how many creatures Escaped Null blocked or became blocked by.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'When Merfolk Skyscout blocks, its second ability triggers just once, even if it somehow blocked multiple attacking creatures.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'You may target any permanent with the ability, including Merfolk Skyscout itself or a permanent that’s already untapped.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Whether you control more creatures than the targeted spell’s controller is checked only as Unified Will resolves. If that player controls more creatures than you at this time, or you each control the same amount, Unified Will simply doesn’t do anything.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'You choose Reality Spasm’s mode as you cast it.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'You may target any permanents with Reality Spasm, regardless of whether they’re tapped or untapped.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'You divide the damage as you cast Forked Bolt, not as it resolves. Each target must be assigned at least 1 damage. (In other words, as you cast Forked Bolt, you choose whether to have it deal 2 damage to a single target, or deal 1 damage to each of two targets.)'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'You don’t choose which creatures to tap until the ability resolves. You may tap Jaddi Lifestrider itself this way, assuming it’s still on the battlefield untapped by this time.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'You may choose just the first mode (targeting an artifact), just the second mode (targeting a nonbasic land), or both modes (targeting an artifact and a nonbasic land). You can’t choose a mode unless there’s a legal target for it.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'You may reveal fewer than four land cards if you like. If you reveal one or two cards, those cards are put into your graveyard. If you reveal three cards, an opponent will choose two of those cards and you’ll put them into your graveyard; the remaining revealed card is put into your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'You may sacrifice zero lands as you cast Devastating Summons. If you do, you’ll put two 0/0 creature tokens onto the battlefield as the spell resolves. Unless some effect (such as the one from Glorious Anthem) is boosting their toughness, they’ll be put into the graveyard as a state-based action. Abilities that trigger when a creature enters the battlefield will trigger, as will those that trigger when a creature leaves the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'You may target a creature that’s already untapped.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'You retain control of the affected creature until end of turn, even if you lose control of Conquering Manticore before then.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'You may target a creature you already control. You may target a creature that’s already untapped.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'You put an Eldrazi Spawn token onto the battlefield whether or not you put a basic land card onto the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Effects that switch power and toughness apply after all other effects that change power and/or toughness, regardless of which effect was created first.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Switching a creature’s power and toughness twice (or any even number of times) effectively returns the creature to the power and toughness it had before any switches.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Lethal damage and effects that say “destroy” won’t cause a creature with indestructible to be put into the graveyard. However, a creature with indestructible can be put into the graveyard for a number of reasons. The most likely reasons are if it’s sacrificed, if it’s legendary and another legendary creature with the same name is controlled by the same player, or if its toughness is 0 or less.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-02-01', 'text': 'If you target yourself with this spell, you must reveal your entire hand to the other players just as any other player would.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'The mana generated by the last ability can’t be spent to activate abilities of Eldrazi sources that aren’t on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'Activated abilities contain a colon. They’re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keywords are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'Linvala’s last ability affects only creatures on the battlefield. Activated abilities that work in other zones (such as bloodrush or unearth) can still be activated. Triggered abilities (starting with “when,” “whenever,” or “at”) are unaffected.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'No abilities of creatures your opponents control can be activated, including mana abilities.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': "Battle-Rattle Shaman\'s ability triggers when the beginning of combat step starts during each of your turns. It resolves before you declare attackers."}, {\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability causes your turn to have multiple combat phases, Battle Rattle Shaman\'s ability triggers during each of them."}]', "[{'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'If a creature is sacrificed as a cost to cast a spell or activate an ability, Mortician Beetle’s ability resolves before that spell or ability.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'Mortician Beetle’s ability triggers whenever any player, including you, sacrifices a creature because some other spell, ability, or cost instructed the player to do so. Mortician Beetle itself doesn’t allow you to sacrifice any creatures.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'If there’s only one card in your library as Sea Gate Oracle’s ability resolves, you’ll put it into your hand.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "Overgrown Battlement\'s last ability is a mana ability. It doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to (such as by removing creatures with defender you control)."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor has indestructible, lethal damage and effects that try to destroy it simply have no effect. Totem armor won\'t do anything because it won\'t have to."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor would be destroyed by multiple state-based actions at the same time (most likely because a creature with deathtouch has dealt damage to that creature greater than or equal to its toughness) totem armor\'s effect will replace all of them and save the creature."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If a permanent you control is enchanted with multiple Auras that have totem armor, and the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, one of those Auras is destroyed instead — but only one of them. You choose which one because you control the enchanted permanent.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability (such as Akroma\'s Vengeance) would destroy both an Aura with totem armor and the permanent it\'s enchanting at the same time, totem armor\'s effect will save the enchanted permanent from being destroyed. Instead, the spell or ability will destroy the Aura in two different ways at the same time, but the result is the same as destroying it once."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability says that it would “destroy” a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, that spell or ability is what causes the Aura to be destroyed instead. Totem armor doesn\'t destroy the Aura; rather, it changes the effects of the spell or ability. On the other hand, if a spell or ability deals lethal damage to a creature enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, the game rules regarding lethal damage cause the Aura to be destroyed, not that spell or ability."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Totem armor has no effect if the enchanted permanent is put into a graveyard for any other reason, such as if it\'s sacrificed, if the “legend rule” applies to it, or if its toughness is 0 or less."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Totem armor\'s effect is applied no matter why the enchanted permanent would be destroyed: because it\'s been dealt lethal damage, or because it\'s being affected by an effect that says to “destroy” it (such as Putrefy). In either case, all damage is removed from the permanent and the Aura is destroyed instead."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Totem armor\'s effect is mandatory. If the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, you must remove all damage from it (if it has any) and destroy the Aura that has totem armor instead."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Totem armor\'s effect is not regeneration. Specifically, if totem armor\'s effect is applied, the enchanted permanent does not become tapped and is not removed from combat as a result. Effects that say the enchanted permanent can\'t be regenerated (as Putrefy does) won\'t prevent totem armor\'s effect from being applied."}]', "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor has indestructible, lethal damage and effects that try to destroy it simply have no effect. Totem armor won’t do anything because it won’t have to.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor would be destroyed by multiple state-based actions at the same time (most likely because a creature with deathtouch has dealt damage to that creature greater than or equal to its toughness) totem armor’s effect will replace all of them and save the creature.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a permanent you control is enchanted with multiple Auras that have totem armor, and the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, one of those Auras is destroyed instead — but only one of them. You choose which one because you control the enchanted permanent.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a spell or ability (such as Akroma’s Vengeance) would destroy both an Aura with totem armor and the permanent it’s enchanting at the same time, totem armor’s effect will save the enchanted permanent from being destroyed. Instead, the spell or ability will destroy the Aura in two different ways at the same time, but the result is the same as destroying it once.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a spell or ability says that it would “destroy” a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, that spell or ability is what causes the Aura to be destroyed instead. Totem armor doesn’t destroy the Aura; rather, it changes the effects of the spell or ability. On the other hand, if a spell or ability deals lethal damage to a creature enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, the game rules regarding lethal damage cause the Aura to be destroyed, not that spell or ability.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Totem armor has no effect if the enchanted permanent is put into a graveyard for any other reason, such as if it’s sacrificed, if the “legend rule” applies to it, or if its toughness is 0 or less.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Totem armor’s effect is applied no matter why the enchanted permanent would be destroyed: because it’s been dealt lethal damage, or because it’s being affected by an effect that says to “destroy” it (such as Putrefy). In either case, all damage is removed from the permanent and the Aura is destroyed instead.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Totem armor’s effect is mandatory. If the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, you must remove all damage from it (if it has any) and destroy the Aura that has totem armor instead.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Totem armor’s effect is not regeneration. Specifically, if totem armor’s effect is applied, the enchanted permanent does not become tapped and is not removed from combat as a result. Effects that say the enchanted permanent can’t be regenerated (as Putrefy does) won’t prevent totem armor’s effect from being applied.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'A creature with 0 power can attack, as long as it doesn’t also have defender.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If a creature is attacking a planeswalker, and that planeswalker leaves the battlefield, that attacking creature can still be blocked. If it’s unblocked, the attacking creature is still attacking. It simply deals no combat damage.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If the attacking creature leaves the battlefield before Raid Bombardment’s triggered ability resolves, Raid Bombardment deals 1 damage to the player or planeswalker that creature was attacking before it left the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If you attack with multiple creatures with power 2 or less, Raid Bombardment’s ability triggers for each of them separately.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'The power of the attacking creature is checked only when the ability triggers. Once it triggers, Raid Bombardment will deal 1 damage to the appropriate player or planeswalker even if the creature’s power changes before the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If you target one creature and that target is illegal as Repel the Darkness resolves, the spell doesn’t resolve. You don’t draw a card.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If you target two creatures and they’re both illegal as Repel the Darkness resolves, the spell doesn’t resolve; you don’t draw a card. If just one target is illegal, the spell does resolve; the remaining legal target becomes tapped (if it’s untapped at that time) and you draw a card.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If you target zero creatures, all that happens is you draw a card.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'You may target zero, one, or two creatures. The creatures don’t need to be untapped.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'You can sacrifice Magmaw to pay the cost for its own ability. It still deals 1 damage to the target.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If any of the targeted creatures is an illegal target by the time Wrap in Flames resolves, it won’t be dealt damage and will be able to block. The other targeted creatures will still be affected.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The “can’t block” effect applies to each of the targeted creatures—and to only those creatures—even if Wrap in Flames deals no damage to one or more of them (due to a prevention effect, for example) or if Wrap in Flames deals damage to a different creature (due to a redirection effect).'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Vengevine\'s ability triggers only for the second creature spell you cast in a turn. It won\'t trigger for the third, fourth, or so on. It also doesn\'t matter how many noncreature spells you cast in a turn; the ability counts only the creature spells."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Vengevine\'s triggered ability checks the spells you cast over the course of the entire turn, not just the ones you cast while Vengevine is in your graveyard. For example, if you cast a creature spell, then Vengevine is put into your graveyard, then you cast another creature spell, Vengevine\'s ability triggers."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Vengevine\'s triggered ability works only if Vengevine is already in your graveyard as you finish casting your second creature spell in a turn and if it remains there until the triggered ability resolves."}]', "[{'date': '2020-08-07', 'text': 'For example, if you choose for X to be 1, you pay {2}{G} and create one 1/1 Ooze. If X is 2, you pay {4}{G} and create two 2/2 Oozes. If X is 3, {6}{G} gets you three 3/3 Oozes, and so on.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If you target a creature you control with Might of the Masses, remember to count that creature when determining the amount of the bonus.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "The size of the bonus is determined as Might of the Masses resolves; it won\'t change if the number of creatures you control changes later in the turn."}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Objects with no mana cost, including lands that could produce colored mana, are colorless by default.'}]"]
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': \'Abtrünniger Doppelgänger\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine andere Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du den Abtrünnigen Doppelgänger bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer Kopie dieser Kreatur werden lassen. (Falls er das tut, verliert er diese Fähigkeit für den Rest des Zuges.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Gestaltwandler\', \'flavor\': \'Um eine Kreatur wirklich kennen zu lernen, sollte man eine Meile auf ihren Tentakeln rutschen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217410&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1322d479-f2e2-4741-a151-fb5041b749a2\', \'multiverseId\': 217410}, \'multiverseid\': 217410}, {\'name\': \'Duplicante renegado\', \'text\': \'Siempre que otra criatura entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes hacer que el Duplicante renegado se convierta en una copia de esa criatura hasta el final del turno. (Si lo hace, pierde esta habilidad por el resto del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Metamorfo\', \'flavor\': \'Para realmente conocer una criatura, repta un kilómetro sobre sus tentáculos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217162&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67886153-044b-45f3-8a65-6c5616db39f7\', \'multiverseId\': 217162}, \'multiverseid\': 217162}, {\'name\': \'Doppelganger renégat\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une autre créature arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez faire que le Doppelganger renégat devienne une copie de cette créature jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (S\'il fait ainsi, il perd cette capacité pour le reste du tour.)", \'type\': \'Créature : changeforme\', \'flavor\': \'Pour vraiment connaître une créature, mettez-vous à sa place.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215674&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16b15202-a6c6-40d5-9923-5aafa24aa9d8\', \'multiverseId\': 215674}, \'multiverseid\': 215674}, {\'name\': \'Mutaforma Rinnegato\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un\'altra creatura entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi far diventare il Mutaforma Rinnegato una copia di quella creatura fino alla fine del turno. (Se lo fa, perde questa abilità per il resto del turno.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Polimorfo\', \'flavor\': \'Per conoscere veramente una creatura, striscia per un miglio nei suoi tentacoli.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216418&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12404325-220d-44ee-a49b-ba4ffa0a83b7\', \'multiverseId\': 216418}, \'multiverseid\': 216418}, {\'name\': \'背教のドッペルゲンガー\', \'text\': \'他のクリーチャーが１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは「背教のドッペルゲンガーはターン終了時までそのクリーチャーのコピーになる。」を選んでもよい。 （そうした場合、それはターンの残りの間この能力を失う。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 多相の戦士\', \'flavor\': \'魔物を真に知りたければ、その触手をつけて遠くまで這いずってみればいい。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216666&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fee98fa6-4885-4007-b2c1-b6ba70724474\', \'multiverseId\': 216666}, \'multiverseid\': 216666}, {\'name\': \'Doppelganger Renegado\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que outra criatura entra no campo de batalha sob o seu controle, você pode fazer com que Doppelganger Renegado se torne uma cópia daquela criatura até o final do turno. (Se ela se tornar, perderá esta habilidade pelo restante do turno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Metamorfo\', \'flavor\': \'Para conhecer verdadeiramente uma criatura, deslize um quilômetro em seus tentáculos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216914&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bc51f79-44c9-44f3-aa16-0076fc834119\', \'multiverseId\': 216914}, \'multiverseid\': 216914}, {\'name\': \'Двойник-Ренегат\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз когда другое существо выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, вы можете заставить Двойника-Ренегата стать копией того существа до конца хода. (Если он это делает, он теряет эту способность до окончания хода.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Имитатор\', \'flavor\': \'Чтобы по-настоящему узнать существо, нужно проползти милю-другую в его щупальцах.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215922&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b1d423a-26cc-4c44-b40f-e1271ce1aaf5\', \'multiverseId\': 215922}, \'multiverseid\': 215922}, {\'name\': \'反叛化妖\', \'text\': \'每当另一个生物在你的操控下进战场时，你可以令反叛化妖成为该生物的复制品直到回合结束。 （如果它如此作，则它在本回合剩下的时段内会失去此异能。）\', \'type\': \'生物～变形兽\', \'flavor\': \'要真正了解一个生物，得在他触手中滑行一哩。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34b505ce-d9f0-463d-99c8-9a0adfda1b24\', \'multiverseId\': 216170}, \'multiverseid\': 216170}]', '[{\'name\': \'Alles zu Staub\', \'text\': \'Alle Spieler opfern alle farbigen bleibenden Karten, die sie kontrollieren.\', \'type\': \'Stammeshexerei — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Wiedererscheinen der Eldrazi ist nicht unbedingt eine schlechte Sache, zumindest wenn man bereits ein erfülltes Leben ohne Reue hinter sich hat." —Javad Nasrin, Reliktensammler aus Ondu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217455&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3131744-aa6b-4e78-b42c-3cfda2b4f365\', \'multiverseId\': 217455}, \'multiverseid\': 217455}, {\'name\': \'Todo es polvo\', \'text\': \'Cada jugador sacrifica todos los permanentes de color que controla.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro tribal — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'"El surgimiento de los eldrazi no es necesariamente malo, siempre y cuando hayas vivido plenamente y sin arrepentimientos." —Javad Nasrin, cazadora de reliquias de Ondu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217207&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a03bf554-1f51-4068-ae20-23e9e5ec382b\', \'multiverseId\': 217207}, \'multiverseid\': 217207}, {\'name\': "Tout n\'est que poussière", \'text\': "Chaque joueur sacrifie tous les permanents colorés qu\'il contrôle.", \'type\': \'Rituel tribal : eldrazi\', \'flavor\': "« L\'apparition des Eldrazi n\'est pas nécessairement une mauvaise chose, tant que vous avez déjà eu une vie bien remplie, satisfaisante et sans regrets. » —Javad Nasrin, chasseuse de relique du Ondou", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215719&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d1c9252-218a-468d-8f9e-6655d1c9a676\', \'multiverseId\': 215719}, \'multiverseid\': 215719}, {\'name\': \'Tutto è Polvere\', \'text\': \'Ogni giocatore sacrifica tutti i permanenti colorati che controlla.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria Tribale — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'"La comparsa degli Eldrazi non è necessariamente negativa, purché tu abbia già vissuto una vita piena e appagata senza alcun rimpianto." —Javad Nasrin, cacciatrice di reliquie di Ondu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216463&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77aae25e-df3f-44cb-9420-c8f5a9486e31\', \'multiverseId\': 216463}, \'multiverseid\': 216463}, {\'name\': \'全ては塵\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーは、自分がコントロールするすべての有色のパーマネントを生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'部族ソーサリー — エルドラージ\', \'flavor\': \'「エルドラージが目覚めたからって悪いことばかりじゃないさ。お前さんの人生が後悔の無い完璧に満たされたやつだったんならな。」 ――オンドゥの遺物狩り、ジャヴァド・ナスリン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216711&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f63ef4b-fbfa-49f7-93cd-b30f999e0c03\', \'multiverseId\': 216711}, \'multiverseid\': 216711}, {\'name\': \'Tudo é Poeira\', \'text\': \'Cada jogador sacrifica todas as permanentes coloridas que ele controla.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço Tribal — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'"A ascensão dos Eldrazi não é necessariamente uma coisa ruim, desde que você já tenha vivido uma vida completa e satisfatória." — Javad Nasrin, caçadora de relíquias de Ondu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216959&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c39d3a9-7329-4633-a33d-2be3225dbe37\', \'multiverseId\': 216959}, \'multiverseid\': 216959}, {\'name\': \'Все Прах\', \'text\': \'Каждый игрок приносит в жертву все цветные перманенты под своим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Племенное Волшебство — Эльдрази\', \'flavor\': \'«Приход Эльдрази совсем не обязательно означает несчастье, если ты уже прожил насыщенную и полноценную жизнь без сожалений». — Джавад Назрин, охотница за реликвиями из Онду\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215967&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b678e77-b447-43a6-9665-fec15e09fbb5\', \'multiverseId\': 215967}, \'multiverseid\': 215967}, {\'name\': \'尽归尘土\', \'text\': \'每位牌手牺牲所有由他所操控的有色永久物。\', \'type\': \'部族法术～奥札奇\', \'flavor\': \'「奥札奇兴起不一定是件坏事，只要你已经满意自己无怨无悔的人生就行。」 ～昂度猎宝人贾维纳金\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216215&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14dabb9f-5fce-4722-9077-92e25d26d71a\', \'multiverseId\': 216215}, \'multiverseid\': 216215}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arroganter Blutfürst\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Arrogante Blutfürst eine Kreatur mit Stärke 1 oder weniger blockt oder von ihr geblockt wird, zerstöre den Arroganten Blutfürsten am Ende des Kampfes.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Ritter\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich würde mich eher selbst köpfen, als mich von so einem Möchtegern mit einem Schild und einem Traum aufhalten zu lassen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217365&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bb697ea-90d7-4fc6-b894-363fba8f7387\', \'multiverseId\': 217365}, \'multiverseid\': 217365}, {\'name\': \'Señor sangriento arrogante\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Señor sangriento arrogante bloquee o sea bloqueado por una criatura con fuerza de 1 o menos, destruye al Señor sangriento arrogante al final del combate.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Preferiría decapitarme antes que ser vencido por un mamarracho con un escudo y un sueño."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217117&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdd5e65f-c119-496c-aef0-e680c7f50c08\', \'multiverseId\': 217117}, \'multiverseid\': 217117}, {\'name\': \'Seigneur de sang arrogant\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que le Seigneur de sang arrogant bloque ou devient bloqué par une créature de force inférieure ou égale à 1, détruisez le Seigneur de sang arrogant à la fin du combat.\', \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et chevalier\', \'flavor\': "« Je préférerais encore m\'arracher la tête qu\'être contrarié par un misérable présomptueux armé d\'un bouclier et d\'un rêve. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215629&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27df3e8b-df3a-4416-aca6-92d541932c94\', \'multiverseId\': 215629}, \'multiverseid\': 215629}, {\'name\': \'Arrogante Signore Sanguinario\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta l\'Arrogante Signore Sanguinario blocca o viene bloccato da una creatura con forza pari o inferiore a 1, distruggi l\'Arrogante Signore Sanguinario alla fine del combattimento.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Preferirei staccarmi la testa da solo piuttosto che trovarmi di fronte un vile presuntuoso con uno scudo e un sogno."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216373&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'004e702c-af05-48a0-ae13-63c3a44a81f8\', \'multiverseId\': 216373}, \'multiverseid\': 216373}, {\'name\': \'尊大な血王\', \'text\': \'尊大な血王がパワーが１以下のクリーチャーをブロックするかパワーが１以下のクリーチャーにブロックされた状態になるたび、戦闘終了時に、尊大な血王を破壊する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・騎士\', \'flavor\': \'「鎧と夢を抱えた無遠慮な馬鹿共に邪魔されるぐらいなら、自分の頭を刈るわい。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216621&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15068ae7-c275-4b25-9441-1848b32e14e4\', \'multiverseId\': 216621}, \'multiverseid\': 216621}, {\'name\': \'Senhor Vampiro Arrogante\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Senhor Vampiro Arrogante bloquear ou for bloqueado por uma criatura com poder menor ou igual a 1, destrua Senhor Vampiro Arrogante no final do combate.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Prefiro degolar a mim mesmo do que ter meus planos frustrados por um coitado presunçoso armado de um escudo e um sonho."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216869&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba6bd5e5-8a73-4d4a-8ed0-10c226789306\', \'multiverseId\': 216869}, \'multiverseid\': 216869}, {\'name\': \'Высокомерный Кровавый Лорд\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз когда Высокомерный Кровавый Лорд блокирует или становится заблокирован существом с силой 1 или меньше, уничтожьте Высокомерного Кровавого Лорда в конце боя.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир Рыцарь\', \'flavor\': \'«Я лучше отрублю себе голову, чем уступлю дорогу какому-то жалкому наглецу с мечом и мечтой».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215877&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de107351-668d-4fad-aef5-7cfd20006da8\', \'multiverseId\': 215877}, \'multiverseid\': 215877}, {\'name\': \'傲慢血领\', \'text\': \'每当力量为1或更少的生物阻挡傲慢血领、或被傲慢血领所阻挡，则在战斗结束时消灭傲慢血领。\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼／骑士\', \'flavor\': \'「与其让这拿着护盾、抱着梦想的放肆劣货在面前叫嚷，我还宁愿砍掉自己的头。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216125&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a96dd41f-bf66-4d69-85fb-db77d1c38b2a\', \'multiverseId\': 216125}, \'multiverseid\': 216125}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aura-Knurrer\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, deren Stärke niedriger ist als die des Aura-Knurrers, können ihn nicht blocken.\\nDer Aura-Knurrer erhält +1/+1 für jede Aura im Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn du einen Knurrer nicht mit dem ersten Schlag tötest, zeigt er dir begierig, wie man es macht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217342&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5d44ede-d920-4b54-acce-1b6d87b1ba1c\', \'multiverseId\': 217342}, \'multiverseid\': 217342}, {\'name\': \'Gnárlido de aura\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas con fuerza menor que el Gnárlido de aura no pueden bloquearlo.\\nEl Gnárlido de aura obtiene +1/+1 por cada aura en el campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'Si no acabas con un gnárlido con tu primer golpe, él te enseñará gustoso cómo se hace.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217094&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'888af0f6-be14-4887-a01c-883be01ab095\', \'multiverseId\': 217094}, \'multiverseid\': 217094}, {\'name\': "Gnarlide d\'aura", \'text\': "Les créatures dont la force est inférieure à celle du Gnarlide d\'aura ne peuvent pas le bloquer.\\nLe Gnarlide d\'aura gagne +1/+1 pour chaque aura sur le champ de bataille.", \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': "Il faut tuer un gnarlide du premier coup ou il se fera un plaisir de vous montrer comment s\'y prendre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215606&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68a7a423-f064-4f65-87f2-dd42c316fd2e\', \'multiverseId\': 215606}, \'multiverseid\': 215606}, {\'name\': "Gnarlid dell\'Aura", \'text\': "Le creature con forza inferiore a quella del Gnarlid dell\'Aura non possono bloccarlo.\\nIl Gnarlid dell\'Aura prende +1/+1 per ogni Aura sul campo di battaglia.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'Uccidi un gnarlid al primo colpo o ti mostrerà volentieri come si fa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216350&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63d673ca-3b28-43c9-a887-c0c187a3e711\', \'multiverseId\': 216350}, \'multiverseid\': 216350}, {\'name\': \'オーラのナーリッド\', \'text\': \'オーラのナーリッドよりもパワーの小さいクリーチャーは、それをブロックできない。\\nオーラのナーリッドは、戦場に出ているオーラ１つにつき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'ナーリッドを殺すなら一撃で仕留めろ。さもなくば、そいつは喜んでその効き目を教えてくれるだろう。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216598&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d16e14c7-ebc8-4891-9f19-75ca9d302701\', \'multiverseId\': 216598}, \'multiverseid\': 216598}, {\'name\': \'Gnarlid de Aura\', \'text\': \'As criaturas com poder menor que o de Gnarlid de Aura não podem bloqueá-lo.\\nGnarlid de Aura recebe +1/+1 para cada Aura no campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': \'Mate um gnarlid com seu primeiro golpe ou ele lhe mostrará com satisfação como se faz.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216846&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65dcd45c-6f97-4c97-b24c-817c47a3b155\', \'multiverseId\': 216846}, \'multiverseid\': 216846}, {\'name\': \'Аурный Нарлид\', \'text\': \'Существа с силой меньше силы Аурного Нарлида не могут его блокировать.\\nАурный Нарлид получает +1/+1 за каждую Ауру на поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зверь\', \'flavor\': \'Убей нарлида одним ударом, или он с радостью сам покажет тебе, как это делается.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215854&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3a37312-0ecd-4545-8cbd-2572fe2f6bda\', \'multiverseId\': 215854}, \'multiverseid\': 215854}, {\'name\': \'灵气糙节兽\', \'text\': \'力量小于灵气糙节兽的生物不能阻挡它。\\n战场上每有一个灵气，灵气糙节兽便得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'生物～野兽\', \'flavor\': \'对付糙节兽务必要一击致命，否则他会很乐意教你该怎样作。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216102&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6dc34f8-d899-4d7b-9686-94039041c166\', \'multiverseId\': 216102}, \'multiverseid\': 216102}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auren-Finesse\', \'text\': \'Lege eine Aura deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Obwohl Rüstungen und Auren oft ähnlich sind, funktionieren die Gehirne derer, die sie nutzen, komplett unterschiedlich." —Zilan, Makindi-Auramagier\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217421&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fbacef3-25e7-475f-a110-c47f3016c733\', \'multiverseId\': 217421}, \'multiverseid\': 217421}, {\'name\': \'Sutileza de aura\', \'text\': \'Anexa el aura objetivo que controlas a la criatura objetivo.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Aunque las armaduras y auras pueden ser similares, los cerebros necesarios para usarlas son muy distintos." —Zilan, auramante de Makindi\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6eaffae9-cb5c-4bac-938a-e6218f4d5756\', \'multiverseId\': 217173}, \'multiverseid\': 217173}, {\'name\': "Finesse d\'aura", \'text\': \'Attachez une aura ciblée que vous contrôlez à une créature ciblée.\\nPiochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« L\'armure et les auras peuvent se ressembler, mais les cerveaux nécéssaires pour les utiliser sont souvent fort différents. » —Zilan, auramancienne des Makindi", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215685&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cb9b4b2-efb5-4109-ae76-c1d3dfc4a6b9\', \'multiverseId\': 215685}, \'multiverseid\': 215685}, {\'name\': "Finezza dell\'Aura", \'text\': "Assegna un\'Aura bersaglio che controlli a una creatura bersaglio.\\nPesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Sebbene armatura e aura possano essere simili, il cervello necessario per usare l\\\'una o l\\\'altra è molto differente." —Zilan, auramante di Makindi\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216429&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ab3f0f8-08ba-4298-8c9a-650d7a0c2dfc\', \'multiverseId\': 216429}, \'multiverseid\': 216429}, {\'name\': \'オーラの術策\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールする１つを対象とし、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。その前者をその後者につける。\\nカードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「鎧も魔術も似たようなものだが、それを使うのに必要な頭が世界を分けているのさ。」 ――マキンディのオーラ術師、ジラン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216677&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12c2e386-2890-4815-8d98-f98e72cca167\', \'multiverseId\': 216677}, \'multiverseid\': 216677}, {\'name\': \'Elegância com Auras\', \'text\': \'Anexe a Aura alvo que você controla à criatura alvo.\\nCompre um card.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Embora armaduras e auras possam ser semelhantes, a sabedoria necessária para usar uma e outra são como dois mundos distintos." — Zilan, auromante de Makindi\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216925&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d6816f1-6cd9-4325-9020-bc4c3d40628c\', \'multiverseId\': 216925}, \'multiverseid\': 216925}, {\'name\': \'Утонченность Ауры\', \'text\': \'Прикрепите целевую Ауру под вашим контролем к целевому существу.\\nВозьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Доспехи и ауры могут быть похожи, а вот мозги для их использования нужны совсем разные». — Зилана, ауромант из Макинди\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215933&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1685916-acc2-4050-8d9a-eba0518480fb\', \'multiverseId\': 215933}, \'multiverseid\': 215933}, {\'name\': \'灵气巧技\', \'text\': \'将目标由你操控的灵气结附在目标生物上。\\n抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「虽然铠甲与灵气都可同样收效，拿来运用它们的脑袋却极度不同。」 ～马钦迪灵气法师季兰\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3169fa34-f34e-4350-a105-d488fd907eed\', \'multiverseId\': 216181}, \'multiverseid\': 216181}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausbooten\', \'text\': \'Lege eine Kreatur deiner Wahl als zweite Karte von oben in die Bibliothek ihres Besitzers. Ihr Beherrscher erhält 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Unbesiegbar ist auch nur ein Wort." —Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217470&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02d1bb5b-fed0-49e2-9c9b-18a8e325472b\', \'multiverseId\': 217470}, \'multiverseid\': 217470}, {\'name\': \'Derrocar\', \'text\': \'Pon la criatura objetivo en la biblioteca de su propietario segunda desde la parte superior. Su controlador gana 3 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"\\\'Invencible\\\' es sólo una palabra." —Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217222&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5cb3d9f-022c-441c-8915-43a4a19abb72\', \'multiverseId\': 217222}, \'multiverseid\': 217222}, {\'name\': \'Évincement\', \'text\': \'Mettez la créature ciblée dans la bibliothèque de son propriétaire en deuxième position à partir du dessus. Son contrôleur gagne 3 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« \'Invincible\' n\'est qu\'un simple mot. » —Gideon Jura", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215734&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e37a5f1-6d27-40d1-bc6f-6cdb6dd45a29\', \'multiverseId\': 215734}, \'multiverseid\': 215734}, {\'name\': \'Spodestare\', \'text\': \'Metti una creatura bersaglio nel grimorio del suo proprietario come seconda carta. Il suo controllore guadagna 3 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"\\\'Invincibile\\\' è solo una parola." —Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216478&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4390ad4-eeb9-468c-b204-f2d02167d67c\', \'multiverseId\': 216478}, \'multiverseid\': 216478}, {\'name\': \'失脚\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをオーナーのライブラリーの一番上から２枚目に置く。 それのコントローラーは３点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「『無敵』など言葉遊びに過ぎん。」 ――ギデオン・ジュラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216726&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9284477-a24f-48b8-bc94-aa8f1175193e\', \'multiverseId\': 216726}, \'multiverseid\': 216726}, {\'name\': \'Ejetar\', \'text\': \'Coloque a criatura alvo no topo do grimório de seu dono na segunda posição. Seu controlador ganha 3 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"\\\'Invencível é apenas uma palavra." — Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216974&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d228e986-8eae-4f4f-baa2-845b0cfc0c32\', \'multiverseId\': 216974}, \'multiverseid\': 216974}, {\'name\': \'Вытеснение\', \'text\': \'Положите целевое существо в библиотеку его владельца вторым сверху. Контролирующий его игрок получает 3 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«"Непобедимый" — всего лишь слово». — Гидеон Джура\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215982&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'091f4220-289e-4215-80a5-c54d529b921e\', \'multiverseId\': 215982}, \'multiverseid\': 215982}, {\'name\': \'撵走\', \'text\': \'将目标生物置于其拥有者的牌库顶数来第二张的位置。 其操控者获得3点生命。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「『无敌』只是个词。」 ～基定尤拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83642988-f5e9-4bd3-bf48-d983ffa76a38\', \'multiverseId\': 216230}, \'multiverseid\': 216230}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausbruch der Teufelsbraten\', \'text\': \'Opfere alle Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, und bringe dann ebenso viele 4/4 rote Teufelsbraten-Kreaturenspielsteine ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Glaube nie, dass du in Sicherheit bist, auch nicht allein auf weiter Flur, meilenweit von den nächsten Eldrazi entfernt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217518&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7082838b-d241-4f8c-86cc-5d2550054b71\', \'multiverseId\': 217518}, \'multiverseid\': 217518}, {\'name\': \'Erupción de infernales\', \'text\': \'Sacrifica todas las criaturas que controlas, luego pon en el campo de batalla esa misma cantidad de fichas de criatura Infernal rojas 4/4.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Justo cuando creías que estabas a salvo, en el medio de un campo abierto, sin eldrazi en kilómetros a la redonda.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217270&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aad4a5c9-566b-4c86-9957-5d14e83ffd68\', \'multiverseId\': 217270}, \'multiverseid\': 217270}, {\'name\': \'Éruption de monstruosités\', \'text\': \'Sacrifiez toutes les créatures que vous contrôlez, puis mettez sur le champ de bataille autant de jetons de créature 4/4 rouge Monstruosité.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Juste au moment où vous pensiez être en sécurité, au beau milieu d\'un champ et sans un Eldrazi à moins d\'une lieue.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215782&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5397530-6d6e-47f5-894f-86f3a379737b\', \'multiverseId\': 215782}, \'multiverseid\': 215782}, {\'name\': \'Eruzione di Infernali\', \'text\': \'Sacrifica tutte le creature che controlli, poi metti sul campo di battaglia altrettante pedine creatura Infernale 4/4 rosse.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Proprio quando pensavi di essere al sicuro, nel bel mezzo di un campo senza neanche un Eldrazi in vista per chilometri.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216526&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7250e9e6-a073-40f3-a533-a2f03d278e11\', \'multiverseId\': 216526}, \'multiverseid\': 216526}, {\'name\': \'乱暴者の噴火\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールするすべてのクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げ、その後その数に等しい数の赤の４/４のヘリオン・クリーチャー・トークンを戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'周囲数マイルにエルドラージの全くいない平原の真ん中で、ここなら安心と思ったその瞬間。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216774&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0398cecd-6dd6-43be-ab6b-c9c03b757165\', \'multiverseId\': 216774}, \'multiverseid\': 216774}, {\'name\': \'Erupção Avernal\', \'text\': \'Sacrifique todas as criaturas que você controla, depois coloque no campo de batalha uma quantidade equivalente de fichas de criatura vermelhas 4/4 do tipo Avernal.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'E você achou que estava a salvo, bem no meio de um campo aberto sem nenhum Eldrazi por quilômetros.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217022&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cea7919-556c-4274-921d-2182e3950c1f\', \'multiverseId\': 217022}, \'multiverseid\': 217022}, {\'name\': \'Прорыв Геллионов\', \'text\': \'Пожертвуйте все существа под вашим контролем, затем положите на поле битвы столько же фишек существа 4/4 красный Геллион.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Только вы подумали, что оказались в безопасности, в чистом поле, где на многие мили вокруг нет ни единого Эльдрази...\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3935bd6d-5873-4bae-a3be-de31b1092bc2\', \'multiverseId\': 216030}, \'multiverseid\': 216030}, {\'name\': \'地狱兽暴涌\', \'text\': \'牺牲所有由你操控的生物，然后将等量的4/4红色地狱兽衍生物放进战场。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'就在你身处空旷原野、方圆数哩内没有奥札奇，自以为很安全的时候。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216278&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0296c24f-567f-4a28-af24-cc197ce61769\', \'multiverseId\': 216278}, \'multiverseid\': 216278}]', '[{\'name\': \'Baumflüsterer aus Joraga\', \'text\': \'Stufe aufsteigen {1}{G} ({1}{G}: Lege eine Stufenmarke auf diese Karte. Spiele Stufe aufsteigen wie eine Hexerei.)\\nSTUFE 1-4\\n1/2\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {G}{G}.\\nSTUFE 5+\\n1/4\\nElfen, die du kontrollierst, haben „{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {G}{G}".\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217330&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84d7ceb5-f170-4dc4-ac14-34a3b0afbce1\', \'multiverseId\': 217330}, \'multiverseid\': 217330}, {\'name\': \'Portavoz de árboles de Joraga\', \'text\': \'Subir de nivel {1}{G}. ({1}{G}: Pon un contador de nivel sobre esto. Sube de nivel sólo como un conjuro.)\\nNIVEL 1-4\\n1/2\\n{T}: Agrega {G}{G} a tu reserva de maná.\\nNIVEL 5+\\n1/4\\nLos elfos que controlas tienen "{T}: Agrega {G}{G} a tu reserva de maná".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217082&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'577e06a0-4b1e-46fa-9719-48ac0944e5e8\', \'multiverseId\': 217082}, \'multiverseid\': 217082}, {\'name\': \'Oratrice arboricole de Joraga\', \'text\': \'Montée de niveau {1}{G} ({1}{G} : Mettez un marqueur « niveau » sur cette créature. Ne montez de niveau que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)\\nNIVEAU 1-4\\n1/2\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G}{G} à votre réserve.\\nNIVEAU 5+\\n1/4\\nLes elfes que vous contrôlez ont « {T} : Ajoutez {G}{G} à votre réserve. »\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215594&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f4ebe97-0f78-4d9a-8545-e5f08d417a7a\', \'multiverseId\': 215594}, \'multiverseid\': 215594}, {\'name\': \'Voce Arborea di Joraga\', \'text\': \'Aumentare di livello {1}{G} ({1}{G}: Metti un segnalino livello su questa creatura. Aumenta di livello solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.)\\nLIVELLO 1-4\\n1/2\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G}{G} alla tua riserva di mana.\\nLIVELLO 5+\\n1/4\\nGli Elfi che controlli hanno "{T}: Aggiungi {G}{G} alla tua riserva di mana".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216338&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66afac04-f539-4630-ade2-a547f5227b75\', \'multiverseId\': 216338}, \'multiverseid\': 216338}, {\'name\': \'ジョラーガの樹語り\', \'text\': \'Lvアップ {1}{G} ({1}{G}：この上にLvカウンターを１個置く。 Lvアップはソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\\nLv 1-4\\n1/2\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{G}{G}を加える。\\nLv 5+\\n1/4\\nあなたがコントロールするエルフは「{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{G}{G}を加える。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216586&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67f537eb-ecd6-40dd-8621-da3b0117a903\', \'multiverseId\': 216586}, \'multiverseid\': 216586}, {\'name\': \'Língua-Verde Joraga\', \'text\': \'Subir de nível {1}{G} ({1}{G}: Coloque um marcador de nível nesta criatura. Suba de nível somente quando puder jogar um feitiço.)\\nNÍVEL 1-4\\n1/2\\n{T}: Adicione {G}{G} à sua reserva de mana.\\nNÍVEL 5+\\n1/4\\nOs elfos que você controla têm: "{T}: Adicione {G}{G} à sua reserva de mana."\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Druida\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216834&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9021d81b-214c-4e2c-bc33-7b19dcd7c5d8\', \'multiverseId\': 216834}, \'multiverseid\': 216834}, {\'name\': \'Джорагская Древоязычница\', \'text\': \'Повышение уровня {1}{G} ({1}{G}: положите один жетон уровня на это существо. Повышайте уровень только как волшебство.)\\nУРОВЕНЬ 1-4\\n1/2\\n{T}: добавьте {G}{G} в ваше хранилище маны.\\nУРОВЕНЬ 5+\\n1/4\\nЭльфы под вашим контролем имеют способность «{T}: добавьте {G}{G} в ваше хранилище маны».\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Друид\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215842&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'244e2536-fd82-42fa-a077-5a48193460b5\', \'multiverseId\': 215842}, \'multiverseid\': 215842}, {\'name\': \'玖瑞加树语师\', \'text\': \'升级{1}{G} （{1}{G}：在其上放置一个等级指示物。 升级的时机视同法术。）\\n等级1-4\\n1/2\\n{T}：加{G}{G}到你的法术力池中。\\n等级5+\\n1/4\\n由你操控的妖精具有「{T}：加{G}{G}到你的法术力池中。」\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b751df3-1cb9-4d7a-b756-20b6bb511c3c\', \'multiverseId\': 216090}, \'multiverseid\': 216090}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beobachtende Meerfrau\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Beobachtende Meerfrau ins Spiel kommt, schaue dir die oberste Karte der Bibliothek eines Spielers deiner Wahl an.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Meervolk, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Struktur wird Stunde um Stunde größer, denn die Polyeder verbinden sich selbst tief unter Wasser. Wenn ich es nur schaffen könnte, hineinzukommen..."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217501&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a620f621-a121-4970-b3b8-bdbc8b84b180\', \'multiverseId\': 217501}, \'multiverseid\': 217501}, {\'name\': \'Observadora tritón\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Observadora tritón entre al campo de batalla, mira la primera carta de la biblioteca del jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón tritón\', \'flavor\': \'"La estructura crece paulatinamente, con los edros uniéndose incluso en lo más profundo de la superficie. Si tan sólo pudiera entrar..."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15814a4a-4b96-4da4-aba8-f433c43d63b8\', \'multiverseId\': 217253}, \'multiverseid\': 217253}, {\'name\': \'Observatrice ondine\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Observatrice ondine arrive sur le champ de bataille, regardez la carte du dessus de la bibliothèque du joueur ciblé.", \'type\': \'Créature : ondin et gredin\', \'flavor\': "« La structure grandit d\'heure en heure tandis que dans les profondeurs, la coalescence des hèdrons se poursuit. Si seulement je pouvais y pénétrer. . . »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215765&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'561808b2-b9ef-4968-ac20-22244aad7029\', \'multiverseId\': 215765}, \'multiverseid\': 215765}, {\'name\': \'Tritona Osservatrice\', \'text\': \'Quando la Tritona Osservatrice entra nel campo di battaglia, guarda la prima carta del grimorio di un giocatore bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Tritone\', \'flavor\': \'"La struttura diventa sempre più grande ogni ora, con gli edri che si fondono ancora più in profondità sotto la superficie. Se solo riuscissi a entrare. . . ."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216509&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'737dadb7-006c-4d00-a644-ac1a93b74037\', \'multiverseId\': 216509}, \'multiverseid\': 216509}, {\'name\': \'マーフォークの観察者\', \'text\': \'マーフォークの観察者が戦場に出たとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とし、そのプレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上のカードを見る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — マーフォーク・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'「その構造は一時間毎に大きくなり、面晶体もその表面から深くにさらに集まってきている。 中に入れたなら……」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216757&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04e8630e-56ea-4327-bee8-7093e49568ac\', \'multiverseId\': 216757}, \'multiverseid\': 216757}, {\'name\': \'Observador Tritão\', \'text\': \'Quando Observador Tritão entrar no campo de batalha, olhe o card do topo do grimório do jogador alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tritão Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'"A estrutura torna-se maior a cada hora, com os edros coalescendo ainda mais profundamente sob a superfície. Se eu pudesse ao menos entrar lá..."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217005&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2509336-cda0-4add-b9d0-81e75ba8d166\', \'multiverseId\': 217005}, \'multiverseid\': 217005}, {\'name\': \'Мерфолкская Наблюдательница\', \'text\': \'Когда Мерфолкская Наблюдательница выходит на поле битвы, посмотрите верхнюю карту библиотеки целевого игрока.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Мерфолк Бродяга\', \'flavor\': \'«Массив растет с каждым часом, эдры соединяются даже глубоко под землей. Если бы только я могла проникнуть внутрь...»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77f3ef1c-47a1-4ffa-b2f0-d7ea41001591\', \'multiverseId\': 216013}, \'multiverseid\': 216013}, {\'name\': \'情资人鱼\', \'text\': \'当情资人鱼进战场时，检视目标牌手的牌库顶牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～人鱼／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「结构体每小时都不断增大，来源的晶石也越来越靠近地底。 只要我能跑到里面去...。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216261&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'983c2a05-5f73-4f15-8aa4-5142e57ee751\', \'multiverseId\': 216261}, \'multiverseid\': 216261}]', "[{'name': 'Bestienzureiter aus Bala Ged', 'text': 'Stufe aufsteigen {2}{G} ({2}{G}: Lege eine Stufenmarke auf diese Karte. Spiele Stufe aufsteigen wie eine Hexerei.)\\nSTUFE 1-3\\n4/4\\nSTUFE 4+\\n6/6\\nVerursacht Trampelschaden', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217445&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fa48dc4f-ef08-42ae-b729-993f3e7f3922', 'multiverseId': 217445}, 'multiverseid': 217445}, {'name': 'Quiebrabestias de Bala Ged', 'text': 'Subir de nivel {2}{G}. ({2}{G}: Pon un contador de nivel sobre esto. Sube de nivel sólo como un conjuro.)\\nNIVEL 1-3\\n4/4\\nNIVEL 4+\\n6/6\\nArrolla.', 'type': 'Criatura — Guerrero humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217197&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f1338d79-5fed-456c-b5ae-e80a08482abf', 'multiverseId': 217197}, 'multiverseid': 217197}, {'name': 'Dresseur de bêtes de Bala Ged', 'text': 'Montée de niveau {2}{G} ({2}{G} : Mettez un marqueur « niveau » sur cette créature. Ne montez de niveau que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)\\nNIVEAU 1-3\\n4/4\\nNIVEAU 4+\\n6/6\\nPiétinement', 'type': 'Créature : humain et guerrier', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215709&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '78848b90-a650-444f-b8ee-f2239db930b6', 'multiverseId': 215709}, 'multiverseid': 215709}, {'name': 'Domatore di Bala Ged', 'text': 'Aumentare di livello {2}{G} ({2}{G}: Metti un segnalino livello su questa creatura. Aumenta di livello solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.)\\nLIVELLO 1-3\\n4/4\\nLIVELLO 4+\\n6/6\\nTravolgere', 'type': 'Creatura — Guerriero Umano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216453&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2701ebcc-2ad7-4249-9fa1-a04db7931729', 'multiverseId': 216453}, 'multiverseid': 216453}, {'name': 'バーラ・ゲドの獣壊し', 'text': 'Lvアップ {2}{G} ({2}{G}：この上にLvカウンターを１個置く。 Lvアップはソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\\nLv 1-3\\n4/4\\nLv 4+\\n6/6\\nトランプル', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216701&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '23cb9a2d-5f75-48d9-ac93-1623057d4ab8', 'multiverseId': 216701}, 'multiverseid': 216701}, {'name': 'Amansa-Fera de Bala Ged', 'text': 'Subir de nível {2}{G} ({2}{G}: Coloque um marcador de nível nesta criatura. Suba de nível somente quando puder jogar um feitiço.)\\nNÍVEL 1-3\\n4/4\\nNÍVEL 4+\\n6/6\\nAtropelar', 'type': 'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216949&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '20f2bd97-4eaa-417b-8b0a-11b5b952d4d4', 'multiverseId': 216949}, 'multiverseid': 216949}, {'name': 'Бала-Гедский Укротитель', 'text': 'Повышение уровня {2}{G} ({2}{G}: положите один жетон уровня на это существо. Повышайте уровень только как волшебство.)\\nУРОВЕНЬ 1-3\\n4/4\\nУРОВЕНЬ 4+\\n6/6\\nПробивной удар', 'type': 'Существо — Человек Воин', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215957&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'beac31a5-b973-41d7-b5c3-1ed3b2679a23', 'multiverseId': 215957}, 'multiverseid': 215957}, {'name': '巴勒格伏兽师', 'text': '升级{2}{G} （{2}{G}：在其上放置一个等级指示物。 升级的时机视同法术。）\\n等级1-3\\n4/4\\n等级4+\\n6/6\\n践踏', 'type': '生物～人类／战士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216205&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ad442f96-4f1c-40d5-a423-6ebed45fff79', 'multiverseId': 216205}, 'multiverseid': 216205}]", '[{\'name\': \'Bewunderter Lehrer\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Bewunderte Lehrer ins Spiel kommt, lege auf jede Kreatur mit Stufe aufsteigen, die du kontrollierst, zwei Stufenmarken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Unvorstellbare ist geschehen, meine Schüler. Ich habe keine Zweifel, dass ihr der Situation gewachsen seid."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217318&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'506a5d73-2f3a-4571-b0dd-3dede4c3f082\', \'multiverseId\': 217318}, \'multiverseid\': 217318}, {\'name\': \'Maestro venerado\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Maestro venerado entre al campo de batalla, pon dos contadores de nivel sobre cada criatura que controles con la habilidad de subir de nivel.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Lo impensable se aproxima, estudiantes. No tengo duda de que estarán a la altura de las circunstancias."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b21e63b9-77e3-4564-a6e2-0cf1509150dc\', \'multiverseId\': 217070}, \'multiverseid\': 217070}, {\'name\': \'Professeur vénéré\', \'text\': \'Quand le Professeur vénéré arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez deux marqueurs « niveau » sur chaque créature avec la montée de niveau que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« L\'insondable nous rattrape, mes élèves. Je ne doute pas un instant que vous ferez ma fierté. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215582&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b16070d-4e7d-474d-8faa-a1f458618aa7\', \'multiverseId\': 215582}, \'multiverseid\': 215582}, {\'name\': \'Venerato Insegnante\', \'text\': \'Quando il Venerato Insegnante entra nel campo di battaglia, metti due segnalini livello su ogni creatura che controlli con aumentare di livello.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"L\\\'imperscrutabile è alle porte, studenti. Non ho dubbi che vi dimostrerete all\\\'altezza."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a0d980e-f879-4069-8eab-b44875f0ea2b\', \'multiverseId\': 216326}, \'multiverseid\': 216326}, {\'name\': \'敬慕される教師\', \'text\': \'敬慕される教師が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールするLvアップを持つ各クリーチャーの上にそれぞれLvカウンターを２個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「生徒たちよ、底知れぬ事態じゃ。 皆立ち上がってくれると信じておる。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216574&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20819a5e-92cb-42ce-b632-f9df97cd4b33\', \'multiverseId\': 216574}, \'multiverseid\': 216574}, {\'name\': \'Professor Venerado\', \'text\': \'Quando Professor Venerado entrar no campo de batalha, coloque dois marcadores de nível em cada criatura que você controla com subir de nível.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Alunos, estamos por enfrentar o desconhecido. Estou certo de que vocês saberão dar o melhor de si."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216822&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea5d527a-36ca-403d-b4ef-f5424a7bd8f9\', \'multiverseId\': 216822}, \'multiverseid\': 216822}, {\'name\': \'Почитаемый Учитель\', \'text\': \'Когда Почитаемый Учитель выходит на поле битвы, положите по два жетона уровня на каждое существо с Повышением уровня под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Грядет непостижимое, ученики мои. Я не сомневаюсь, что вы окажетесь на высоте».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215830&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cece50a6-88d4-4961-aef4-ad7e483ab009\', \'multiverseId\': 215830}, \'multiverseid\': 215830}, {\'name\': \'景仰教师\', \'text\': \'当景仰教师进战场时，在每个由你操控、且具升级异能的生物上放置两个等级指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「学生们，难以测度之物正朝我们而来。 我相信你们不会错过这良机。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216078&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1c9e51f-d665-4da4-8340-99a5b6aa200f\', \'multiverseId\': 216078}, \'multiverseid\': 216078}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blattgeschoss\', \'text\': \'Das Blattgeschoss fügt einer fliegenden Kreatur deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Wer glaubt, dass die Bäume in diesem Konflikt nur Zuschauer bleiben würden, der irrt sich." —Sutina, Sprecherin der Tajuru\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217529&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdfc7a58-8a7d-44d2-b446-a5715ec0f3e5\', \'multiverseId\': 217529}, \'multiverseid\': 217529}, {\'name\': \'Flecha de hoja\', \'text\': \'La Flecha de hoja hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Aquellos que crean que los árboles deben permanecer como espectadores de este conflicto se darán cuenta de que están equivocados." —Sutina, Portavoz de los Tajuru\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217281&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f55beb0-c04f-4869-8b93-2a3984990715\', \'multiverseId\': 217281}, \'multiverseid\': 217281}, {\'name\': \'Flèche de feuille\', \'text\': \'La Flèche de feuille inflige 3 blessures à la créature avec le vol ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Ceux qui pensent que les arbres resteront spectateurs pendant ce conflit se trompent gravement. » —Sutina, oratrice des Tajuru\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215793&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac20b1f6-4798-4c2a-a98e-92006a1c31a4\', \'multiverseId\': 215793}, \'multiverseid\': 215793}, {\'name\': \'Freccia a Foglia\', \'text\': \'La Freccia a Foglia infligge 3 danni a una creatura bersaglio con volare.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Quanti pensano che gli alberi debbano essere spettatori in questo conflitto sono decisamente in errore." —Sutina, Portavoce dei Tajuru\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216537&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'801a5b73-48ae-4826-880d-d2f719b0f516\', \'multiverseId\': 216537}, \'multiverseid\': 216537}, {\'name\': \'葉の矢\', \'text\': \'飛行を持つクリーチャー１体を対象とする。葉の矢はそれに３点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「この騒乱の中、木々が傍観者のままだと思っている者がいるなら、それは単純に誤りです。」 ――タジュールの語り部、スティーナ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216785&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f13e8b2d-77b7-4bf4-9cc8-b1643bb6dc29\', \'multiverseId\': 216785}, \'multiverseid\': 216785}, {\'name\': \'Flecha de Folha\', \'text\': \'Flecha de Folha causa 3 pontos de dano à criatura alvo com voar.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Aqueles que acreditam que as árvores permanecerão como simples espectadores durante este conflito estão totalmente enganados." — Sutina, Porta-voz dos Tajuru\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217033&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2655c0d-8070-4b24-b079-2d887772ea41\', \'multiverseId\': 217033}, \'multiverseid\': 217033}, {\'name\': \'Стрела-Лист\', \'text\': \'Стрела-Лист наносит 3 повреждения целевому существу с Полетом.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Те, кто думают, что деревья останутся безучастными наблюдателями в этой борьбе, глубоко ошибаются». — Сутина, предводительница Таджуру\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216041&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'235cef41-1977-4ac1-9c13-9796d5aa6d32\', \'multiverseId\': 216041}, \'multiverseid\': 216041}, {\'name\': \'飞叶箭\', \'text\': \'飞叶箭对目标具飞行异能的生物造成3点伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「在这场冲突中，若有人以为树木会从头到尾作壁上观，可就错得离谱了。」 ～特裘如领袖苏提娜\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216289&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e19248f-9f48-4415-9fe5-e074c64c4efd\', \'multiverseId\': 216289}, \'multiverseid\': 216289}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bloßlegen\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl. Schaue dir die Karten auf der Hand seines Beherrschers an.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Es ist gut, aus eigenen Fehlern zu lernen, doch ich lerne noch lieber aus den Fehlern anderer." —Jace Beleren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217336&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d10c758e-cec4-4e0c-ac6f-dd4faebf77ff\', \'multiverseId\': 217336}, \'multiverseid\': 217336}, {\'name\': \'Exponer\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo. Mira la mano de su controlador.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Es bueno aprender de tus propios errores, pero prefiero aprender de los errores de los demás." —Jace Beleren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217088&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae0b09c3-48d5-4ebd-bdf2-c5829307ca1d\', \'multiverseId\': 217088}, \'multiverseid\': 217088}, {\'name\': \'À nu\', \'text\': \'Contrecarrez le sort ciblé. Regardez la main de son contrôleur.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Il est toujours bon d\'apprendre de ses erreurs, mais je préfère apprendre de celles des autres. » —Jace Beleren", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215600&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f1b3ea6-39b3-4762-80e5-c0b942452185\', \'multiverseId\': 215600}, \'multiverseid\': 215600}, {\'name\': \'Denudare\', \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia bersaglio. Guarda la mano del suo controllore.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"È giusto imparare dai propri fallimenti, ma preferisco imparare dai fallimenti altrui." —Jace Beleren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216344&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b65664be-d485-43ae-afa5-0cd254689063\', \'multiverseId\': 216344}, \'multiverseid\': 216344}, {\'name\': \'解明\', \'text\': \'呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。 それのコントローラーの手札を見る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「お前の失敗から学ぶのも悪くはないが、他の誰かの失敗から学んだ方がよっぽどいい。」 ――ジェイス・ベレレン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216592&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a43ddb8-9b7f-4f19-8c18-72d4ca392202\', \'multiverseId\': 216592}, \'multiverseid\': 216592}, {\'name\': \'Revelar\', \'text\': \'Anule a mágica alvo. Olhe a mão de seu controlador.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"É bom aprender com os próprios fracassos, mas eu prefiro aprender com os fracassos dos outros." — Jace Beleren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216840&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02a7e674-3ad2-4d16-a8fa-9290eabe5400\', \'multiverseId\': 216840}, \'multiverseid\': 216840}, {\'name\': \'Разоблачить\', \'text\': \'Отмените целевое заклинание. Посмотрите руку контролирующего его игрока.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Хорошо учиться на собственных ошибках, но я предпочитаю учиться на чужих». — Джейс Белерен\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215848&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8230cb80-eedc-4f45-8d5e-9d0d414ddb24\', \'multiverseId\': 215848}, \'multiverseid\': 215848}, {\'name\': \'披露\', \'text\': \'反击目标咒语。 检视其操控者的手牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「从你的失败中学习是很不错，但我更想从别人的失误中学习。」 ～杰斯贝连\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216096&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe7e06ec-075c-4d52-be28-d6f42a2c298a\', \'multiverseId\': 216096}, \'multiverseid\': 216096}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutritual-Beschwörer\', \'text\': \'{8}: Ein Spieler deiner Wahl verliert 3 Lebenspunkte, und du erhältst 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Nachkommen der Brut verbreiteten sich über die gesamte Welt — jedes der Wesen kommt nach einem der drei Urväter und ist ein Beispiel für stumpfsinnigen Fraß." —Die Geschichten der Beschwörer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217384&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0591724-342c-4712-8ce3-c47417db58cc\', \'multiverseId\': 217384}, \'multiverseid\': 217384}, {\'name\': \'Invocador del rito sangriento\', \'text\': \'{8}: El jugador objetivo pierde 3 vidas y tú ganas 3 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Los linajes de la progenie se expandieron por el mundo, cada uno similar a uno de los tres progenitores, cada uno con su particular consumo voraz." —Cuentos de los invocadores\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28d9bee6-69e6-4af2-a942-40f44a15dc7c\', \'multiverseId\': 217136}, \'multiverseid\': 217136}, {\'name\': \'Invocateur ritesang\', \'text\': \'{8} : Le joueur ciblé perd 3 points de vie et vous gagnez 3 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et shamane\', \'flavor\': \'« Les lignées de progéniture se répandaient sur le monde, chacune modelée sur un des trois progéniteurs, chacune une étude de voracité stupide. » —Les Contes des Invocateurs\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215648&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9af8802-f971-4103-8820-963ec3d3b3bc\', \'multiverseId\': 215648}, \'multiverseid\': 215648}, {\'name\': \'Evocatore del Rituale Sanguinario\', \'text\': \'{8}: Un giocatore bersaglio perde 3 punti vita e tu guadagni 3 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"I discendenti della covata si schiusero in tutto il mondo, ciascuno modellato a immagine di uno dei tre progenitori, ognuno uno studio di consumo insensato." —Racconti degli Evocatori\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216392&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec68b5b3-7000-48aa-bd00-c270ef5ac4a0\', \'multiverseId\': 216392}, \'multiverseid\': 216392}, {\'name\': \'血儀式の発動者\', \'text\': \'{8}：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは３点のライフを失い、あなたは３点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「世界中に姿を現した落し子の血統は、三つの創始の者に似せて作られ、考えの無い破壊を実践している。」 ――「発動者伝」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216640&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f903ba5a-0e87-4505-aca4-25cb31b67718\', \'multiverseId\': 216640}, \'multiverseid\': 216640}, {\'name\': \'Invocador do Ritual de Sangue\', \'text\': \'{8}: O jogador alvo perde 3 pontos de vida e você ganha 3 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'"As linhagens de ninhada disseminaram-se pelo mundo, cada uma seguindo o modelo de um dos três progenitores, cada uma um estudo de destruição insensata." — Lendas dos Invocadores\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5681da6-077f-4d5d-a480-6b11123e02b4\', \'multiverseId\': 216888}, \'multiverseid\': 216888}, {\'name\': \'Призыватель Кровавого Обряда\', \'text\': \'{8}: целевой игрок теряет 3 жизни, а вы получаете 3 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир Шаман\', \'flavor\': \'«Выводки расплодились по всему миру по образу и подобию одного из трех прародителей, поражая величиной своего бездумного аппетита». —Сказания призывателей\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215896&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7574eb3-f9ea-4c71-bad0-fd420afd01a9\', \'multiverseId\': 215896}, \'multiverseid\': 215896}, {\'name\': \'血仪召现师\', \'text\': \'{8}：目标牌手失去3点生命且你获得3点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'「巢窝血脉横行世界，每种的特征都与三位先祖中的一位相符，也都能当作盲目吞噬的研究对象。」 ～《召现师传说》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216144&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2209bf26-a9e3-4639-8b45-90c1646e9f3a\', \'multiverseId\': 216144}, \'multiverseid\': 216144}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutthron-Vampir\', \'text\': \'Opfere eine Kreatur: Der Blutthron-Vampir erhält +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir\', \'flavor\': \'Einige Menschen boten freiwillig ihr Blut an, um den Vampirfamilien die Stärke zu geben, die Eldrazi fernhalten zu können.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217519&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f020e95-4f7b-426d-9c2c-fb8222f40cb6\', \'multiverseId\': 217519}, \'multiverseid\': 217519}, {\'name\': \'Vampiro del trono sangriento\', \'text\': \'Sacrificar una criatura: La Vampiro del trono sangriento obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'Algunos humanos ofrecieron voluntariamente su sangre, con la esperanza de dar a las familias de vampiros la fuerza para rechazar a los eldrazi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217271&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c84b161-fb28-4da7-98d0-bbe2cf88d469\', \'multiverseId\': 217271}, \'multiverseid\': 217271}, {\'name\': \'Vampire du trône de sang\', \'text\': "Sacrifiez une créature : La Vampire du trône de sang gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : vampire\', \'flavor\': "Quelques humains offrirent volontairement leur sang, espérant qu\'il donnerait aux familles vampires la force de repousser les Eldrazi.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215783&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e36a6773-f93e-41a6-b6c7-2240e68f0f98\', \'multiverseId\': 215783}, \'multiverseid\': 215783}, {\'name\': \'Vampira del Trono Insanguinato\', \'text\': \'Sacrifica una creatura: La Vampira del Trono Insanguinato prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'Alcuni umani offrirono spontaneamente il loro sangue, nella speranza di garantire alle famiglie di vampiri la forza necessaria ad allontanare gli Eldrazi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216527&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bdf2c0c-bd25-48a6-b4aa-d201a7a7babb\', \'multiverseId\': 216527}, \'multiverseid\': 216527}, {\'name\': \'血の座の吸血鬼\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げる：血の座の吸血鬼は、ターン終了時まで＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'人間の中には望んで血を捧げ、エルドラージを払いのけるための力を吸血鬼の一族に与えようとする者もいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c133404-698b-445f-8619-6f185c134885\', \'multiverseId\': 216775}, \'multiverseid\': 216775}, {\'name\': \'Vampiro do Sangue Real\', \'text\': \'Sacrifique uma criatura: Vampiro do Sangue Real recebe +2/+2 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'Alguns humanos ofereceram seu próprio sangue na esperança de que fornecesse às famílias de vampiros a energia necessária para repelir os Eldrazi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217023&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b030527-60a8-4239-b37c-4a491c899e18\', \'multiverseId\': 217023}, \'multiverseid\': 217023}, {\'name\': \'Вампир Кровавого Престола\', \'text\': \'Пожертвуйте существо: Вампир Кровавого Престола получает +2/+2 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир\', \'flavor\': \'Некоторые люди добровольно предложили свою кровь в надежде на то, что она даст вампирским семействам силу отразить Эльдрази.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216031&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfb1be4f-94c7-4986-b732-e543ed5a831e\', \'multiverseId\': 216031}, \'multiverseid\': 216031}, {\'name\': \'血座吸血鬼\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个生物：血座吸血鬼得+2/+2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'有些人类自愿献上鲜血，希望这能增强吸血鬼家族的力量，好将奥札奇击退。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216279&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f79fef41-287a-4d7d-b3bf-f47bd7387dd2\', \'multiverseId\': 216279}, \'multiverseid\': 216279}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bombardierungsüberfall\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur mit Stärke 2 oder weniger, die du kontrollierst, angreift, fügt der Bombardierungsüberfall dem verteidigenden Spieler 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Goblins in der vordersten Reihe eines Feuerüberfalls beklagen oft das Zielvermögen der anderen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217406&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb6980af-6f2c-4c8b-aaeb-0ec15195783e\', \'multiverseId\': 217406}, \'multiverseid\': 217406}, {\'name\': \'Bombardeo de incursión\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura que controles con fuerza de 2 o menos ataque, el Bombardeo de incursión hace 1 punto de daño al jugador defensor.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Los trasgos de la primera oleada de una incursión de fuego siempre se lamentan de la puntería del resto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217158&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c45598b-9519-4635-a9ee-5c713f60290c\', \'multiverseId\': 217158}, \'multiverseid\': 217158}, {\'name\': "Bombardement d\'assaut", \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature de force inférieure ou égale à 2 que vous contrôlez attaque, le Bombardement d\'assaut inflige 1 blessure au joueur défenseur.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "Les gobelins de la première vague d\'assaut se plaignent toujours de la précision des tirs de tous les autres.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215670&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f17df5c-220b-4b08-b12f-be0a33ce1c7b\', \'multiverseId\': 215670}, \'multiverseid\': 215670}, {\'name\': \'Bombardamento da Incursione\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura che controlli con forza pari o inferiore a 2 attacca, il Bombardamento da Incursione infligge 1 danno al giocatore in difesa.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': "I goblin nella prima ondata di un\'incursione a fuoco si lamentano sempre della mira di chiunque altro.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216414&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a9b6a4c-90f3-47dc-ba27-4814717091e9\', \'multiverseId\': 216414}, \'multiverseid\': 216414}, {\'name\': \'略奪の爆撃\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールするパワーが２以下のクリーチャーが１体攻撃するたび、略奪の爆撃は防御プレイヤーに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'ゴブリンの火の襲撃の第一波は、いつでも他の全員の狙いを嘆いている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01c2a807-685f-4bd0-810d-1d24e665d406\', \'multiverseId\': 216662}, \'multiverseid\': 216662}, {\'name\': \'Bombardeio Surpresa\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que a criatura que você controla com poder menor ou igual a 2 ataca, Bombardeio Surpresa causa 1 ponto de dano ao jogador defensor.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Os goblins na primeira linha de fogo sempre se lamentam da mira dos outros.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216910&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fb8df3b-2883-423c-a39b-82971e3140ca\', \'multiverseId\': 216910}, \'multiverseid\': 216910}, {\'name\': \'Налет с Обстрелом\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз когда существо под вашим контролем с силой 2 или меньше атакует, Налет с Обстрелом наносит 1 повреждение защищающемуся игроку.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'Гоблины в первой волне огневого нападения всегда жалуются на прицел всех остальных.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215918&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1d817f4-fc65-41d7-9205-7949f42bedbe\', \'multiverseId\': 215918}, \'multiverseid\': 215918}, {\'name\': \'突击轰炸\', \'text\': \'每当一个由你操控、且力量小于或等于2的生物攻击时，突击轰炸对防御牌手造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'火攻第一波出阵的鬼怪，总会埋怨其他人的准头。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23264a61-3872-4234-9c5e-aec43ce67e58\', \'multiverseId\': 216166}, \'multiverseid\': 216166}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brutaufseher\', \'text\': \'(Eldrazi, Ausgeburt)-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +2/+1.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Drohne\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Niederste der Götter soll den Mächtigsten der Sterblichen überragen, und der Tod herrsche über alle." —Inschrift der Krypta von Agadeem\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217443&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d37fdd56-4dec-44e2-be79-43dee67595c9\', \'multiverseId\': 217443}, \'multiverseid\': 217443}, {\'name\': \'Protector de la progenie\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas Engrendro Eldrazi que controlas obtienen +2/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zángano eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'"El menor de los dioses destacará sobre el mayor de los mortales, y la muerte reinará sobre todo." —Inscripción en la Cripta de Agadeem\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'323da63d-1f0f-447b-a107-44673238c0b1\', \'multiverseId\': 217195}, \'multiverseid\': 217195}, {\'name\': \'Garde de la progéniture\', \'text\': \'Les créatures Eldrazi et Engeance que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+1.\', \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et drone\', \'flavor\': "« Même le plus faible des dieux écrasera le plus fort des mortels, mais la mort règnera sur tous. » —Inscription de la Crypte d\'Agadeem", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215707&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36b0749a-d03c-4256-80d5-a7e61361aeaf\', \'multiverseId\': 215707}, \'multiverseid\': 215707}, {\'name\': \'Custode della Covata\', \'text\': \'Le creature Progenie Eldrazi che controlli prendono +2/+1.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Parassita Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'"Il più piccolo degli dei sovrasterà il più possente dei mortali, e la morte regnerà su tutti." —Epitaffio nella Cripta di Agadeem\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216451&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8a30385-ca13-40ef-8f84-df3a11e5cb2e\', \'multiverseId\': 216451}, \'multiverseid\': 216451}, {\'name\': \'大群守り\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールするエルドラージ・落とし子・クリーチャーは＋２/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・ドローン\', \'flavor\': \'「数少なき神々が猛き死すべき運命の者どもの上に立ち、そのてを死が支配せんことを。」 ――アガディームの墓所の碑文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216699&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4db445f-6bbd-439d-9a1f-4d3a62ad4a56\', \'multiverseId\': 216699}, \'multiverseid\': 216699}, {\'name\': \'Guardião de Ninhada\', \'text\': \'As criaturas do tipo Prole Eldrazi que você controla recebem +2/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zangão Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'"O menor dos deuses sobrepujará o mais forte dos mortais e a morte reinará sobre todos." — Inscrição da Cripta de Agadeem\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216947&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8788325a-a595-4c4b-92b0-944ed8e40c89\', \'multiverseId\': 216947}, \'multiverseid\': 216947}, {\'name\': \'Опекун Выводка\', \'text\': \'Существа-Эльдрази Порождение под вашим контролем получают +2/+1.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази Дрон\', \'flavor\': \'«Наименьшие из божков одержат победу над сильнейшими смертными, и смерть воцарится повсюду». — надпись в Агадимском Склепе\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215955&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8118d10a-5482-4c62-ab36-77ecee281c66\', \'multiverseId\': 215955}, \'multiverseid\': 215955}, {\'name\': \'血脉守卫\', \'text\': \'由你操控、且同时为奥札奇与后裔的生物得+2/+1。\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇／奴兽\', \'flavor\': \'「最弱小的神明将威服最强的生灵，死亡命运也将降临众生。」 ～艾格丁墓穴铭文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216203&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63c596ea-7e39-41bc-b859-a67b9737d11e\', \'multiverseId\': 216203}, \'multiverseid\': 216203}]', "[{'name': 'Champion der Nullen', 'text': 'Stufe aufsteigen {3} ({3}: Lege eine Stufenmarke auf diese Karte. Spiele Stufe aufsteigen wie eine Hexerei.)\\nSTUFE 1-3\\n4/2\\nSTUFE 4+\\n7/3\\n{B}: Regeneriere den Champion der Nullen.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Zombie, Krieger', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217447&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '992104bc-43a0-4f23-9e64-b12386b2d342', 'multiverseId': 217447}, 'multiverseid': 217447}, {'name': 'Campeón nulo', 'text': 'Subir de nivel {3}. ({3}: Pon un contador de nivel sobre esto. Sube de nivel sólo como un conjuro.)\\nNIVEL 1-3\\n4/2\\nNIVEL 4+\\n7/3\\n{B}: Regenera el Campeón nulo.', 'type': 'Criatura — Guerrero zombie', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217199&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd33d7dea-9af6-42e4-a175-d51bc912263d', 'multiverseId': 217199}, 'multiverseid': 217199}, {'name': 'Champion des inféconds', 'text': 'Montée de niveau {3} ({3} : Mettez un marqueur « niveau » sur cette créature. Ne montez de niveau que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)\\nNIVEAU 1-3\\n4/2\\nNIVEAU 4+\\n7/3\\n{B} : Régénérez le Champion des inféconds.', 'type': 'Créature : zombie et guerrier', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215711&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8040e97c-9f50-44c2-bf44-fe2af366df3f', 'multiverseId': 215711}, 'multiverseid': 215711}, {'name': 'Campione Nullo', 'text': 'Aumentare di livello {3} ({3}: Metti un segnalino livello su questa creatura. Aumenta di livello solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.)\\nLIVELLO 1-3\\n4/2\\nLIVELLO 4+\\n7/3\\n{B}: Rigenera il Campione Nullo.', 'type': 'Creatura — Guerriero Zombie', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216455&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'be74e3c0-ffba-49a9-aedb-cc2ff21d1375', 'multiverseId': 216455}, 'multiverseid': 216455}, {'name': '虚身の勇者', 'text': 'Lvアップ {3} ({3}：この上にLvカウンターを１個置く。 Lvアップはソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\\nLv 1-3\\n4/2\\nLv 4+\\n7/3\\n{B}：虚身の勇者を再生する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゾンビ･戦士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216703&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b8184987-5e15-45f2-ba9c-75b4c3464cf4', 'multiverseId': 216703}, 'multiverseid': 216703}, {'name': 'Campeão Nulo', 'text': 'Subir de nível {3} ({3}: Coloque um marcador de nível nesta criatura. Suba de nível somente quando puder jogar um feitiço.)\\nNÍVEL 1-3\\n4/2\\nNÍVEL 4+\\n7/3\\n{B}: Regenere Campeão Nulo.', 'type': 'Criatura — Zumbi Guerreiro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216951&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '64754582-3dcc-4136-aed0-1a25ff8df6d5', 'multiverseId': 216951}, 'multiverseid': 216951}, {'name': 'Ничтожество-Поборник', 'text': 'Повышение уровня {3} ({3}: положите один жетон уровня на это существо. Повышайте уровень только как волшебство.)\\nУРОВЕНЬ 1-3\\n4/2\\nУРОВЕНЬ 4+\\n7/3\\n{B}: регенерируйте Ничтожество-Поборника.', 'type': 'Существо — Зомби Воин', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215959&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd5e2cc2f-fb90-45c4-8a82-520d9e29cfef', 'multiverseId': 215959}, 'multiverseid': 215959}, {'name': '躯壳斗士', 'text': '升级{3} （{3}：在其上放置一个等级指示物。 升级的时机视同法术。）\\n等级1-3\\n4/2\\n等级4+\\n7/3\\n{B}：重生躯壳斗士。', 'type': '生物～灵俑／战士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216207&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a47fae06-0a91-4720-9281-2ac59203ccd8', 'multiverseId': 216207}, 'multiverseid': 216207}]", '[{\'name\': \'Darüber hinaus sehen\', \'text\': \'Ziehe zwei Karten und mische dann eine Karte aus deiner Hand in deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Uraltes Wissen, das in einem verrückt gewordenen Gehirn verborgen ist, ist dort genauso sicher, als ob es tief in der Erde eingegraben wäre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217408&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f889d6e-c7b3-48d9-8c1d-6b086ba338b1\', \'multiverseId\': 217408}, \'multiverseid\': 217408}, {\'name\': \'Ver más allá\', \'text\': \'Roba dos cartas, luego baraja una carta de tu mano en tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Los antiguos secretos escondidos en una mente delirante están tan seguros como cuando estaban enterrados profundamente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217160&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5037dbb-ecbd-4bcc-bf5e-10f7a8ad4aa8\', \'multiverseId\': 217160}, \'multiverseid\': 217160}, {\'name\': \'Voir plus loin\', \'text\': \'Piochez deux cartes, puis mélangez une carte de votre main à votre bibliothèque.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Une connaissance ancienne verrouillée dans un esprit dément est tout autant en sécurité que si elle avait été profondément ensevelie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215672&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11c5b344-41ef-4e9b-a048-a547ebdd2864\', \'multiverseId\': 215672}, \'multiverseid\': 215672}, {\'name\': \'Vedere Oltre\', \'text\': \'Pesca due carte, poi rimescola una carta dalla tua mano nel tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "L\'antico sapere chiuso in una mente impazzita è al sicuro come se fosse sepolto nelle profondità della terra.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216416&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c132cfc-ab52-4c74-b802-acf2c27b6ede\', \'multiverseId\': 216416}, \'multiverseid\': 216416}, {\'name\': \'先読み\', \'text\': \'カードを２枚引き、その後あなたの手札にあるカードを１枚あなたのライブラリーに加えて切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'狂気の中に閉じ込められた古代の知識は、地底深くに閉じ込められたのと同じぐらい安全だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216664&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66b5b0d8-a3af-438f-b32e-5f7223fe91db\', \'multiverseId\': 216664}, \'multiverseid\': 216664}, {\'name\': \'Ver Além\', \'text\': \'Compre dois cards e depois embaralhe um card de sua mão no seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Um conhecimento antigo trancado numa mente enlouquecida está tão seguro quanto quando estava enterrado no fundo da terra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216912&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3933f102-9cff-4ee7-aba7-59f55a66ec9b\', \'multiverseId\': 216912}, \'multiverseid\': 216912}, {\'name\': \'Взгляд Насквозь\', \'text\': \'Возьмите две карты, затем втасуйте карту из вашей руки в вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Древние предания, запертые в доведенном до сумасшествия сознании, так же хорошо спрятаны, как и тогда, когда они были сокрыты глубоко под землей.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215920&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb7d4a0a-7deb-4368-86b4-3c16eea28074\', \'multiverseId\': 215920}, \'multiverseid\': 215920}, {\'name\': \'远见\', \'text\': \'抓两张牌，然后从你手上将一张牌洗入你的牌库。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'远古知识锁在疯狂心灵中，就与深埋地底下一样安全。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6583a057-ce54-4b8d-9f9a-61d0155a559f\', \'multiverseId\': 216168}, \'multiverseid\': 216168}]', '[{\'name\': \'Das Räuberische\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nImmer wenn Das Räuberische einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, bringe ebenso viele 0/1 farblose (Eldrazi, Ausgeburt)-Kreaturenspielsteine ins Spiel. Sie haben „Opfere diese Kreatur: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}".\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Drohne\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217508&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cc6518f-126b-418a-8318-fb41118bf1b5\', \'multiverseId\': 217508}, \'multiverseid\': 217508}, {\'name\': \'El rapaz\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nSiempre que El rapaz haga daño de combate a un jugador, pon en el campo de batalla esa misma cantidad de fichas de criatura Engendro Eldrazi incoloras 0/1. Tienen "Sacrificar esta criatura: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zángano eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217260&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f60ab83f-7034-4346-a864-7a3fca82eec8\', \'multiverseId\': 217260}, \'multiverseid\': 217260}, {\'name\': \'Lui-qui-est-avide\', \'text\': \'Piétinement\\nÀ chaque fois que Lui-qui-est-avide inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, mettez sur le champ de bataille autant de jetons de créature 0/1 incolore Eldrazi et Engeance. Ils ont « Sacrifiez cette créature : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve. »\', \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et drone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215772&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64c8af73-a03d-4a9c-88c1-225e1fc37d66\', \'multiverseId\': 215772}, \'multiverseid\': 215772}, {\'name\': \'Il Famelico\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nOgniqualvolta Il Famelico infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, metti sul campo di battaglia altrettante pedine creatura Progenie Eldrazi 0/1 incolori. Hanno "Sacrifica questa creatura: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Parassita Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216516&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71afe796-2af9-40cb-8a85-457d950cb4c5\', \'multiverseId\': 216516}, \'multiverseid\': 216516}, {\'name\': \'肉喰らうもの\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n肉喰らうものがいずれかのプレイヤーに戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、その点数に等しい数の無色の０/１のエルドラージ・落し子・クリーチャー・トークンを戦場に出す。 それらは「このクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げる：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・ドローン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216764&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89b12ac5-49c9-43df-8a81-3898a51f3b09\', \'multiverseId\': 216764}, \'multiverseid\': 216764}, {\'name\': \'O Opressor\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nToda vez que O Opressor causar dano de combate a um jogador, coloque no campo de batalha uma quantidade equivalente de fichas de criatura incolores 0/1 do tipo Prole Eldrazi. Elas têm "Sacrifique esta criatura: Adicione {1} à sua reserva de mana."\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zangão Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217012&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1e1bba0-9ec9-4818-8ed7-513ef0697eb9\', \'multiverseId\': 217012}, \'multiverseid\': 217012}, {\'name\': \'Прожора\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар\\nКаждый раз когда Прожора наносит боевые повреждения игроку, положите на поле битвы столько же фишек существа 0/1 бесцветный Эльдрази Порождение. У них есть способность «Пожертвуйте это существо: добавьте {1} в ваше хранилище маны».\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази Дрон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216020&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99723229-45a5-4b03-a2c1-d778361dd24d\', \'multiverseId\': 216020}, \'multiverseid\': 216020}, {\'name\': \'捕食恶兽\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n每当捕食恶兽对一位牌手造成战斗伤害时，将等量的0/1无色奥札奇／后裔衍生物放进战场。 它们具有「牺牲此生物：加{1}到你的法术力池中。」\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇／奴兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1bc1d4e4-c93d-4c20-b11f-d871c13fbe40\', \'multiverseId\': 216268}, \'multiverseid\': 216268}]', '[{\'name\': \'Das Vergangene erleiden\', \'text\': \'Schicke X Karten deiner Wahl aus dem Friedhof eines Spielers deiner Wahl ins Exil. Für jede auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickte Karte verliert dieser Spieler 1 Lebenspunkt, und du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Ulamogs Tentakel, deren Berührung wie brennendes Eis war, durchsuchten seine Seele und zapften seine Erinnerungen eine nach der anderen an.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217434&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a869d8db-63d6-485a-9b2b-18ea790a2e5b\', \'multiverseId\': 217434}, \'multiverseid\': 217434}, {\'name\': \'Sufrir el pasado\', \'text\': \'Exilia X cartas objetivo del cementerio del jugador objetivo. Por cada carta exiliada de esta manera, ese jugador pierde 1 vida y tú ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Los tentáculos de Ulamog, con su tacto de hielo ardiente, vagaron por su alma y quemaron sus recuerdos uno a uno.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217186&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ff6d050-05df-4068-9737-53d9fb524ac3\', \'multiverseId\': 217186}, \'multiverseid\': 217186}, {\'name\': \'Subir le passé\', \'text\': \'Exilez X cartes ciblées du cimetière du joueur ciblé. Pour chaque carte exilée de cette manière, ce joueur perd 1 point de vie et vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Le feu glacial des tentacules d\'Ulamog fouaillait son âme et poignardait ses souvenirs un par un.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215698&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b78d812-8cf2-4e8a-a143-4c352d54f329\', \'multiverseId\': 215698}, \'multiverseid\': 215698}, {\'name\': \'Subire il Passato\', \'text\': \'Esilia X carte bersaglio dal cimitero di un giocatore bersaglio. Per ogni carta esiliata in questo modo, quel giocatore perde 1 punto vita e tu guadagni 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'I tentacoli di Ulamog, dal tocco come ghiaccio bollente, frugarono nella sua anima e pungolarono i suoi ricordi uno per uno.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216442&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62435ebd-4d38-47ee-b1b7-138a70370feb\', \'multiverseId\': 216442}, \'multiverseid\': 216442}, {\'name\': \'過去の受難\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人を対象とし、そのプレイヤーの 墓地にあるカードＸ枚を対象とする。その後者を追放する。これにより追放されたカード１枚につき、その前者は１点のライフを失い、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'ウラモグの触手は、触れれば燃える氷のようで、魂の中を漁り回り、記憶を一つ一つ突き刺していく。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216690&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1f1caee-1691-4bff-96aa-faf6b6745f6d\', \'multiverseId\': 216690}, \'multiverseid\': 216690}, {\'name\': \'Sofrer o Passado\', \'text\': \'Exile X cards alvo do cemitério do jogador alvo. Para cada card exilado dessa maneira, aquele jogador perde 1 ponto de vida e você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Os tentáculos de Ulamog, com seu toque ardente como o gelo, vasculharam sua alma e fisgaram suas memórias uma a uma.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216938&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'911f3e1e-1be8-4902-b2ff-37e9a38301ac\', \'multiverseId\': 216938}, \'multiverseid\': 216938}, {\'name\': \'Страдать Прошлым\', \'text\': \'Изгоните X целевых карт из кладбища целевого игрока. За каждую карту, изгнанную таким образом, тот игрок теряет 1 жизнь, а вы получаете 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Щупальца Уламога, обжигающие словно лед, копошились в его душе и жалили воспоминания, одно за другим.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215946&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34540d1d-e734-4db9-b17b-266020bde240\', \'multiverseId\': 215946}, \'multiverseid\': 215946}, {\'name\': \'往事纠缠\', \'text\': \'将X张目标牌从目标牌手的坟墓场放逐。每以此法放逐一张牌，该牌手便失去1点生命且你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'钨拉莫的触手触感有如燃烧的冰，在其灵魂间翻捡，逐一刺激其记忆。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216194&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e044024-e684-4901-9d43-3969467d54d7\', \'multiverseId\': 216194}, \'multiverseid\': 216194}]', "[{'name': 'Desasterradius', 'text': 'Zeige als zusätzliche Kosten, um den Desasterradius zu wirken, eine Kreaturenkarte aus deiner Hand vor.\\nDer Desasterradius fügt allen Kreaturen, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, X Schadenspunkte zu, wobei X die umgewandelten Manakosten der vorgezeigten Karte ist.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217409&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7bd8e001-78a9-480e-935d-588464986837', 'multiverseId': 217409}, 'multiverseid': 217409}, {'name': 'Radio de desastre', 'text': 'Como coste adicional para lanzar el Radio de desastre, muestra una carta de criatura de tu mano.\\nEl Radio de desastre hace X puntos de daño a cada criatura que controle tu oponente, donde X es el coste de maná convertido de la carta mostrada.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217161&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a5f20195-90fc-45ce-9e7b-1de50a554e95', 'multiverseId': 217161}, 'multiverseid': 217161}, {'name': 'Rayonnement de désastre', 'text': 'En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer le Rayonnement de désastre, révélez une carte de créature de votre main.\\nLe Rayonnement de désastre inflige X blessures à chaque créature que vos adversaires contrôlent, X étant le coût converti de mana de la carte révélée.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215673&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b142341f-640c-481d-957c-b8eb46272da1', 'multiverseId': 215673}, 'multiverseid': 215673}, {'name': 'Raggio del Disastro', 'text': 'Come costo addizionale per lanciare il Raggio del Disastro, rivela una carta creatura dalla tua mano.\\nIl Raggio del Disastro infligge X danni a ogni creatura controllata dai tuoi avversari, dove X è il costo di mana convertito della carta rivelata.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216417&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '05c5339f-ec75-4fa7-8092-323c0a6b6f67', 'multiverseId': 216417}, 'multiverseid': 216417}, {'name': '災難の範囲', 'text': '災難の範囲を唱えるための追加コストとして、あなたの手札にあるクリーチャー・カードを１枚公開する。\\n災難の範囲はあなたの対戦相手がコントロールする各クリーチャーに、それぞれＸ点のダメージを与える。Ｘはその公開されたカードの点数で見たマナ・コストに等しい。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216665&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '44bfac01-109f-4af8-893f-4eac2d44a368', 'multiverseId': 216665}, 'multiverseid': 216665}, {'name': 'Raio do Desastre', 'text': 'Como custo adicional para conjurar Raio do Desastre, revele um card de criatura da sua mão.\\nRaio do Desastre causa X pontos de dano a cada criatura que seus oponentes controlam, sendo X igual ao custo de mana convertido do card revelado.', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216913&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0f74e8c9-9420-45c3-88ea-188446bc1dc7', 'multiverseId': 216913}, 'multiverseid': 216913}, {'name': 'Радиус Катастрофы', 'text': 'В качестве дополнительной стоимости разыгрывания Радиуса Катастрофы покажите карту существа из вашей руки.\\nРадиус Катастрофы наносит X повреждений каждому существу под контролем ваших оппонентов, где X — конвертированная мана-стоимость показанной карты.', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215921&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '371fe779-f2b4-4225-8a22-9ffcf91c8411', 'multiverseId': 215921}, 'multiverseid': 215921}, {'name': '灾祸范围', 'text': '从你手上展示一张生物牌，以作为施放灾祸范围的额外费用。\\n灾祸范围对每个由对手所操控的生物各造成X点伤害，X为所展示之牌的总法术力费用。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216169&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1ed38a26-4a71-4a38-be28-6acf532a662a', 'multiverseId': 216169}, 'multiverseid': 216169}]", '[{\'name\': \'Die Macht der Massen\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält für jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Die Joraga-Elfen haben es nicht nötig, Trolle aus ihrem Gebiet zu vertreiben. Sie verleihen ihnen einfach ihre gesammelte Stärke, und kein Troll kann dann widerstehen, sich auf eine lustige Rauftour in fremde Länder zu begeben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217391&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02da7433-d54e-493a-b795-28e8d5e33523\', \'multiverseId\': 217391}, \'multiverseid\': 217391}, {\'name\': \'Poder de las masas\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno por cada criatura que controles.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Los elfos de Joraga nunca necesitan pedir a un trol que deje su territorio. Simplemente le otorgan su fuerza combinada y éste no puede resistir emprender un alegre viaje de destrucción.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217143&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'555f9b8f-3cfb-4c09-9909-1d433bc3d985\', \'multiverseId\': 217143}, \'multiverseid\': 217143}, {\'name\': \'Puissance des masses\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour pour chaque créature que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Les elfes de Joraga ne demandent jamais à un troll de quitter leur territoire. Ils lui transfèrent juste leur force combinée et il ne peut résister très longtemps à l\'appel de la sauvagerie.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215655&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3b6452b-575a-483d-91d3-1bebd64c7b73\', \'multiverseId\': 215655}, \'multiverseid\': 215655}, {\'name\': \'Potere delle Masse\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno per ogni creatura che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Gli elfi di Joraga non hanno mai la necessità di chiedere a un troll di alzare i tacchi. Basta che gli concedano la loro forza combinata e quello non può resistere alla prospettiva di scatenarsi come un pazzo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216399&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c96da63-3cf5-4fb7-a0dd-b84fd3178d8c\', \'multiverseId\': 216399}, \'multiverseid\': 216399}, {\'name\': \'大群の力\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体につき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'ジョラーガのエルフは、トロールに対して領地から出て行けとは言わない。 単に彼らの力を渡すだけで、嬉々として襲撃に出かけることを我慢できなくなるからだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216647&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'469a61e2-1d53-42f0-b773-e2b58e5d4cc7\', \'multiverseId\': 216647}, \'multiverseid\': 216647}, {\'name\': \'Força das Massas\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno para cada criatura que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Os elfos Joraga jamais precisam pedir que um trol deixe seu território. Basta conceder a ele sua força conjunta para que parta numa fúria enlouquecida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216895&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'382b39ba-5070-4309-83b2-a50e3172e1be\', \'multiverseId\': 216895}, \'multiverseid\': 216895}, {\'name\': \'Сила Масс\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает +1/+1 до конца хода за каждое существо под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Джорагским эльфам никогда не приходится просить тролля уйти с их территории. Они просто наделяют его своей общей силой, и бедняга не может не удариться в очередное веселое неистовство.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215903&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb5f0b3a-4dc9-4d4c-b759-1442524dc616\', \'multiverseId\': 215903}, \'multiverseid\': 215903}, {\'name\': \'众人之力\', \'text\': \'你每操控一个生物，目标生物便得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'玖瑞加妖精从未要求巨魔离开其领土。 他们只是将集体之力量赋予它身上，使它忍不住要展开快乐的暴冲旅程。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216151&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'315cea5d-3e1f-436f-bc2d-de25889f041a\', \'multiverseId\': 216151}, \'multiverseid\': 216151}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Sanften auffressen\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre alle Kreaturen mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 3 oder weniger. Sie können nicht regeneriert werden.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Warum es zerstört? Es zerstört, und die Suche nach Gründen verschwendet Zeit und Atem." —Nirthu, einsamer Missionar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217340&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c81f4816-b6bc-4f0c-84cb-6b2b12767765\', \'multiverseId\': 217340}, \'multiverseid\': 217340}, {\'name\': \'Consumir a los mansos\', \'text\': \'Destruye cada criatura con coste de maná convertido de 3 o menos. No pueden ser regeneradas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Por qué destruye? Lo hace, y hablar de razones es gastar tiempo y saliva." —Nirthu, misionero solitario\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217092&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a65bcd29-1148-41f9-a6a1-835711378442\', \'multiverseId\': 217092}, \'multiverseid\': 217092}, {\'name\': \'Dévorer les humbles\', \'text\': \'Détruisez chaque créature dont le coût converti de mana est de 3 ou moins. Elles ne peuvent pas être régénérées.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Pourquoi détruit-il tout ? Il le fait et lui trouver des raisons ne serait qu\'une perte de temps et de salive. » —Nirthu, missionnaire solitaire", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215604&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b2cbb4b-3e3d-4118-a9e9-7d3f012aa2c9\', \'multiverseId\': 215604}, \'multiverseid\': 215604}, {\'name\': \'Consumare gli Umili\', \'text\': \'Distruggi ogni creatura con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a 3. Non possono essere rigenerate.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Perché distrugge? Lo fa e chiedersi il motivo è uno spreco di tempo ed energia." —Nirthu, missionario solitario\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216348&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'928b299d-d1fc-4185-8c9b-ea3d8c55f8f5\', \'multiverseId\': 216348}, \'multiverseid\': 216348}, {\'name\': \'弱者の消耗\', \'text\': \'点数で見たマナ・コストが３以下の各クリーチャーを破壊する。 それらは再生できない。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「それはなぜ破壊するのかだと？ それがそうするからだ。理由を語るなど時間と呼吸の無駄だ。」 ――孤独な宣教師、ニルトゥ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216596&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa2956e5-be0c-494e-819c-c6e2a2ea3561\', \'multiverseId\': 216596}, \'multiverseid\': 216596}, {\'name\': \'Consumir os Humildes\', \'text\': \'Destrua cada criatura com custo de mana convertido menor ou igual a 3. Elas não podem ser regeneradas.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Por que ele destrói? Ele simplesmente faz isso, e discutir suas razões é um desperdício de tempo e fôlego." — Nirthu, missionário solitário\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216844&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2030098d-007a-43b6-862e-03bc1ca4970f\', \'multiverseId\': 216844}, \'multiverseid\': 216844}, {\'name\': \'Истребление Кротких\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте каждое существо с конвертированной мана-стоимостью 3 или меньше. Они не могут быть регенерированы.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Почему оно разрушает? Просто разрушает и все, а разговоры о причинах — пустая трата времени и энергии». — Нирту, миссионер-одиночка\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215852&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e3b6e08-cf9b-4bb7-8b23-668aece9320c\', \'multiverseId\': 215852}, \'multiverseid\': 215852}, {\'name\': \'吞噬弱者\', \'text\': \'消灭所有总法术力费用为3或更少的生物。 它们不能重生。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「它为何要破坏？ 它就是要破坏，说明理由只是浪费时间与气力。」 ～独行传教士讷图\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216100&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6af883b9-549d-423f-898a-ec203ff5ce05\', \'multiverseId\': 216100}, \'multiverseid\': 216100}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dolchrücken-Basilisk\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Basilisk\', \'flavor\': \'„Versteinernder Blick, tödliche Klauen, messerscharfe Rückenzacken, giftiger Speichel... habe ich etwas vergessen? ... Toxische Knochen? Ehrlich?" —Samila aus Murasas Expeditionsgildenhaus\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217472&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c9fec88-ae0e-473e-b8f0-5f884f207feb\', \'multiverseId\': 217472}, \'multiverseid\': 217472}, {\'name\': \'Basilisco lomo de dagas\', \'text\': \'Toque mortal.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Basilisco\', \'flavor\': \'"Mirada petrificante, colmillos mortales, púas dorsales como cuchillos, saliva venenosa...¿Me olvido de algo? ...¿Huesos tóxicos? ¿En serio?" —Samila, Casa expedicionaria de Murasa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217224&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c3a4c19-ec75-4e7d-95f2-bab50b535199\', \'multiverseId\': 217224}, \'multiverseid\': 217224}, {\'name\': \'Basilic daguéchine\', \'text\': \'Contact mortel\', \'type\': \'Créature : basilic\', \'flavor\': "« Regard pétrifiant, crocs mortels, épines dorsales tranchantes, salive venimeuse . . . J\'oublie quelque chose ? . . . Os toxiques ? Sans blague ? » —Samila, corps expéditionnaire de Murasa", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215736&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4929b580-dc62-4dae-82b5-e4995542044d\', \'multiverseId\': 215736}, \'multiverseid\': 215736}, {\'name\': \'Basilisco dal Dorso Appuntito\', \'text\': \'Tocco letale\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Basilisco\', \'flavor\': \'"Sguardo pietrificante, zanne letali, spina dorsale affilata, saliva velenosa. . . Dimentico qualcosa? . . . Ossa intossicanti? Veramente?" —Samila, Casa di Spedizioni di Murasa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216480&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81211b79-1cd1-4091-b657-4b8380a742d4\', \'multiverseId\': 216480}, \'multiverseid\': 216480}, {\'name\': \'短刀背のバジリスク\', \'text\': \'接死\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — バジリスク\', \'flavor\': \'「石化の眼、恐ろしい牙、ナイフみたいな背中の棘、毒のよだれ……何か抜けてる？ 骨が有毒？ 本当に？」 ――ムラーサ探検隊のサミーラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216728&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58ead12a-fa9c-4399-b7d2-53f3af32b4c6\', \'multiverseId\': 216728}, \'multiverseid\': 216728}, {\'name\': \'Basilisco Dorso-de-Adaga\', \'text\': \'Toque mortífero\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Basilisco\', \'flavor\': \'"Olhar petrificante, caninos mortais, espinha dorsal lacerante, saliva venenosa... estou esquecendo algo? ... Ossos tóxicos? Sério?" — Samila, Casa Expedicionária de Murasa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216976&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c2210db-437b-4b2a-a078-3c8d295a0652\', \'multiverseId\': 216976}, \'multiverseid\': 216976}, {\'name\': \'Василиск-Спинокол\', \'text\': \'Смертельное касание\', \'type\': \'Существо — Василиск\', \'flavor\': \'«Взгляд, превращающий в камень, смертоносные клыки, позвонки, похожие на острые ножи, ядовитая слюна... Я что-нибудь упустила? ...Ядовитые кости? Серьезно?» — Самила из мурасского экспедиционного дома\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215984&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea97c115-c72a-4e9a-b6ab-abfed3e6583f\', \'multiverseId\': 215984}, \'multiverseid\': 215984}, {\'name\': \'匕背蜥怪\', \'text\': \'死触\', \'type\': \'生物～蜥怪\', \'flavor\': \'「石化视线，尖锐牙齿，如刀的背骨片，有毒唾液...我有漏掉什么吗？ ...骨头带毒？ 真的吗？」 ～姆拉撒探险队的莎米勒\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216232&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f6c3824-0b88-47bc-b0b8-21d0615a9433\', \'multiverseId\': 216232}, \'multiverseid\': 216232}]', '[{\'name\': \'Domestizierung\', \'text\': \'Kreaturenverzauberung\\nDu kontrollierst die verzauberte Kreatur.\\nIst zu Beginn deines Endsegments die Stärke der verzauberten Kreatur 4 oder höher, opfere die Domestizierung.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217422&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e29a4e0c-b0db-47a2-92bf-73495b761a08\', \'multiverseId\': 217422}, \'multiverseid\': 217422}, {\'name\': \'Domesticación\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nTú controlas la criatura encantada.\\nAl comienzo de tu paso final, si la fuerza de la criatura encantada es 4 o más, sacrifica la Domesticación.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217174&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a307e097-13a6-4f44-bc22-360a97b1da1e\', \'multiverseId\': 217174}, \'multiverseid\': 217174}, {\'name\': \'Domestication\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nVous contrôlez la créature enchantée.\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, si la force de la créature enchantée est supérieure ou égale à 4, sacrifiez la Domestication.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215686&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da1b5ab3-4880-4bc5-ac33-f125a4e2cf9e\', \'multiverseId\': 215686}, \'multiverseid\': 215686}, {\'name\': \'Addomesticare\', \'text\': "Incanta creatura\\nControlli la creatura incantata.\\nAll\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, se la forza della creatura incantata è pari o superiore a 4, sacrifica Addomesticare.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216430&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7aaf86ce-68ce-4b72-a028-755da39ec16d\', \'multiverseId\': 216430}, \'multiverseid\': 216430}, {\'name\': \'家畜化\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nあなたはエンチャントされているクリーチャーをコントロールする。\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、エンチャントされているクリーチャーのパワーが４以上である場合、家畜化を生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216678&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5484867-1eb7-4e2a-b6a7-f4845a016fce\', \'multiverseId\': 216678}, \'multiverseid\': 216678}, {\'name\': \'Domesticação\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nVocê controla a criatura encantada.\\nNo início de sua etapa final, se o poder da criatura encantada for maior ou igual a 4, sacrifique Domesticação.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216926&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd3686a3-753a-46da-a061-6ee73d00af88\', \'multiverseId\': 216926}, \'multiverseid\': 216926}, {\'name\': \'Одомашнивание\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nВы контролируете зачарованное существо.\\nВ начале вашего заключительного шага, если сила зачарованного существа равна 4 или больше, пожертвуйте Одомашнивание.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215934&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0473cda3-c0f9-4c58-b648-c02ef95dbc26\', \'multiverseId\': 215934}, \'multiverseid\': 215934}, {\'name\': \'驯化\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n你操控所结附的生物。\\n在你的结束步骤开始时，若所结附的生物之力量为4或更多，则牺牲驯化。\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216182&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'091bbb2e-a641-420d-a8a1-8ecab0e647d5\', \'multiverseId\': 216182}, \'multiverseid\': 216182}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dornenschnapper\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nTappe eine ungetappte Kreatur, die du kontrollierst: Der Dornenschnapper erhält +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'Ein Dornenschnapper wird erzeugt, indem man dreizehn verschiedene Pflanzen aufeinander pfropft, denen es bereits nach Fleisch giert.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217333&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'518d56d8-8d60-4fb6-a0fd-3d9ba80d0a2b\', \'multiverseId\': 217333}, \'multiverseid\': 217333}, {\'name\': \'Chascazarzas\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nGirar una criatura enderezada que controlas: El Chascazarzas obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'Un chascazarzas se crea juntando trece tipos distintos de plantas que comen carne.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217085&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85a420cf-567a-4a36-867f-ce6ee3a3a926\', \'multiverseId\': 217085}, \'multiverseid\': 217085}, {\'name\': \'Claqueronce\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nEngagez une créature dégagée que vous contrôlez : Le Claqueronce gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : Élémental\', \'flavor\': "Pour créer un claqueronce, il faut greffer treize plantes différentes déjà dotées d\'un appétit pour la viande.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215597&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4490b05e-53f3-44d1-823d-be660932aec9\', \'multiverseId\': 215597}, \'multiverseid\': 215597}, {\'name\': \'Rovo Azzannatore\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nTAPpa una creatura STAPpata che controlli: Il Rovo Azzannatore prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'Un rovo azzannatore è creato innestando tredici piante diverse che già bramano carne.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9100a21f-7c8a-406d-87db-ce5730468678\', \'multiverseId\': 216341}, \'multiverseid\': 216341}, {\'name\': \'茨噛み付き\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\nあなたがコントロールするアンタップ状態のクリーチャーを１体タップする：茨噛み付きはターン終了時まで＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': \'茨噛み付きは異なる十三種もの肉に飢えている植物を継ぎ合わせて作られている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216589&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c14ba4d-53e3-41b0-9362-0bdd6cbc6eaf\', \'multiverseId\': 216589}, \'multiverseid\': 216589}, {\'name\': \'Mordisqueira\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nVire uma criatura desvirada que você controla: Mordisqueira recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'Uma mordisqueira é formada a partir de enxertos de treze plantas diferentes que por si só já eram famintas por carne.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216837&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'444fbd98-eb76-4bcb-8aaf-4b1c608a91f5\', \'multiverseId\': 216837}, \'multiverseid\': 216837}, {\'name\': \'Тернохват\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар\\nПоверните неповернутое существо под вашим контролем: Тернохват получает +1/+1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль\', \'flavor\': \'Тернохват образуется путем сращивания тринадцати различных растений, и без того жаждущих полакомиться мясом.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215845&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7db3e4e7-4e62-4fcc-8815-8c617cfd15a8\', \'multiverseId\': 215845}, \'multiverseid\': 215845}, {\'name\': \'竹攫灵\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n横置一个由你操控且未横置的生物：竹攫灵得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～元素\', \'flavor\': \'竹攫灵是由十三个不同种类、但同样想尝肉味的植物所组成。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216093&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'619aeba4-2e37-41b8-921a-3e77b418fe63\', \'multiverseId\': 216093}, \'multiverseid\': 216093}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drana, Bluthäuptling der Kalastria\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{X}{B}{B}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -0/-X bis zum Ende des Zuges, und Drana, Bluthäuptling der Kalastria, erhält +X/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Vampir, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Falls unsere ehemaligen Meister uns wieder zwingen wollen, vor ihnen zu knien, werden wir ihnen unseren Widerstand in ihre Membranen einritzen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217416&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7c3fe97-fba9-4b1a-870d-ec5f06e1f49b\', \'multiverseId\': 217416}, \'multiverseid\': 217416}, {\'name\': \'Drana, jefe de sangre Kalastria\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{X}{B}{B}: La criatura objetivo obtiene -0/-X hasta el final del turno y Drana, jefe de sangre Kalastria obtiene +X/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Chamán vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Si nuestros antiguos amos quieren que nos arrodillemos nuevamente, sentirán nuestro desafío clavado en sus membranas."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a5ab794-f754-4f49-8192-71a0bf0d7f7b\', \'multiverseId\': 217168}, \'multiverseid\': 217168}, {\'name\': \'Drana, chef de sang des Kalastria\', \'text\': "Vol\\n{X}{B}{B} : La créature ciblée gagne -0/-X jusqu\'à la fin du tour et Drana, chef de sang des Kalastria gagne +X/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : vampire et shamane\', \'flavor\': "« Si nos anciens maîtres veulent nous voir à nouveau prosternés à leurs pieds, c\'est notre défiance qu\'ils verront déchirer leurs membranes. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215680&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'093cebfb-50d4-4aef-8eac-077b3b663fec\', \'multiverseId\': 215680}, \'multiverseid\': 215680}, {\'name\': \'Drana, Capo Sanguinario Kalastria\', \'text\': \'Volare\\n{X}{B}{B}: Una creatura bersaglio prende -0/-X fino alla fine del turno e Drana, Capo Sanguinario Kalastria prende +X/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Sciamano Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Se i nostri precedenti padroni ci faranno inginocchiare di nuovo, sentiranno il nostro disprezzo fustigare le loro membrane."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216424&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3fba217-0942-403b-8755-598cc691df82\', \'multiverseId\': 216424}, \'multiverseid\': 216424}, {\'name\': \'カラストリアの血の長、ドラーナ\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{X}{B}{B}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで－０/－Ｘの修整を受け、カラストリアの血の長、ドラーナはターン終了時まで＋Ｘ/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 吸血鬼・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「かつての我らの支配者が我らを再びひざまずかせようとするなら、我らの反逆の傷をその皮膚に感じることになるだろう。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fe02cfa-704b-41be-9202-c5e778f55021\', \'multiverseId\': 216672}, \'multiverseid\': 216672}, {\'name\': \'Drana, Grão-Vampiro Kalastria\', \'text\': \'Voar\\n{X}{B}{B}: A criatura alvo recebe -0/-X até o final do turno e Drana, Grão-Vampiro Kalastria, recebe +X/+0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Vampiro Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'"Se nossos antigos mestres nos fizerem ajoelhar novamente, sentirão nossa resistência rasgar suas membranas."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216920&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf65d910-0ad6-4144-858d-132d4d08fa50\', \'multiverseId\': 216920}, \'multiverseid\': 216920}, {\'name\': \'Драна, Кровавый Вождь Каластриев\', \'text\': \'Полет\\n{X}{B}{B}: целевое существо получает -0/-X до конца хода, а Драна, Кровавый Вождь Каластриев получает +X/+0 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Вампир Шаман\', \'flavor\': \'«Если наши прежние хозяева снова захотят поставить нас на колени, они почувствуют наше неповиновение на собственной шкуре».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215928&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fad4e5d-402f-497b-83df-358db46833e0\', \'multiverseId\': 215928}, \'multiverseid\': 215928}, {\'name\': \'卡列奇血侯哲娜\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n{X}{B}{B}：目标生物得-0/-X直到回合结束且卡列奇血侯哲娜得+X/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物～吸血鬼／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'「如果过去的主人要我们再度降服，就让他们尝尝被反抗力刺透的滋味。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216176&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5cb807a-1e4c-4ad0-9746-3c67c37a4e0a\', \'multiverseId\': 216176}, \'multiverseid\': 216176}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drohne des Grauens\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Drohne des Grauens ins Spiel kommt, bringe zwei 0/1 farblose (Eldrazi, Ausgeburt)-Kreaturenspielsteine ins Spiel. Sie haben „Opfere diese Kreatur: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}".\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Drohne\', \'flavor\': \'Jeder der uralten Eldrazi gebar Schrecken in unvorstellbaren Gestalten als seine Nachkommen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217386&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c4ff6a1-cbae-46b3-9857-cc329960b05f\', \'multiverseId\': 217386}, \'multiverseid\': 217386}, {\'name\': \'Zángano pavoroso\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Zángano pavoroso entre al campo de batalla, pon en el campo de batalla dos fichas de criatura Engendro Eldrazi incoloras 0/1. Tienen "Sacrificar esta criatura: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zángano eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Cada antiguo eldrazi engendró su propio linaje de horrores con formas incomprensibles.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217138&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'524b7333-675f-464a-bcd6-e7fccbfe07f2\', \'multiverseId\': 217138}, \'multiverseid\': 217138}, {\'name\': "Drone de l\'effroi", \'text\': "Quand le Drone de l\'effroi arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez sur le champ de bataille deux jetons de créature 0/1 incolore Eldrazi et Engeance. Ils ont « Sacrifiez cette créature : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve. »", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et drone\', \'flavor\': "Chaque ancêtre eldrazi donna naissance à une lignée d\'indescriptibles horreurs informes.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215650&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5762190d-10ca-43cd-a390-3d2c1a099e74\', \'multiverseId\': 215650}, \'multiverseid\': 215650}, {\'name\': \'Parassita del Terrore\', \'text\': \'Quando il Parassita del Terrore entra nel campo di battaglia, metti sul campo di battaglia due pedine creatura Progenie Eldrazi 0/1 incolori. Hanno "Sacrifica questa creatura: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Parassita Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Ogni Eldrazi antico generò una stirpe di orrori dalle forme imperscrutabili.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216394&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b432a8cb-91ac-4b54-bc81-5d7dfa3bf868\', \'multiverseId\': 216394}, \'multiverseid\': 216394}, {\'name\': \'戦慄の徒食者\', \'text\': \'戦慄の徒食者が戦場に出たとき、無色の０/１のエルドラージ・落とし子・クリーチャー・トークンを２体戦場に出す。 それらは「このクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げる：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・ドローン\', \'flavor\': \'古きエルドラージはそれぞれ、理解できない形の怪物の血族を生み出していった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216642&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8314a814-b80e-48a6-969d-204ecfc0e32c\', \'multiverseId\': 216642}, \'multiverseid\': 216642}, {\'name\': \'Zangão Aterrorizante\', \'text\': \'Quando Zangão Aterrorizante entrar no campo de batalha, coloque no campo de batalha duas fichas de criatura incolor 0/1 do tipo Prole Eldrazi. Elas têm "Sacrifique esta criatura: Adicione {1} à sua reserva de mana."\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zangão Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Cada um dos anciões Eldrazi gerou uma linhagem de horrores de formas incompreensíveis.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216890&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd6f436e-4206-400d-be49-a6a742c4161e\', \'multiverseId\': 216890}, \'multiverseid\': 216890}, {\'name\': \'Вселяющий Ужас Дрон\', \'text\': \'Когда Вселяющий Ужас Дрон выходит на поле битвы, положите на поле битвы две фишки существа 0/1 бесцветный Эльдрази Порождение. У них есть способность «Пожертвуйте это существо: добавьте {1} в ваше хранилище маны».\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльдрази Дрон\', \'flavor\': \'Каждый древний Эльдрази породил династию ужасов самых немыслимых форм.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215898&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cf0edef-aeb4-477d-971f-d6dc58825a74\', \'multiverseId\': 215898}, \'multiverseid\': 215898}, {\'name\': \'可怖奴兽\', \'text\': \'当可怖奴兽进战场时，将两个0/1无色奥札奇／后裔衍生物放进战场。 它们具有「牺牲此生物：加{1}到你的法术力池中。」\', \'type\': \'生物～奥札奇／奴兽\', \'flavor\': \'每个奥札奇先祖所繁衍的惊惧兽，都各有难以想像的外貌。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216146&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cdbfa78-d56e-463c-980c-a792917a9981\', \'multiverseId\': 216146}, \'multiverseid\': 216146}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dunkelheit zurückweisen\', \'text\': \'Tappe bis zu zwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Eine Gunst für diejenigen, die nicht im Dunklen sehen können. Ein Bann für jene, die darin leben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217476&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fa5fea6-5142-49c8-a15e-8f1d634111f9\', \'multiverseId\': 217476}, \'multiverseid\': 217476}, {\'name\': \'Repeler la oscuridad\', \'text\': \'Gira hasta dos criaturas objetivo.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Una bendición para aquellos que no pueden ver en la oscuridad. Una maldición para los que viven en ella.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217228&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'852e3e0f-dbc8-41ae-b585-3221874ce939\', \'multiverseId\': 217228}, \'multiverseid\': 217228}, {\'name\': \'Repousser les ténèbres\', \'text\': "Engagez jusqu\'à deux créatures ciblées.\\nPiochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'Une aubaine pour ceux qui ne voient pas dans le noir. Une malédiction pour ceux qui y vivent.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215740&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fb76d74-f306-4379-8847-08b6dc9f3146\', \'multiverseId\': 215740}, \'multiverseid\': 215740}, {\'name\': "Respingere l\'Oscurità", \'text\': \'TAPpa fino a due creature bersaglio.\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Un dono per quanti non possono vedere al buio. Un incubo per quanti ci vivono.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216484&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf200846-af64-4157-9f14-e6b566df2ee6\', \'multiverseId\': 216484}, \'multiverseid\': 216484}, {\'name\': \'闇の追い返し\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーを最大２体まで対象とし、それらをタップする。\\nカードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'闇に盲いる者に恩恵を。 闇に住まう者に厳刑を。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216732&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a161a1f-cc1c-4915-b661-22b090f82296\', \'multiverseId\': 216732}, \'multiverseid\': 216732}, {\'name\': \'Repelir a Escuridão\', \'text\': \'Vire até duas criaturas alvo.\\nCompre um card.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Uma bênção para os que não podem ver no escuro. Uma praga para os que lá vivem.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216980&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95d60f08-62ca-4574-920b-1808f9170eb0\', \'multiverseId\': 216980}, \'multiverseid\': 216980}, {\'name\': \'Отразить Тьму\', \'text\': \'Поверните не более двух целевых существ.\\nВозьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Благо — для тех, кто не видит в темноте. Погибель — для тех, кто в ней живет.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215988&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15970bbf-d1d0-4404-af8f-4a4193e2f961\', \'multiverseId\': 215988}, \'multiverseid\': 215988}, {\'name\': \'逐退黑暗\', \'text\': \'横置至多两个目标生物。\\n抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'对在暗处无法视物者，这是个方便好物。 对居于该处者，这是个致命毒物。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216236&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df5d3890-e581-4f28-b847-318d3b683cdb\', \'multiverseId\': 216236}, \'multiverseid\': 216236}]', '[{\'name\': \'Durchbohrendes Licht\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine angreifende oder blockende Kreatur deiner Wahl mit Stärke 3 oder weniger.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Vampire wussten, was kommen würde. Das weiß ich. Und sie taten nichts. Sie haben es verdient, den selben Schmerz zu fühlen, den sie uns verursacht haben." —Anitan, Ondu-Kleriker\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217402&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'758736b4-553d-4ac0-a1ed-2b70224a7b88\', \'multiverseId\': 217402}, \'multiverseid\': 217402}, {\'name\': \'Luz punzante\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura atacante o bloqueadora objetivo con fuerza de 3 o menos.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Los vampiros sabían lo que se avecinaba. Lo sé. Y no hicieron nada. Merecen sentir la misma agonía que nos causaron a todos nosotros." —Anitan, clérigo de Ondu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217154&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f74f016-e963-4e5a-94d6-b2337c05abcd\', \'multiverseId\': 217154}, \'multiverseid\': 217154}, {\'name\': \'Lumière perforante\', \'text\': \'Détruisez la créature attaquante ou bloqueuse ciblée de force inférieure ou égale à 3.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Les vampires savaient ce qui allait arriver. J\'en suis sûr. Et ils n\'ont rien fait. Ils méritent de subir les mêmes souffrances qu\'ils nous ont causées. » —Anitan, clerc du Ondou", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215666&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'892448ae-71c6-4a72-81ea-0847036de6b4\', \'multiverseId\': 215666}, \'multiverseid\': 215666}, {\'name\': \'Luce Perforante\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura attaccante o bloccante bersaglio con forza pari o inferiore a 3.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"I vampiri sapevano cosa stava per accadere. Ne sono certo. E non hanno fatto nulla. Meritano di provare le stesse sofferenze che hanno attirato su tutti noi." —Anitan, chierico di Ondu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216410&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7b84963-a2e6-4296-a8ad-425bf051855b\', \'multiverseId\': 216410}, \'multiverseid\': 216410}, {\'name\': \'刺し込む光\', \'text\': \'攻撃かブロックしているパワーが３以下のクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「吸血鬼は来るべき物を知っていました。 間違いないでしょう。 しかし彼らは何もしてくれませんでした。 私どもの感じる苦悩と同じものを、彼らも感じるべきでしょう。」 ――オンドゥの僧侶、アニタン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216658&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfd6fc1d-6738-47ff-8c47-72bfe725fae5\', \'multiverseId\': 216658}, \'multiverseid\': 216658}, {\'name\': \'Luz Perfurante\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura atacante ou bloqueadora alvo com poder menor ou igual a 3.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Os vampiros sabiam o que estava por vir. Eu sei. E eles não fizeram nada. Eles merecem sentir a mesma agonia que causaram a todos nós." — Anitan, clérigo de Ondu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216906&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7851e16a-0c80-4cde-baa3-b323f774a9d9\', \'multiverseId\': 216906}, \'multiverseid\': 216906}, {\'name\': \'Пронзающий Свет\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевое атакующее или блокирующее существо с силой 3 или меньше.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Вампиры знали о том, что грядет. Я это знаю. И ничего не предприняли. Они заслуживают прочувствовать ту же агонию, которую навлекли на всех нас». — Анитан, священник из Онду\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215914&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5bdb570-b5d9-422d-ba0d-2a571ce8212d\', \'multiverseId\': 215914}, \'multiverseid\': 215914}, {\'name\': \'穿刺光束\', \'text\': \'消灭目标进行攻击或阻挡，且力量等于或小于3的生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「吸血鬼晓得将会发生什么事。 我很清楚。 但他们什么都不作。 他们活该承受自己对我们所造成的同样苦痛。」 ～昂度僧侣阿尼坦\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216162&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'254a5db8-80f2-420f-b4c7-dc78f4d77c09\', \'multiverseId\': 216162}, \'multiverseid\': 216162}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dämmerglanz-Beschwörer\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{8}: Tappe alle Kreaturen, die ein Spieler deiner Wahl kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Kor, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Was wir als Emeria, Ula und Cosi kannten, waren keine göttlichen Wesen, sondern ein grausamer Trick und ein großer Irrtum." —Die Geschichten der Beschwörer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217399&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38841291-1a15-45af-bc3a-774a191d6668\', \'multiverseId\': 217399}, \'multiverseid\': 217399}, {\'name\': \'Invocadora del fulgor del alba\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{8}: Gira todas las criaturas que controla el jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero kor\', \'flavor\': \'"Lo que conocíamos como Emeria, Ula y Cosi no son seres divinos sino un truco vil, y un gran error." —Cuentos de los invocadores\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217151&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'954c45ff-581f-4883-aa20-d85e004d7ced\', \'multiverseId\': 217151}, \'multiverseid\': 217151}, {\'name\': \'Invocatrice aubegloire\', \'text\': \'Vol\\n{8} : Engagez toutes les créatures que le joueur ciblé contrôle.\', \'type\': \'Créature : kor et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Éméria, Ula et Cosi n\'étaient pas les êtres divins que nous pensions connaître, mais une plaisanterie cruelle, et une erreur grave. » —Les Contes des Invocateurs", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215663&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eabba3e2-9390-4bc3-b89e-d551692b71f1\', \'multiverseId\': 215663}, \'multiverseid\': 215663}, {\'name\': "Evocatrice dell\'Alba Accecante", \'text\': \'Volare\\n{8}: TAPpa tutte le creature controllate da un giocatore bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Kor\', \'flavor\': \'"Quelli che conoscevamo come Emeria, Ula e Cosi non erano per nulla esseri divini, ma un trucco crudele e un grave errore." —Racconti degli Evocatori\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216407&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3572380-cc9b-4e5b-8a0e-6a9badcec6ec\', \'multiverseId\': 216407}, \'multiverseid\': 216407}, {\'name\': \'暁輝きの発動者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{8}：プレイヤー１人を対象とし、そのプレイヤーがコントロールするすべてのクリーチャーをタップする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — コー・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「我々がエメリアやウーラやコーシとして知っていたものは、神の如き存在でもなんでもない、残忍な計略で、大きな間違いでしかなかったのだ。」 ――「発動者伝」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216655&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f33cd971-d818-41a3-bc6b-9f1dcb67dfab\', \'multiverseId\': 216655}, \'multiverseid\': 216655}, {\'name\': \'Invocador do Clarão da Aurora\', \'text\': \'Voar\\n{8}: Vire todas as criaturas que o jogador alvo controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Kor Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Aquilo que conhecíamos como Emeria, Ula e Cosi não eram seres divinos, mas um truque cruel e um erro grave." — Lendas dos Invocadores\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216903&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'867b5201-bec7-4305-8352-6848e372a5dc\', \'multiverseId\': 216903}, \'multiverseid\': 216903}, {\'name\': \'Призывательница Слепящего Света\', \'text\': \'Полет\\n{8}: поверните все существа под контролем целевого игрока.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кор Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Те, кого мы знали под именами Эмерия, Ула и Коси, оказались отнюдь не божествами, а жестоким обманом и серьезной ошибкой». — Сказания призывателей\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215911&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4422857-8c9b-4b42-aa4e-5e3884b70b5b\', \'multiverseId\': 215911}, \'multiverseid\': 215911}, {\'name\': \'晨炫召现师\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n{8}：横置由目标牌手操控的所有生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～寇族／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「我们所知道的伊美黎，钨拉，以及寇希根本不是神明，而是残酷骗局与严重错误。」 ～《召现师传说》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216159&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b30b662c-6d19-4107-a596-86998e7d4295\', \'multiverseId\': 216159}, \'multiverseid\': 216159}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dämonischer Appetit\', \'text\': \'Kreatur-die-du-kontrollierst-Verzauberung\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +3/+3.\\nOpfere zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments eine Kreatur.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Sittliches Verhalten ist nur ein Anzeichen für die Einschränkungen, denen Machtlose unterliegen." —Ob Nixilis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217319&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c7fed8e-7ecb-4378-a0d9-b34cd81fb7cc\', \'multiverseId\': 217319}, \'multiverseid\': 217319}, {\'name\': \'Apetito demoníaco\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura que controlas.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +3/+3.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, sacrifica una criatura.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"La moralidad sirve como excusa a los que no tienen poder." —Ob Nixilis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217071&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48a886ae-5e96-40ea-ad9b-f32141b5bfe6\', \'multiverseId\': 217071}, \'multiverseid\': 217071}, {\'name\': \'Appétit démoniaque\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : une créature que vous contrôlez\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +3/+3.\\nAu début de votre entretien, sacrifiez une créature.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "« La moralité n\'est qu\'une excuse pour les contraintes de l\'impuissance. » —Ob Nixilis", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215583&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec37a2a6-ed3f-485e-bb33-ef8ade81b38e\', \'multiverseId\': 215583}, \'multiverseid\': 215583}, {\'name\': \'Appetito Demoniaco\', \'text\': "Incanta creatura che controlli\\nLa creatura incantata prende +3/+3.\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, sacrifica una creatura.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"La moralità è solo un eufemismo per le limitazioni dell\\\'essere impotenti." —Ob Nixilis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216327&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3378b3a-5d18-4975-a587-bcb71c9a183a\', \'multiverseId\': 216327}, \'multiverseid\': 216327}, {\'name\': \'悪魔の食欲\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋３/＋３の修整を受ける。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、クリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「品行など、無力となることへの我慢を手短に言ったものに過ぎぬ。」 ――オブ・ニクシリス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216575&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36aa0234-2d7a-438b-89d6-2dbe14ec26ff\', \'multiverseId\': 216575}, \'multiverseid\': 216575}, {\'name\': \'Apetite Demoníaco\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura que você controla\\nA criatura encantada recebe +3/+3.\\nNo início de sua manutenção, sacrifique uma criatura.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"A moralidade é apenas outro modo de expressar as limitações de ser impotente." — Ob Nixilis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216823&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1e60345-bece-4979-9e0b-68fd31924e59\', \'multiverseId\': 216823}, \'multiverseid\': 216823}, {\'name\': \'Дьявольский Аппетит\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо под вашим контролем\\nЗачарованное существо получает +3/+3.\\nВ начале вашего шага поддержки пожертвуйте существо.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'«Нравственность — это всего лишь условное обозначение ограничений, вызванных бессилием». — Об-Никсилис\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215831&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c8b81cb-aaf3-47ca-8b26-1ed26700b7bb\', \'multiverseId\': 215831}, \'multiverseid\': 215831}, {\'name\': \'恶魔胃口\', \'text\': \'结附于由你操控的生物\\n所结附的生物得+3/+3。\\n在你的维持开始时，牺牲一个生物。\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'「道德不过是夺力束缚的简写。」 ～欧尼希兹\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6313fb54-0abf-498f-a029-9b3ab197e50c\', \'multiverseId\': 216079}, \'multiverseid\': 216079}]', '[{\'name\': \'Düsternisjäger\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Fledermaus\', \'flavor\': \'Sowohl normale als auch magische Aasfresser folgen ihm und ernähren sich von den Fetzen von Fleisch und Seele, die er hinterlässt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217367&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8914a7c-1761-492f-be41-e5fca77fa0b6\', \'multiverseId\': 217367}, \'multiverseid\': 217367}, {\'name\': \'Cazador de penumbra\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Murciélago\', \'flavor\': \'Los carroñeros mundanos y mágicos seguían su rastro, alimentándose de los restos de carne y espíritus que dejaba tras de sí.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217119&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed6accba-3399-4536-9b1b-5f30d228f3a6\', \'multiverseId\': 217119}, \'multiverseid\': 217119}, {\'name\': \'Chasse-langueur\', \'text\': \'Vol\', \'type\': \'Créature : chauve-souris\', \'flavor\': "Les charognards les plus communs comme les plus magiques suivent son sillage pour se nourrir des déchets de chair et d\'esprit qu\'il laisse sur son passage.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215631&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18c7951a-6cad-4a97-8c4b-4fd05ee6e8a2\', \'multiverseId\': 215631}, \'multiverseid\': 215631}, {\'name\': \'Tetro Cacciatore\', \'text\': \'Volare\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Pipistrello\', \'flavor\': \'I mangiacarogne sia comuni che magici ne seguono la scia, nutrendosi degli avanzi di carne e spirito che si lascia alle spalle.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216375&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67d7d19d-00c5-4c03-af05-d4baabd10178\', \'multiverseId\': 216375}, \'multiverseid\': 216375}, {\'name\': \'薄暗狩り\', \'text\': \'飛行\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — コウモリ\', \'flavor\': \'その後ろにありふれた魔法を引きずるごみ漁りは、死体の肉やそれが残した魂を餌としている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab7d5d4a-fbe2-45f9-9fcd-ca01bd0eb2c7\', \'multiverseId\': 216623}, \'multiverseid\': 216623}, {\'name\': \'Caçador das Trevas\', \'text\': \'Voar\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Morcego\', \'flavor\': \'Necrófagos mundanos e mágicos seguem sua trilha, alimentando-se das migalhas de carne e espírito deixadas para trás.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216871&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3fef15c-5dd0-4faa-ad0f-79eb394ef56d\', \'multiverseId\': 216871}, \'multiverseid\': 216871}, {\'name\': \'Охотник Мрака\', \'text\': \'Полет\', \'type\': \'Существо — Летучая-мышь\', \'flavor\': \'За ним следуют и обычные, и магические падальщики, питаясь остатками плоти и духа, которые он оставляет позади.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215879&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'546a3b0b-41cd-4cee-a10d-bc0fda123e3b\', \'multiverseId\': 215879}, \'multiverseid\': 215879}, {\'name\': \'昏暗猎手\', \'text\': \'飞行\', \'type\': \'生物～蝙蝠\', \'flavor\': \'不论是肉身或法术创造的清理者，都会跟随其行迹，以他所留下的碎肉与灵魂为食。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=216127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa9293e9-0df3-4fff-925e-e271e69908fc\', \'multiverseId\': 216127}, \'multiverseid\': 216127}]', "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217525&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0a46af93-bcb1-47c6-a387-48e35661bb9f', 'multiverseId': 217525}, 'multiverseid': 217525}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=217277&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c26619b9-7441-482b-be38-5b8eeff57745', 'multiverseId': 217277}, 'multiverseid': 217277}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=215789&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '81